    rdfs:subClassOf <Oy1WTPF3RlWkCrJP4GTPKA> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises offices of legal practitioners known as lawyers or attorneys (i.e., counselors-at-law) primarily engaged in the practice of law. Establishments in this industry may provide expertise in a range or in specific areas of law, such as criminal law, corporate law, family and estate law, patent law, real estate law, or tax law." .

<HMqTmz8ERzm_xfXmdc6yWA> a owl:Class ;
