    skos:definition "This industry comprises civilian courts of law (except American Indian and Alaska Native tribal courts). Included in this industry are civilian courts, courts of law, and sheriffs' offices conducting court functions only." .

<HhR0ikJDSpCjZMSqWC1Uqg> a owl:Class ;
