    rdfs:subClassOf <438TzIwITPevnrDri1jZMg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) tanning, currying, and finishing hides and skins; (2) having others process hides and skins on a contract basis; and (3) dyeing or dressing furs." .

<IQEK2e2PQXCmXOShpQTpMA> a owl:Class ;
