    skos:definition "The tropical market segment encompasses consumers or businesses located in regions characterized by hot and humid climates, typically near the equator. Businesses targeting this segment often focus on products and services that cater to the unique needs of individuals living in tropical climates, such as cooling solutions, lightweight clothing, and sun protection products." ;
