<R1JCxSoGFz6WAdQbXNIwUa> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "13th Amendment Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7MGQ9xUx0PxGLp5yxprdpZ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Slavery Amendment Claim",
        "Anspruch auf den 13. Verfassungszusatz"@de-de,
        "13th Amendment Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamo de la Decimotercera Enmienda"@es-es,
        "Reclamo de la Decimotercera Enmienda"@es-mx,
        "Réclamation fondée sur le 13ème amendement"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת התיקון השלישי עשר"@he-il,
        "13वीं संशोधन दावा"@hi-in,
        "13条修正案の主張"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação da 13ª Emenda"@pt-br,
        "第十三修正案索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Slavery Amendment claim is a legal assertion pertaining to the Thirteenth Amendment of the United States Constitution, which abolished slavery and involuntary servitude, except as punishment for a crime. This amendment represents a fundamental change in the nation's legal and social framework. A claim involving this amendment could arise in cases involving forced labor, human trafficking, or other situations where an individual's freedom is unjustly restricted or exploited." .

<R1L3IueMeHCrxnDlOU2dRg> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "folio:opposed" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf <R7VtpAC807aOYLVtKmPvFRt> ;
    skos:altLabel "contested",
        "disputed",
        "folio:contested",
        "opposed" ;
    skos:definition "In the context of an argument, \"opposed\" refers to the stance taken against a particular claim, assertion, or position. An opposed argument counters or refutes the original claim by presenting contrary evidence, reasoning, or viewpoints. In debates or discussions, this oppositional stance is vital for ensuring a comprehensive exploration of the topic at hand." ;
    skos:prefLabel "folio:disputed" .

