        "Violação da garantia implícita de adequação para um fim específico"@pt-br,
        "针对特定目的的默示保证违约"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Breach of Implied Warranty of Fitness for a Particular Purpose refers to a violation of an implied promise made by a seller to a buyer that a product is suitable for a specific use, resulting in harm or damages to the buyer." .

<R1qJYzfDgItVe7PR0aZNfD> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Blessed Are the Meek" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDS4ZvoTuxk7hu7zuyJRyoR> ;
    skos:altLabel "Third Beatitude"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Blessed Are the Meek means the beatitude in which Jesus Christ declares blessed those who exercise gentleness, humility, and restrained strength rather than domination or violence. Blessed Are the Meek promises inheritance of the earth to those who entrust themselves to God’s justice."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Christian theology interprets meekness as strength governed by humility and trust in God."^^xsd:string,
        "The Gospel of Matthew records Jesus proclaiming, “Blessed are the meek, for they shall inherit the earth.”"^^xsd:string .

