<R54swe946hCCJQs9jVUwPp> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Personal Jurisdiction by Long-Arm Statute" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7X4vuBVsbGf69DAu7Xotdw> ;
    skos:altLabel "Persönliche Gerichtsbarkeit durch Long-Arm-Statut"@de-de,
        "Personal Jurisdiction by Long-Arm Statute"@en-gb,
        "Jurisdicción personal por estatuto de brazo largo"@es-es,
        "Jurisdicción personal por estatuto de brazo largo"@es-mx,
        "Juridiction personnelle par statut de bras long"@fr-fr,
        "שיפוט אישי על ידי חוק זרוע ארוכה"@he-il,
        "लॉन्ग-आर्म अधिनियम द्वारा व्यक्तिगत अधिकरण"@hi-in,
        "ロングアーム法による個人管轄権"@ja-jp,
        "Jurisdição pessoal por estatuto de braço longo"@pt-br,
        "长臂法令下的个人管辖权"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Personal Jurisdiction by Long-Arm Statute refers to the authority of a court to exercise jurisdiction over a defendant who is not physically present within the court's territorial boundaries, but who has sufficient minimum contacts with the forum state as specified by the state's long-arm statute." .

