        "Reivindicação de cláusula de disposição"@pt-br,
        "处置条款索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Disposing Clause claim refers to a legal argument based on a disposing clause within a legal document, such as a contract or will, asserting the authority or power granted to dispose of property or assets. It focuses on interpreting and applying the specific language or provision that governs the distribution, transfer, or allocation of rights or interests in the document." .

