<R73uN7kP1iXmj2AOvXW2sl3> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Time Limitation of Public Benefit" ;
    rdfs:comment "From LIST: Legal Issues Taxonomy — https://taxonomy.legal/" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R79ZRcChNA1jEORJLsPWYSv> ;
    skos:definition "Time limitation of public benefit refers to a policy that restricts the duration for which an individual or family can receive financial assistance or services from a specific public benefit program. This is designed to encourage recipients to become self-sufficient and reduce long-term dependency on government aid." .

<R73uTlrSoALybiLK0Kocj4w> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Pheasants" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7xpf80TbUte15aQuYy4a12> ;
    skos:definition "Pheasants are a group of large, colorful birds belonging to the family Phasianidae, often raised for their meat, ornamental value, and hunting purposes. Known for their striking plumage and game bird status, pheasants are commonly found in agricultural and wild settings, contributing to both culinary and recreational activities." .

