<R76KdDhigCVDjvgbvhnxNDf> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Analysis" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDmbgHQXJxEvx3QYfR6qWAn> ;
    skos:altLabel "Critical Analysis"^^xsd:string,
        "Doctrinal Analysis"^^xsd:string,
        "Exegetical Analysis"^^xsd:string,
        "Scholarly Analysis"^^xsd:string,
        "Theological Analysis"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Analysis is a systematic examination of a text, concept, or practice that breaks it into components to understand meaning, structure, or implications. In Catholic contexts, analysis supports clarity, critique, and interpretation without itself constituting magisterial teaching."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "A historical-critical analysis of the Council of Trent."^^xsd:string,
        "A scholarly analysis of Romans 5."^^xsd:string,
        "A systematic analysis of sacramental theology."^^xsd:string .

<R76RHEQOV5lf5HrdZ6uL0sf> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bias" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8jYAnNATrfoBxAtIKpf72X> ;
    skos:definition "Bias refers to a preconceived opinion or inclination that affects an individual's ability to make fair, objective, and impartial judgments. In a legal context, bias can compromise the fairness of legal proceedings and may be grounds for disqualification of an Actor (e.g., juror, witness, prosecutor, judge)." .

<R76SBh2sN45UoKUS5e9vfzm> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Real Estate Broker's Liability to Purchaser for Intentional Nondisclosure of Material Facts" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCxfiZzG4dF6wN0pVL57OS>,
        <RDp8cEr3KYyVDenm1P9ejdx> ;
    skos:altLabel "Haftung des Immobilienmaklers gegenüber dem Käufer für die vorsätzliche Nichtoffenlegung wesentlicher Tatsachen"@de-de,
        "Real Estate Broker's Liability to Purchaser for Intentional Nondisclosure of Material Facts"@en-gb,
        "Responsabilidad del corredor de bienes raíces hacia el comprador por la no divulgación intencional de hechos materiales"@es-es,
        "Responsabilidad del corredor de bienes raíces hacia el comprador por la no divulgación intencional de hechos materiales"@es-mx,
        "Responsabilité du courtier immobilier envers l'acheteur pour non-divulgation intentionnelle de faits matériels"@fr-fr,
        "אחריות המתווך הנדלן לקונה על חשיפה מכוונת של עובדות חומריות"@he-il,
        "मूल्यवान तथ्यों के जानबूझकर अनभिवकरण के लिए रियल एस्टेट ब्रोकर की जिम्मेदारी खरीदार के प्रति"@hi-in,
        "重要事実の故意的な非開示に対する不動産ブローカーの購入者への責任"@ja-jp,
        "Responsabilidade do corretor de imóveis para o comprador por omissão intencional de fatos materiais"@pt-br,
        "房地产经纪人故意不披露重要事实对购房者的责任"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Real Estate Broker's Liability to Purchaser for Intentional Nondisclosure of Material Facts: The legal responsibility of a real estate broker to a purchaser for intentionally withholding important information about a property that would have affected the purchaser's decision to buy, and the resulting legal claims that may be brought against the broker for such actions." .

