    skos:definition "Article is a discrete, numbered textual unit within a structured doctrinal, legal, or catechetical work that presents a distinct topic or norm. It organizes content for systematic treatment and precise citation."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Code of Canon Law, Book II, Article 204."^^xsd:string,
