<R7ItETKZAfykvNgICh5RBN4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Chronic Bronchitis" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8D6zCNSxUO8g0ZstLxnK28> ;
    skos:altLabel "Chronic Cough",
        "Chronic Mucous Bronchitis",
        "Persistent Bronchitis" ;
    skos:definition "Chronic bronchitis is a type of Chronic Obstructive Pulmonary Disease (COPD) characterized by persistent inflammation of the bronchial tubes, leading to a chronic cough and production of mucus over a period of at least three months per year for two consecutive years. This condition results in narrowed airways and impaired airflow, causing difficulty in breathing and frequent respiratory infections." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Long-Term Bronchial Inflammation" .

<R7ItJL7sTHMRx2i7WbPxnik> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Geese" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7xpf80TbUte15aQuYy4a12> ;
    skos:definition "Geese are domesticated waterfowl belonging to the genus Anser and Branta, commonly raised for their meat, eggs, feathers, and down. Known for their grazing habits and strong flocking instincts, geese are often utilized in agriculture for weeding and as guard animals, as well as for their high-quality meat and egg production." .

<R7IyL6dp9k9JuIaKGhPcczR> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fishing License" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R98LwwW6Zozu5EHwFgpns7> ],
        <R9zyvDXyYEEyM7dTnON56uL> ;
    skos:definition "A fishing license is an official permit issued by a governing authority that allows individuals to legally catch fish in specific bodies of water during certain times. The purpose of such licenses is to regulate and conserve fish populations, ensuring sustainable practices. To acquire a fishing license, individuals usually pay a fee, and in some jurisdictions, they might also need to complete an educational course or adhere to certain regulations, such as bag and size limits." .

