        "Kikuyu; Gikuyu"@fr-fr,
        "キクユ語"@ja-jp,
        "Kikuyu; Gikuyu"@pt-br,
        "吉库尤语"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Bantu language spoken primarily in Kenya by the Kikuyu people, characterized by its use of prefixes and suffixes to indicate tense, mood, and subject." .

<R7ZUD4AC5YHqLtlGhBqc2Ti> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fiduciary Relationship" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RtmRdqzdG4lddVrtCToiL1> ;
    skos:altLabel "Treuhänderische Beziehung"@de-de,
        "Fiduciary Relationship"@en-gb,
        "Relación fiduciaria"@es-es,
        "Relación fiduciaria"@es-mx,
        "Relation fiduciaire"@fr-fr,
        "קשר פידוציארי"@he-il,
        "फिडुशियरी रिलेशनशिप"@hi-in,
        "信託関係"@ja-jp,
        "Relação fiduciária"@pt-br,
        "受托人关系"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A fiduciary relationship is a legal relationship in which one party is entrusted with the care and management of another party's assets or interests, and is obligated to act in the best interests of the other party, with loyalty, honesty, and good faith." .

<R7ZaU5VfaJgXoZ6mCMOGbp7> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Information Management Risk" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.canada.ca/en/treasury-board-secretariat/corporate/risk-management/taxonomies.html> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RxTxaN981tLTsN82qPBcp> ;
    skos:definition "The threats and opportunities associated with an organization's capacity and sustainability of information management procedures and practices — including the potential for negative outcomes resulting from an organization's inability to effectively collect, store, process, and protect its data and information assets. This can stem from poor data quality, outdated systems, inadequate data security measures, or noncompliance with data protection regulations, potentially leading to data breaches, or legal liabilities, ultimately affecting the organization's performance." .

<R7ZbV4IDYgaCLaamhpVcFpl> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Expungement" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCRVBAzI4EaLARuVLhgDBTB> ;
    skos:definition "Expungement is the legal process through which an arrest or conviction is removed from an individual's criminal record, effectively sealing or erasing it from public view. Once expunged, the individual typically does not need to disclose the arrest or conviction in most situations, such as during employment background checks, and it is as though the event never occurred in the eyes of the law." .

<R7Zfa5zKmebxoYJBZqiOQYq> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Full-Time Employee" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBY4j5UKZ7L8gp0q9Wrxyge> ;
    skos:definition "A Full-Time Employee is an individual who works a minimum number of hours specified by their employer or by labor laws, often at least 35 to 40 hours per week. This classification usually comes with benefits such as health insurance, paid time off, and retirement plans, which may not be available to part-time or contract workers" .

<R7ZkEwFlNJhzaSONYM8lfAH> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Crohn's Disease" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8THIhCQDpX9BgtDhsfKsQ5> ;
    skos:altLabel "Crohn Disease",
        "Regional Enteritis" ;
    skos:definition "Crohn's disease is a chronic inflammatory condition of the gastrointestinal (GI) tract, which can affect any part from the mouth to the anus, though it most commonly impacts the small intestine and colon. The disease is characterized by transmural inflammation, which can lead to complications such as strictures, fistulas, and abscesses, and typically requires ongoing medical management and sometimes surgical intervention." .

<R7ZkNJG1bjbIM1LMVfoa98> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Pleasure" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBw3WR4CSREciBCYef3H9wI> ;
    skos:altLabel "Enjoyment"^^xsd:string,
        "Human Delight"^^xsd:string,
        "Psychological Pleasure"^^xsd:string,
        "Satisfaction"^^xsd:string,
        "Sensory Pleasure"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Pleasure is the ethical principle that recognizes enjoyment or satisfaction as a genuine human good arising from the fulfillment of natural desires. Pleasure requires moral ordering by reason so that it serves human flourishing rather than undermining virtue or dignity."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Pleasure accompanies a shared meal enjoyed in moderation and gratitude."^^xsd:string,
        "Pleasure becomes disordered when sought without regard for dignity or moral limits."^^xsd:string,
        "Pleasure motivates rest and recreation that restore the person for work and service."^^xsd:string,
        "Pleasure requires temperance to remain integrated with reason and virtue."^^xsd:string,
        "Pleasure supports learning when intellectual curiosity brings delight in truth."^^xsd:string .

<R7ZouJ8WES1J06md808zLqB> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Paucatuck Eastern Pequot" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG> .

<R7a6AnAyIMbylU9ZMRLwNuZ> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "oasis:hasActor" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf <RCtXcXKz9zo5jk9QW5UpTyg> .

<R7aOV3ldC5GVaSOcGua7Nqs> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Expired Parking Violation" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBuYThXwp8tJjNWkTeuFvAZ> ;
    skos:definition "This occurs when a vehicle is parked in a regulated space beyond the time limit indicated on a parking meter or permit. The violation is typically enforced through a citation and fine issued by parking enforcement officers." .

<R7aPdNazR2TDAE03Nhekjx> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Meal Break" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RGK6KYY8XqLTyeigvEAIOg> ;
    skos:definition "A \"Meal Break\" is a period of time during the workday, typically lasting 30 minutes to an hour, in which employees are allowed to stop working and have a meal. This break is often unpaid and is intended to provide employees with the opportunity to eat and recharge." .

<R7aTogftBWxHCdIJBM31Q3X> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "School Liability Claims" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBREngQZS9QIgeWCOMPBLIo> ;
    skos:altLabel "Ansprüche wegen Schulhaftung"@de-de,
        "School Liability Claims"@en-gb,
        "Reclamaciones de responsabilidad escolar"@es-es,
        "Demandas de responsabilidad escolar"@es-mx,
        "Réclamations de responsabilité scolaire"@fr-fr,
        "תביעות אחריות בבתי ספר"@he-il,
        "स्कूल दायित्व दावे"@hi-in,
        "学校の責任請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicações de responsabilidade escolar"@pt-br,
        "学校责任索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "School Liability Claims: Legal claims brought against educational institutions for damages or injuries caused by the institution's negligence or failure to provide a safe environment for students." .

<R7ad12pe2psHapASxpXGsk1> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bronchiectasis" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/3.00-Respiratory-Adult.htm#3_07> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8D6zCNSxUO8g0ZstLxnK28> ;
    skos:altLabel "Abnormal Bronchial Dilation",
        "Bronchial Dilation",
        "Persistent Bronchial Expansion" ;
    skos:definition "Bronchiectasis is a chronic respiratory condition characterized by abnormal and permanent dilation of the bronchial tubes, leading to impaired mucus clearance, chronic cough, and frequent respiratory infections. This condition results from damage to the airway walls, which can be caused by a variety of factors, including infections, genetic disorders, and autoimmune diseases." .

<R7afrfWXgffBUFBsbsa0E6Z> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Negative Commerce Clause Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RwipRpN2mP7u4u1N74MVzK> ;
    skos:altLabel "Klage wegen Verletzung des negativen Handelsklausel"@de-de,
        "Negative Commerce Clause Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamo de la Cláusula de Comercio Negativo"@es-es,
        "Reclamo de la Cláusula de Comercio Negativo"@es-mx,
        "Réclamation de clause de commerce négative"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת סעיף המסחר השלילי"@he-il,
        "नकारात्मक वाणिज्य अनुबंध दावा"@hi-in,
        "ネガティブ商業条項クレーム"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação de cláusula de comércio negativa"@pt-br,
        "负面商业条款索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Negative Commerce Clause claim is a legal argument asserting that a state law or regulation violates the United States Constitution by unduly burdening or discriminating against interstate commerce, even in the absence of federal legislation. This claim is based on the interpretation that the Negative Commerce Clause prohibits states from imposing unreasonable barriers on interstate trade and commerce, thereby ensuring a free and fair flow of goods and services between states." .

<R7ahfB1BbtNvve47RAqswqA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Blacklisting Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCty0MaQzrLC9KnzjM7nMER> ;
    skos:altLabel "Schwarze-Liste-Anspruch"@de-de,
        "Blacklisting Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamación de inclusión en lista negra"@es-es,
        "Reclamación de inclusión en lista negra"@es-mx,
        "Réclamation de liste noire"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת רישום ברשימה שחורה"@he-il,
        "काली सूची दावा"@hi-in,
        "ブラックリストクレーム"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação de lista negra"@pt-br,
        "黑名单索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A blacklisting claim refers to a legal action taken by an individual or entity who alleges they have been unfairly prevented from obtaining employment, services, or opportunities due to being placed on a \"blacklist.\" A blacklist is an unofficial list of persons or entities that are deemed undesirable or untrustworthy, resulting in exclusion from certain opportunities or associations." .

<R7athlXhsUuRtg7LvK0uUaF> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Medical Malpractice" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8nVhrBlasGIc7jxw1D0vbm> ;
    skos:altLabel "Ärztliche Kunstfehler"@de-de,
        "Medical Negligence"@en-gb,
        "Negligencia Médica"@es-es,
        "Negligencia Médica"@es-mx,
        "Faute professionnelle médicale"@fr-fr,
        "שגיאה רפואית"@he-il,
        "चिकित्सा लापरवाही"@hi-in,
        "医療過誤"@ja-jp,
        "Negligência médica"@pt-br,
        "医疗事故责任"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Medical Malpractice: Negligence or breach of duty by a healthcare professional that results in harm or injury to a patient." .

<R7azvKC8RwopK0ecoTMqfH1> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Presumption of Innocence" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RfP04tDTTpn4LDvwAxAqkh> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBoDiMryDOIE3XWHl6qgL3y> ],
        <RBQRg4Bv481hOyPBNKLCj8m> ;
    skos:altLabel "Unschuldsvermutung"@de-de,
        "Presumption of Innocence"@en-gb,
        "Presunción de Inocencia"@es-es,
        "Presunción de Inocencia"@es-mx,
        "Présomption d'innocence"@fr-fr,
        "הנחת התפיסה של האפליה"@he-il,
        "निर्दोषता का पूर्वाभास"@hi-in,
        "無罪推定"@ja-jp,
        "Presunção de inocência"@pt-br,
        "无罪推定"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The presumption of innocence is a fundamental principle of criminal law that assumes an accused person is innocent until proven guilty. This cornerstone of the justice system places the burden of proof on the prosecution, requiring them to present sufficient evidence to convince a judge or jury of the defendant's guilt, and helps ensure that individuals are not unfairly convicted without proper evidence or due process." .

<R7bR4JuUnFZwFzMrQbRuvJq> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Georgia District Court - Bryan County" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBxw7BF15bDA0Ifn2vOrC8h> ;
    skos:definition "Georgia District Court - Bryan County: A court of law in the state of Georgia that has jurisdiction over legal cases and disputes specifically within Bryan County." .

<R7bZqwOPufVYSnVkmLzCTlP> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Entrapment" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RkbIrzj6HiYQSEnDLqeHsh> ;
    skos:altLabel "Government Coercion",
        "Police Inducement" ;
    skos:definition "Entrapment is a defense in criminal law where the defendant argues that law enforcement induced them to commit a crime they would not have otherwise committed. This defense is used to prevent the conviction of individuals who were coerced into illegal activities by police or government agents." .

<R7bgNaAADYGryTZSNn3xNAt> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Lovelock Paiute Tribe of the Lovelock Indian Colony, Nevada" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG> .

<R7bi51LW0xVy9L9F3gpVV8l> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Business Ethics" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R740KsX4ol3KSiJ2DHXcsGL> ;
    skos:altLabel "Commercial Ethics"^^xsd:string,
        "Corporate Ethics"^^xsd:string,
        "Economic Ethics"^^xsd:string,
        "Ethics of Business Practice"^^xsd:string,
        "Organizational Ethics"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Business Ethics is the field of applied ethics that examines moral principles governing commercial activity, corporate behavior, and economic decision-making. Business Ethics evaluates how enterprises pursue profit while respecting human dignity, justice, and the common good."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Business ethics evaluates whether pricing practices exploit vulnerable consumers."^^xsd:string,
        "Business ethics guides employers in providing just wages and safe working conditions."^^xsd:string,
        "Business ethics informs decisions about environmental responsibility in production."^^xsd:string,
        "Business ethics restrains profit-seeking that undermines human dignity or social trust."^^xsd:string,
        "Business ethics shapes corporate policies on honesty in marketing and advertising."^^xsd:string .

<R7bnear7qteTICuLSkSZc0K> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Collateral Estoppel" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7l492OzFfZUEluIFBwy3xI>,
        <RCzs34uEQI9f4cuWp3bQO0P> ;
    skos:altLabel "Kollaterale Estoppel"@de-de,
        "Collateral Estoppel"@en-gb,
        "Cosa Juzgada"@es-es,
        "Efecto de Cosa Juzgada"@es-mx,
        "Préclusion"@fr-fr,
        "אפקט דבר נכר"@he-il,
        "सहायक अधिकार"@hi-in,
        "コラテラル・エストッペル"@ja-jp,
        "Estoppel por litispendência"@pt-br,
        "抵制权"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Collateral Estoppel is a legal doctrine that prevents a party from relitigating an issue that has already been decided in a previous case, even if the parties and legal theories are different." .

<R7bp4W5Isy3M9JAsztDsVic> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Contact City" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "From LEDES (Legal Electronic Data Exchange Standard). https://ledes.org/" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8QBuMoK1uPFeLW0sg40CdA> ;
    skos:altLabel "Contact Town",
        "Kontaktstadt"@de-de,
        "Contact City"@en-gb,
        "Ciudad de Contacto"@es-es,
        "Ciudad de Contacto"@es-mx,
        "Ville de contact"@fr-fr,
        "עיר איש קשר"@he-il,
        "संपर्क शहर"@hi-in,
        "コンタクトシティ"@ja-jp,
        "Cidade de contato"@pt-br,
        "联系城市"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Contact City refers to the city where a person or entity can be reached and is a subcategory of Contact Information in the context of Engagement Terms for providing legal services." .

<R7btd1Kfxl5GzUMaBVEx4vc> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Dependent Personality Disorder" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/12.00-MentalDisorders-Adult.htm#12_00B1> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCnCHWsREqpfQAAfaN2lRPV> ;
    skos:definition "Dependent Personality Disorder is characterized by a pervasive and excessive need to be taken care of, leading to submissive and clinging behaviors and fears of separation. Individuals with this disorder have difficulty making independent decisions and rely heavily on others for emotional and practical support." .

<R7bx4TKEqYyz5TZM0rx3Lgs> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Illinois Circuit Court - Crawford County (2nd Circuit Court)" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCtUZjZqZ1lszDFiDOLUuTh> .

<R7bzhpuW6wVk2sRkYb3Us4o> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Employment Misclassification Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9UYGSnWQz2MvNsWUofGb6J> ;
    skos:altLabel "Klage wegen falscher Einstufung als Selbstständiger"@de-de,
        "Employment Misclassification Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamación de clasificación errónea de empleo"@es-es,
        "Reclamo de clasificación errónea de empleo"@es-mx,
        "Réclamation de classification erronée de l'emploi"@fr-fr,
        "תביעה על טעות בסיווג העסקה"@he-il,
        "रोजगार गलत वर्गीकरण दावा"@hi-in,
        "雇用の誤分類請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação de classificação incorreta de emprego"@pt-br,
        "就业错分类索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "An employment misclassification claim is a legal action initiated by an employee who alleges that their employer has improperly classified them as an independent contractor, rather than an employee. The claim typically arises when an employer misclassifies an employee to avoid providing benefits or complying with certain employment laws, such as minimum wage and overtime requirements. Employees who are misclassified may be entitled to back wages, benefits, and other compensation." .

<R7c1yU31BO5LWM06a7c0Pfd> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Some Evidence" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDV74m3ydS2I72hZ88Mf1RX> ;
    skos:altLabel "Einige Beweise"@de-de,
        "Some Evidence"@en-gb,
        "Alguna evidencia"@es-es,
        "Alguna evidencia"@es-mx,
        "Certaines preuves"@fr-fr,
        "חלק מהראיות"@he-il,
        "कुछ सबूत"@hi-in,
        "いくつかの証拠"@ja-jp,
        "Algumas evidências"@pt-br,
        "一些证据"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Some Evidence refers to any type of proof or information presented in a legal case that supports one party's argument or position, and falls under the burden of proof required in litigation." .

<R7c3W8aJ9ioW0cUmHmSP7RL> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "White Mountain Apache Tribe of the Fort Apache Reservation, Arizona" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG> .

<R7c3kyqYBWFm2mNaEiUdb7r> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Employment Mandatory Training" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCcONOqbeZp3iIDXbl7spOT>,
        <RvITJ74ynBH2zCNG0vfksY> ;
    skos:altLabel "Required Training" ;
    skos:definition "Employment Mandatory Training is a compulsory educational program required by an employer to address specific skills, knowledge gaps, or compliance issues among employees. This training aims to improve performance, ensure adherence to company policies, or meet legal and regulatory requirements." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Compulsory Training" .

<R7c5xnS2tbutTeFZrfsypMr> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "New York Civil Court - New York County" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RyP4THD1q0s9GhYijVhWuf> ;
    skos:definition "A court located in New York County that handles civil legal matters." .

<R7cBAgQ53gd6navi7S47smv> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Jesus' Healing of the Woman with the Hemorrhage" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBpseS3fO7sq2jPuFJjJRzq> ;
    skos:altLabel "Healing of the Hemorrhaging Woman by Jesus"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Jesus’ Healing of the Woman with the Hemorrhage means the miraculous act by which Jesus Christ healed a woman suffering from a chronic flow of blood when she touched his garment in faith. Jesus’ Healing of the Woman with the Hemorrhage reveals Christ’s power to heal, his response to faith, and the restoration of human dignity."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Act of Faith in Touching Jesus’ Garment"^^xsd:string,
        "Christian theology reflects on the healing of the woman with the hemorrhage as a testimony to faith and mercy."^^xsd:string,
        "Public Acknowledgment of the Healing"^^xsd:string,
        "The Gospels recount a woman being healed when she touched the hem of Jesus’ garment."^^xsd:string .

<R7cGsSzKeAR0zJXzFLPOdd9> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Indiana Superior Court - Jay County" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7uq2Mq8qLUybQoDhVczzZ5> ;
    skos:definition "The Indiana Superior Court - Jay County is a specific court within the Indiana Superior Court system that has jurisdiction over cases within Jay County, Indiana." .

<R7cJI8Stq7R6C0nx2kNnQDY> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Tolowa" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG> .

<R7cJmHQvy1P8kH5YhL3zhdi> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Tuition Reimbursement" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7obzFRN58WoEDO4rf137uE> ;
    skos:definition "Tuition reimbursement refers to a company benefit in which an employer pays back employees for the costs associated with furthering their education, typically for courses or degree programs that are relevant to their current or potential future roles within the company. This benefit often has specific terms, such as grade requirements or staying with the company for a certain period after course completion." .

<R7cJxMJn6lAOHm1nNAxW9RP> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Failure to Provide Notice" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCzs34uEQI9f4cuWp3bQO0P> ;
    skos:altLabel "Unterlassung der Benachrichtigung"@de-de,
        "Failure to Provide Notice"@en-gb,
        "Falta de notificación"@es-es,
        "Incumplimiento de aviso"@es-mx,
        "Défaut de notification"@fr-fr,
        "כשל בספק הודעה"@he-il,
        "सूचना न देने की असफलता"@hi-in,
        "通知の不履行"@ja-jp,
        "Falha em fornecer aviso"@pt-br,
        "未提供通知"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The failure of a party to provide proper notification or warning as required by law or contract, which may be used as a defense in civil litigation." .

<R7cNZxZB8pyyRYwDBimKNJj> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Telephone Consumer Protection Act Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9LVBKjvGRuzwgtlhuLST36> ;
    skos:altLabel "TCPA",
        "Anspruch nach dem Telephone Consumer Protection Act"@de-de,
        "Telephone Consumer Protection Act Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamo de la Ley de Protección al Consumidor de Telecomunicaciones"@es-es,
        "Reclamo de la Ley de Protección al Consumidor de Telecomunicaciones"@es-mx,
        "Réclamation en vertu du Telephone Consumer Protection Act"@fr-fr,
        "תביעה על פי חוק הגנת הצרכן בתחום הטלקומוניקציות"@he-il,
        "टेलीफोन उपभोक्ता संरक्षण अधिनियम दावा"@hi-in,
        "電話消費者保護法クレーム"@ja-jp,
        "Reclamação de acordo com a Lei de Proteção ao Consumidor de Telefonia"@pt-br,
        "《电话消费者保护法》索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Telephone Consumer Protection Act (TCPA) Claim is a legal claim made under the TCPA statute, which prohibits certain telemarketing practices and provides consumers with certain rights related to unwanted phone calls and text messages." .

<R7cYu4qJbywhjHFU1Ic441L> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Outperformance Certificate" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R2Kr3kWHR9cR4zALXqt1nM> ;
    skos:altLabel "An Outperformance Certificate, also known as a Leveraged ETF, is a financial instrument that allows disproportionate participation in the positive performance of the underlying asset(s) above a certain strike level. These certificates reflect the underlying price movements 1:1, adjusted by the conversion ratio and any related fees, offering a risk profile comparable to direct investment in the underlying asset(s) but with enhanced potential returns in favorable market conditions.",
        "Leveraged Certificate" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Leveraged ETF",
        "Leveraged Exchange Traded Fund" .

<R7cfF9aK4pAFRk8d1pKJ984> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Joint and Several Liability" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9b5fs8QJuliSZYeaJLJU2t> ;
    skos:altLabel "Gesamtschuldnerische Haftung"@de-de,
        "Joint and Several Liability"@en-gb,
        "Responsabilidad solidaria"@es-es,
        "Responsabilidad solidaria"@es-mx,
        "Responsabilité solidaire"@fr-fr,
        "אחריות משותפת ופרטית"@he-il,
        "संयुक्त और एकमात्र उत्तरदायित्व"@hi-in,
        "連帯責任"@ja-jp,
        "Responsabilidade solidária"@pt-br,
        "连带责任"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Joint and Several Liability is a legal concept where multiple parties can be held responsible for the same damages or debt, and each party can be held liable for the entire amount." .

<R7cllbBtOmXjbDB7XTyebg2> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Livestock Farmland" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDlUNUSYsLydg1YtgDPDCk5> ;
    skos:altLabel "Grazing Land" ;
    skos:definition "Livestock Farmland pertains to designated agricultural areas used for rearing animals. Legal issues often concern animal welfare laws, property rights, leasing agreements, and related environmental regulations." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Pasture" .

<R7cs1OO5PZ7pxIspMZfGI5q> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Student's Dependent Visa" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBe8WASOOp24Pw0SKparbSV> ],
        <RBVXMCXoBW3Ef1c3VUuU84a> ;
    skos:altLabel "F-2 Visa"@en-us ;
    skos:definition "A Student's Dependent Visa is a specialized visa category that allows the spouse and dependent children of a student visa holder to accompany them to the host country while they pursue their studies. Depending on the country's immigration policies, dependents may be allowed to work or study to a limited extent, but the primary purpose of their stay is to reside with the student visa holder." .

<R7cwZdGnY26jz3hPtFTS2DU> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Secrecy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R8AskLnQPiMPqirI390zrab> ],
        <R9m8Wz6rX8oJIJfhFFncV5x> ;
    skos:altLabel "Geheimhaltung"@de-de,
        "Secrecy"@en-gb,
        "Secretismo"@es-es,
        "Secretismo"@es-mx,
        "Secret"@fr-fr,
        "סוֹדִיוּת"@he-il,
        "गोपनीयता"@hi-in,
        "秘密保持"@ja-jp,
        "Sigilo"@pt-br,
        "保密"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Secrecy refers to the legal defense strategy of withholding information or evidence from the opposing party in a legal matter, typically to protect confidential or privileged information." .

<R7d1uW4I7MDTD3WZg9ITbWh> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Blessed Are Those Persecuted for Righteousness" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDS4ZvoTuxk7hu7zuyJRyoR> ;
    skos:altLabel "Eighth Beatitude"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Blessed Are Those Persecuted for Righteousness means the beatitude in which Jesus Christ declares blessed those who suffer opposition, exclusion, or violence because of their fidelity to God’s justice and truth. Blessed Are Those Persecuted for Righteousness promises the Kingdom of heaven to those who endure suffering for faithfulness to God."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Christian theology interprets this beatitude as a call to faithful endurance in the face of opposition."^^xsd:string,
        "The Gospel of Matthew records Jesus proclaiming, “Blessed are those who are persecuted for righteousness’ sake, for theirs is the Kingdom of heaven.”"^^xsd:string .

<R7d4mcNjgBosSzJeS9zgSLG> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bladder Cancer" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/13.00-NeoplasticDiseases-Malignant-Adult.htm#13_22> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDF3VrmH1eapfkrSQstevLs> ;
    skos:altLabel "Bladder Carcinoma",
        "Bladder cancer is a type of cancer that starts in the cells of the bladder, the organ responsible for storing urine. It often presents with symptoms such as blood in the urine and requires treatments including surgery, chemotherapy, radiation therapy, and immunotherapy.",
        "Urothelial Cancer" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Urinary Bladder Cancer" .

<R7d6ePt6NeHR2HSsVArPLvn> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Annelids" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCBYQBHCTDnnpanK0HJ0I7w> ;
    skos:definition "Annelids are a phylum of invertebrate animals known as Annelida, characterized by their segmented bodies and a true coelom, which acts as a hydrostatic skeleton. This group includes earthworms, leeches, and polychaetes, and they play vital roles in soil aeration and aquatic ecosystems." .

<R7d7C1AWWGwLTzQyqjLdwn> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Viejas (Baron Long) Group of the Capitan Grande Band" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG> .

<R7d7zHvvqebdTDIDyRnp0Gs> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Georgia Magistrate Court - Lowndes County" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBer5GFHRhnNksxEa5AOQ6i> ;
    skos:definition "A court in Lowndes County, Georgia that has limited jurisdiction over certain civil and criminal cases." .

<R7d8gxYFiDIcnalCApKnt5F> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "NATO-3 Visa" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDeH9slXtJOmFPiZhIzsDUg> ;
    skos:altLabel "International Military Alliance Clerical Staff Visa",
        "NATO Assistant Visa",
        "NATO Support Staff Visa" ;
    skos:definition "A NATO-3 visa is issued to official clerical staff accompanying a NATO-1 visa holder, allowing them to enter the U.S. to perform their duties. This visa category includes support staff essential for the operation of NATO-1 personnel." ;
    skos:prefLabel "NATO Clerical Staff Visa" .

<R7dIoqwvQvmYE03eXBHmcO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Adjustment of Status Pending" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8N4pMIOhTNbqcmDczSephq> ;
    skos:altLabel "AOS Pending",
        "In immigration law, \"Adjustment of Status Pending\" refers to the interim period during which an individual's application to adjust their immigration status, often from a non-immigrant to an immigrant status (permanent resident), is under review by the immigration authorities (e.g., U.S. Citizenship and Immigration Services (USCIS)). During this time, the applicant is generally authorized to remain in the destination country (e.g., U.S.) and may be eligible for work authorization and other interim benefits while awaiting a final decision" .

<R7dRBB6fzEje3xDDZLOaE3h> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Jicarilla Apache Nation" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1ceWXE3emNHpYlrOvvmxG> .

<R7dZ8IaQU3YMk3JJaQyK66C> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Chalkyitsik Village" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7N6wsHsNyqgPE4xFK8wKJx> .

<R7daiW2MzSyRcvSJWU5na3T> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Human Resources Management Risk" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.canada.ca/en/treasury-board-secretariat/corporate/risk-management/taxonomies.html> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RxTxaN981tLTsN82qPBcp> ;
    skos:definition "The threats and opportunities associated with staff/management turnover; employment/work culture; recruitment, retention and staffing processes and practices; succession planning and talent management; and employee development, training, and capacity building. It also includes the potential for negative consequences arising from an organization's ineffective or inefficient handling of its workforce-related policies, practices, and processes. This can result from poor recruitment, inadequate training, weak retention strategies, or insufficient attention to employee satisfaction and development, potentially leading to reduced productivity, and increased turnover, ultimately impacting the organization's overall performance." .

<R7dfOE4uDkhuyr8mme8oOqo> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Hidden Assets Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RCIwc6WJi6IT7xePURxsi4T> ],
        <RCUXzL8Z4Ddh2CK6TBhofjU> ;
    skos:definition "A Hidden Assets Claim is a legal action taken during divorce proceedings when one spouse suspects that the other spouse is concealing or not fully disclosing assets or financial information. This claim seeks to uncover any undisclosed or hidden assets, which could include bank accounts, investments, real estate, or other valuable property, to ensure a fair and accurate division of marital property during the divorce process. Discovery methods and legal processes are used to identify and reveal any concealed assets." .

<R7dk2dq24uP4NfXNA5ArLlX> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Local Superior" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R69pFKCbtXWO4nkV3D1B0L> ;
    skos:altLabel "Abbess"^^xsd:string,
        "House Superior"^^xsd:string,
        "Mother Superior"^^xsd:string,
        "Prior"^^xsd:string,
        "Superior Of The House"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "A Local Superior is the religious superior who governs a local community or house of an institute of consecrated life, exercising authority according to the institute’s constitutions and under the higher major superiors. The Local Superior oversees community life, discipline, pastoral or apostolic works, and the daily administration of the house."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Abbess Of A Benedictine Monastery"^^xsd:string,
        "House Superior Of A Missionary Residence"^^xsd:string,
        "Local Superior Of A Jesuit Community"^^xsd:string,
        "Mother Superior Of A Convent Of Religious Sisters"^^xsd:string,
        "Prior Of A Dominican Friary"^^xsd:string .

<R7drFEewnRyf3wuqc35E1yH> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Florida Circuit Court - Bay County - 14th Circuit Court" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R3Q1HDu5jO8nvhdbr2Uj0c> ;
    skos:definition "A court located in Bay County, Florida that is part of the larger Florida Circuit Court system." .

<R7dsFjrTOopGNf5raI2227k> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Archbishop" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RLdgWVNya1F84PAUEqTftE> ;
    skos:altLabel "Metropolitan Archbishop"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "An Archbishop is a bishop who presides over an archdiocese and holds metropolitan authority over a defined ecclesiastical province, except where otherwise provided by law. The office entails pastoral governance of the archdiocese and limited supervisory responsibilities toward suffragan dioceses."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "An archbishop convenes provincial councils when canon law requires."^^xsd:string,
        "An archbishop remains a bishop with the fullness of holy orders."^^xsd:string,
        "The archbishop governs an archdiocese and oversees suffragan dioceses."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel "Archdiocesan Bishop"^^xsd:string .

