        "Assisted Suicide"@en-gb,
        "Suicidio asistido"@es-es,
        "Suicidio asistido"@es-mx,
        "suicide assisté"@fr-fr,
        "התאבדות מוסכמת"@he-il,
        "सहायता से आत्महत्या"@hi-in,
        "安楽死"@ja-jp,
        "suicídio assistido"@pt-br,
        "辅助自杀"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Assisted Suicide: The act of intentionally helping another person end their life, typically in cases where the person is suffering from a terminal illness or severe pain, and where the person has expressed a desire to die." .

