        "A shrine preserves relics associated with a canonized saint."^^xsd:string,
        "A shrine supports popular piety within the life of the Church."^^xsd:string,
        "Pilgrims travel to a shrine seeking prayer, healing, or spiritual renewal."^^xsd:string .

<R8RerFcbBaYGo4DFhYqoXBC> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "folio:superseded" ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf <RdpSPh3bFHYrQ3vYPDwJYB> ;
    skos:altLabel "superseded" ;
    skos:definition "\"Superseded\" refers to the act of replacing or nullifying a previous legal rule, decision, or practice with a new one that holds precedence. For example, when a statute supersedes a judicial opinion, it means the new law takes precedence over and effectively replaces the principles or rulings established in that opinion." ;
    skos:example "Statute Superseded Judicial Opinion" .

<R8RgzFhDdl1pdx5e5pdbOMM> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Pancreatic Cancer" ;
