        "ナポリの"@ja-jp,
        "Napolitano"@pt-br,
        "那不勒斯的"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A dialect of Italian spoken in the region of Naples and surrounding areas." .

<R8Z1hy33okTgXPKS0rmNAG1> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Petition for Skilled Workers - Bachelor's Cap" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty <RN3mWlXZUAt07dYsu6tls2> ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R76UTCrg8DDzlFkZCPjrdqe> ],
        <RKY2B2HNSx5K82dgVN6Qn7> ;
    skos:altLabel "H-1B Bachelor's Cap Petition" ;
    skos:definition "In the United States, the H-1B Bachelor's cap petition involves employers filing Form I-129 on behalf of prospective H-1B employees with a bachelor's degree who are subject to the annual H-1B visa cap, typically requiring a random lottery if the cap is exceeded. This process determines the selection of beneficiaries who can receive H-1B visas for specialty occupation employment in the U.S." .

<R8Z6u7UqLhlDqUPKI9Ts8t6> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Prior Art" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDV2029Q3Zi4LQ1ehMJNj3w> ;
    skos:definition "Prior Art refers to any evidence that your invention is already known. It includes everything made public in any form before a given date that might be relevant to a patent's claims of originality." .

<R8ZBAOuDZuT00whwiIrlKle> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Reinvestment Risk" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R98HKldfU8zFYR50z1T3Yn4> ;
    skos:definition "The risk that an investor will be unable to reinvest cash flows (like interest payments) at a rate comparable to their current rate of return." .

<R8ZE8hspTJXjhYdr6k5qRM> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Employee Matters Agreement" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <Rhpdjd9p358e9Rkel80dvQ> ;
    skos:definition "An Employee Matters Agreement is a legal document that outlines various aspects of the employment relationship between a company and its executives or key employees. It typically covers matters such as job responsibilities, compensation, benefits, confidentiality, non-competition clauses, and dispute resolution procedures. This agreement is designed to define the rights, obligations, and expectations of both the employer and the employee in a clear and legally binding manner." .

<R8ZHACvzZdA3axSYEi5zcAO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Cash Interest Payment (for Sukuk Certificates)" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBZdShYeyerlOOUlB0f64SY> ],
        <RCezn96rpy4oRcZgzT9ULlh> ;
    skos:altLabel "Islamic Investment Return",
        "Profit Distribution Payment",
        "Sukuk Periodic Distribution" ;
    skos:definition "A Cash Interest Payment, in the context of sukuk certificates, refers to the distribution of profits generated from Sharia-compliant investments to certificate holders. This payment structure involves the periodic distribution of actual cash returns derived from the underlying assets or business activities, as opposed to interest in the conventional sense, ensuring compliance with Islamic finance principles." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Sharia-Compliant Yield Distribution" .

<R8ZJAxXACB6wigGHS2vGE2g> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court - Centre County" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R70IGZ5XRTshj1E64tVcxJD> ;
    skos:definition "A Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court in Centre County is a specific court within the Pennsylvania Magisterial District Court system that handles minor criminal offenses, traffic violations, and civil cases involving amounts up to $12,000." .

<R8ZLnFhKZS8OgGr2T8Euz1D> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "New Mexico Magistrate Court - Grant County" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDSK8CbOPdmMwMyMIlw8pdO> ;
    skos:definition "A court located in Grant County, New Mexico that has limited jurisdiction over certain types of cases." .

<R8ZLoCNBSRay7kZ0Nqtmf1D> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Rite of Christian Initiation of Adults" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7PqewXKBrc0FslMdc4wRjA> ;
    skos:altLabel "OCIA"^^xsd:string,
        "RCIA"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "The Rite of Christian Initiation of Adults is the ordered liturgical and catechetical process by which unbaptized adults are initiated into the Catholic Church. It culminates in the celebration of Baptism, Confirmation, and the Eucharist, ordinarily at the Easter Vigil."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Adults enter the Church through the rite of Christian initiation of adults."^^xsd:string,
        "The Easter Vigil is the normative time for celebrating the RCIA sacraments."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel "Order of Christian Initiation of Adults"^^xsd:string .

<R8ZMBn02TENynBiqOlzG7yE> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Genetic Photosensitivity Disorders" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/8.00-Skin-Adult.htm#8_07> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBbkOoA0Hp0UmEnkGJOjs6D> ;
    skos:definition "Genetic photosensitivity disorders are conditions where an individual's genetic makeup causes an abnormal sensitivity to ultraviolet (UV) light, leading to skin damage upon exposure. These disorders often result in symptoms such as skin lesions, rashes, or an increased risk of skin cancer." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Hereditary Photosensitivity Disorders" .

<R8ZQ0Km97U2Wut7s0UERyPR> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Levy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R731bb1FD96e6725c1113315> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R6NLFwVRdI5dCvtQ1dm4f2> ],
        <RDKm1RXP9FfvhLzWjynAfpS>,
        <RDbz1PVc6y57oOb9jAIl0eN> ;
    skos:definition "A Levy is a legal seizure of property to satisfy a debt, usually initiated by a governmental authority such as the Internal Revenue Service (IRS) for unpaid taxes. The process involves officially taking possession of assets like bank accounts, wages, or physical property, and is typically executed after a court order or other legal authorization" .

<R8ZWmwqI1Q3joUfVrV1icjU> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Sovereign State" ;
    dc:identifier "ENTITY-SOVST" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7oBWHStfmqTLn2MypkW3Pj> ;
    skos:altLabel "Sovereign State",
        "Staat"@de-de,
        "État souverain"@fr-fr,
        "主権国家"@ja-jp,
        "Estado soberano"@pt-br,
        "主权国家"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "In international law, a sovereign state, sovereign country, or simply state, is a nonphysical juridical entity that is represented by one centralized government that has sovereignty over a geographic area." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "SOVST" .

<R8ZYx37m3oxpGunpx48tCOK> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Foreign Ownership, Control, or Influence Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9LVBKjvGRuzwgtlhuLST36> ;
    skos:altLabel "Foreign Influence Claim",
        "International Control Claim",
        "National Security Ownership Claim" ;
    skos:definition "A Foreign Ownership, Control, or Influence (FOCI) Claim arises when a company or entity is alleged to be under foreign ownership, control, or influence, potentially compromising national security. This claim involves evaluating the extent of foreign involvement and its impact on the entity's operations, particularly in sectors critical to national security." ;
    skos:prefLabel "FOCI Violation Claim" .

<R8ZatpkyD1JTD0K3PqgGSQe> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Two Spirit" ;
    dc:source <https://www.nih.gov/nih-style-guide/sex-gender-sexuality> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R80nTp0xPWvxkJonwMOIvBA> ;
    skos:definition "Two Spirit is a term used within some Indigenous cultures in North America to describe a person who embodies characteristics of both masculine and feminine genders, or holds a unique gender role within their community. Legally, Two Spirit individuals may encounter unique challenges or require specific recognition and protection under laws pertaining to gender, cultural identity, and Indigenous rights." .

