<R8Zfrb3QY4Pk4E7DQnFEpyZ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Hate Speech" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7fCP2EQY8XQ5fxqiYaKPQA> ;
    skos:altLabel "Incendiary Speech" ;
    skos:definition "Hate Speech refers to communication, whether spoken, written, or behavioral, that attacks or discriminates against a person or group based on attributes such as race, religion, ethnicity, sexual orientation, disability, or gender. This type of speech is intended to incite hatred, violence, or prejudice against the targeted group and is often subject to legal restrictions and penalties." ;
    skos:example "A public speech inciting violence against a minority ethnic group, resulting in legal action for inciting racial hatred.",
        "Social media posts that demean and spread false information about a religious community, leading to platform bans and legal repercussions." .

