<R8ZqiwbOyQkx9Hw3BiZDTkj> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Act of Hope" ;
    dc:source <https://www.xavier.edu/jesuitresource/online-resources/prayer-index/catholic-prayers> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RyTfHxUQPVMUQrtIt1Mycz> ;
    skos:definition "Act of Hope is a Catholic prayer in which a person expresses confident trust in God’s mercy, grace, and promises of eternal life. This prayer rests on God’s goodness and on the merits of Jesus Christ as the foundation for pardon, assistance, and salvation."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "During evening prayer, she prayed an Act of Hope to entrust her future to God’s promises."^^xsd:string,
        "O My God, relying on Thy infinite goodness and promises, I hope to obtain pardon of my sins, the help of Thy grace and life everlasting, through the merits of Jesus Christ, my Lord and Redeemer."^^xsd:string,
        "While preparing for confession, he recited an Act of Hope to rely on God’s mercy and grace."^^xsd:string .

<R8Zr9gsyON1Ie92OHPq0AQj> a owl:Class ;
