<R8ZwcccDaVSGgC9VLp18b1L> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Specific Service Tax Payment" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9L4OY7QCBEVJpav2Da6Gef> ;
    skos:altLabel "Sector-Specific Tax Payment",
        "Service Industry Tax Payment",
        "Service-Specific Tax Payment",
        "Targeted Service Tax Payment" ;
    skos:definition "Specific Service Tax Payment includes taxes assessed on payments for specific services, such as insurance premiums, banking services, gambling and betting stakes (e.g., from horse races, football pools, lottery tickets), transportation, entertainment, restaurant services, and advertising charges. It also covers taxes on entry to casinos, races, and similar events or venues, as well as stamp taxes on specific services. Additionally, it encompasses taxes levied on the gross income of companies providing these services, including bank levies and payments to deposit insurance and financial stability schemes." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Taxes on Specific Services" .

<R8a457jmiJkRIvc198xvMUb> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "God's Promise of Eternal Dynasty"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RHNptBYphjt7FzVYMvbY6D> ;
    skos:altLabel "Davidic Dynasty Guarantee"^^xsd:string,
        "Eternal Dynasty Promise"^^xsd:string,
        "Promise of Perpetual Kingship"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "God's unconditional covenant with King David guaranteeing that his royal lineage would continue perpetually and that one of his descendants would reign forever. This promise forms the theological foundation for the Messianic hope and finds its fulfillment in Christ's eternal kingship."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "God declared that he would establish the dynasty and make it eternal."^^xsd:string,
        "The covenant guaranteed an unending lineage despite future unfaithfulness."^^xsd:string,
        "The prophet delivered God's promise that the king's house and kingdom would endure forever."^^xsd:string .

