<R8eyrMKsBdxrPX1h0KIqExG> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Sweeping Clause Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDkqXQLaqeFlhG4isnkHJuv> ;
    skos:altLabel "Klausel zur umfassenden Anspruchserhebung"@de-de,
        "Sweeping Clause Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamación de Cláusula General"@es-es,
        "Reclamación de Cláusula General"@es-mx,
        "Clause de revendication globale"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת סעיף כללי"@he-il,
        "स्वीपिंग क्लॉज क्लेम"@hi-in,
        "包括的な条項主張"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação de cláusula abrangente"@pt-br,
        "全面条款索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Sweeping Clause claim is a legal argument asserting that a law or action exceeds the authority granted by a broad clause in a constitution or statute, contending that it goes beyond what is expressly stated or implied. The claim challenges the constitutionality or validity of the law or action based on the interpretation that it exceeds the scope of the sweeping clause." .

