<R8iWQahgBm11W2MRLvhPRPb> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Universal Life Insurance" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDMlfBHhw2Mfk0FBrVCQJY9> ;
    skos:definition "Universal life insurance is a type of permanent life insurance that offers both a death benefit and a cash value component, similar to whole life insurance. However, it differs in its flexibility, allowing policyholders to adjust the premiums and death benefit within certain limits, and it often has an investment element where the cash value can be invested for potential growth." .

<R8iaSMweBcBegYYI9g2byVW> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fee Tail Estate" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8cjnXHiv1wNe6nzPvWnhQw> ;
    skos:definition "A Fee Tail Estate is a form of property ownership in which land is granted to an individual and the heirs of their body, limiting inheritance to direct descendants and preventing the property from being sold or transferred outside the family line. This archaic legal concept was designed to keep estates within families for generations." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Hereditary-Restricted Property Ownership" .

<R8ieQwxal23z5ggRO3EN2Wh> a owl:Class ;
