        "宣誓口座に関する訴訟"@ja-jp,
        "Ação de Conta Juramentada"@pt-br,
        "宣誓账户诉讼"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Suit on Sworn Account is a legal claim that arises from a written statement made under oath by a party who seeks to recover a debt or demand payment for goods or services provided, and is based on a contractual or quasi-contractual relationship between the parties involved." .

<R8uPzCETLEs7fjbuzJPtMPS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Antitrust - Refusal to Deal Claims" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8oBTLovip7JQGJ9AeOmmCD> ;
    skos:altLabel "Antitrust - Refusal to Deal Claims"@en-gb,
        "Antimonopolio - Reclamaciones de Negativa a Negociar"@es-es,
        "Antimonopolio - Reclamaciones de Negativa a Negociar"@es-mx,
        "אנטיטרוסט - טענות סירוב לעסקה"@he-il,
        "एंटीट्रस्ट - डील से इनकार दावे"@hi-in ;
    skos:definition "The concept of \"Antitrust - Refusal to Deal Claims\" refers to legal claims made against a company for refusing to do business with another company, in violation of antitrust laws." .

<R8uVWChGsC92Bmw3gMJD9bg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Creativity" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCoXvGg5LXK9dGHQMqGPNCe> ;
    skos:definition "Creativity in copyright law refers to the requirement that a work must display some level of original thought or artistic expression. It distinguishes copyrightable works from mere mechanical reproductions, ensuring protection is afforded only to creations that embody the author's intellectual effort." .

<R8uW4lNe8RZr0qftjrI1ACm> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Solvency Risk" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R98HKldfU8zFYR50z1T3Yn4> ;
    skos:definition "The risk that the company will not have sufficient assets to meet its liabilities." .

<R8uaHVA5sLFEVE1yOEiABIM> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Trucking Negligence" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBvXYVuffq7XXEmGpCJ0vCx> ],
        <RWNAwJemBq0gDs7LXfCjnE> ;
    skos:altLabel "LKW-Nachlässigkeit"@de-de,
        "Trucking Negligence"@en-gb,
        "Negligencia en el transporte de mercancías por carretera"@es-es,
        "Negligencia en el transporte de carga por carretera"@es-mx,
        "Négligence routière"@fr-fr,
        "הפרת חובת זהירות בהובלת מטענים על גבי משאיות"@he-il,
        "ट्रकिंग लापरवाही"@hi-in,
        "トラック過失"@ja-jp,
        "Negligência no transporte rodoviário"@pt-br,
