        "死刑"@ja-jp,
        "Pena de morte"@pt-br,
        "死刑"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Death Penalty (Capital Punishment) is a form of criminal penalty that involves the execution of a person who has been convicted of a capital crime." .

<R8wCAMhqoNRh4U7amC8z5gD> a owl:Class ;
