        "Moral Warning"^^xsd:string,
        "Restorative Correction"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Admonish Sinners is a spiritual work of mercy that consists in charitably correcting those who persist in moral error or sinful conduct. Admonish Sinners serves truth and charity by calling the person back to right order while respecting dignity and freedom."^^xsd:string ;
