        "A community leader addresses harmful behavior to protect the common good."^^xsd:string,
        "A parent admonishes a child firmly but lovingly after serious wrongdoing."^^xsd:string,
        "A pastor corrects a parishioner gently to help restore right conduct."^^xsd:string,
        "A trusted friend privately warns another about behavior that is causing moral harm."^^xsd:string .

