    skos:altLabel "Family Services Market Segment" ;
    skos:definition "The family & parenting market segment refers to a division of the market that is specifically targeted towards consumers who are parents or caregivers, focusing on products and services that cater to the needs of families and children. This segment encompasses a wide range of offerings, from child-rearing essentials to family-oriented activities, all designed to support the well-being, development, and enjoyment of family life." ;
