    skos:definition "Pentecost means the event in which the Holy Spirit descended upon the apostles and other disciples gathered in Jerusalem, empowering them to proclaim the Gospel. Pentecost constitutes the public manifestation and mission-driven birth of the Church."^^xsd:string ;
