    skos:altLabel "L-2 Visa" ;
    skos:definition "The visa for dependents of intermittent intra-company transferees (in the U.S., the L-2 visa) allows spouses and minor children of intra-company transferees  (e.g., L-1 visa holders), including intermittent transferees, to accompany them during their stay in the destination country (e.g., U.S.) Spouses holding an L-2 visa may also apply for work authorization" .

