    rdfs:subClassOf <RBSftPgkpTWJ4IzuvXyLBVG> ;
    skos:altLabel "Area Segment" ;
    skos:definition "The regional segment refers to a portion of the market that is focused on consumers and businesses for a geographical region within a country. This segment tailors its products, services, and marketing strategies to meet the needs and preferences of the regional population, often considering local culture, language, and economic conditions." .

