        "Negligência de empresas de transporte"@pt-br,
        "运输公司疏忽"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Transportation Company Negligence refers to the failure of a common carrier to exercise reasonable care in the transportation of goods or passengers, resulting in harm or injury to those goods or passengers." .

