<RBkxcatJUXScYOxUZeBbmjl> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Durable Power of Attorney Document" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBkuFhzhFcv5vcQJU7NSntY>,
        <RCmBrUNqCGl93SbCO8RvGis> ;
    skos:definition "A Durable Power of Attorney Document is a legal instrument that grants a designated person, called an agent or attorney-in-fact, the authority to act on behalf of the principal in financial and other matters. Unlike a standard power of attorney, its durability ensures the agent's authority persists even if the principal becomes incapacitated." .

