    skos:example "Christian liturgy commemorates Jesus’ entry into Jerusalem on Palm Sunday."^^xsd:string,
        "The Gospels describe Jesus entering Jerusalem on a donkey while crowds spread cloaks and palm branches before him."^^xsd:string .

