        "Purification of Lepers"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Jesus’ Cleansing of Lepers means the miraculous acts by which Jesus Christ cleansed individuals afflicted with leprosy, restoring them to health and social communion. Jesus’ Cleansing of Lepers reveals Christ’s compassion, authority over impurity, and fulfillment of the Law through mercy."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Cleansing of the Man with Leprosy"^^xsd:string,
        "Cleansing of the Ten Lepers"^^xsd:string,
        "Restoration to the Community"^^xsd:string,
        "The Gospel of Luke describes Jesus cleansing ten lepers, only one of whom returned to give thanks."^^xsd:string,
        "The Gospels recount Jesus touching and cleansing a man afflicted with leprosy."^^xsd:string .

