    skos:definition "The Rosary is a Marian devotional prayer that meditates on the mysteries of Christ’s life through repeated vocal prayer and contemplation. It combines the recitation of the Hail Mary with reflection on the Gospel, leading the faithful to deeper union with Christ through Mary."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Each decade of the rosary centers on a Gospel mystery."^^xsd:string,
        "Families often pray the rosary together."^^xsd:string,
        "The rosary invites meditation on the mysteries of Christ’s life."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:note "DEPRECATED in favor of The Holy Rosary"^^xsd:string .

