<RCFpktWEZOtDt2qAABUgJ8H> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "folio:asserted" ;
    rdfs:domain <R8CdMpOM0RmyrgCCvbpiLS0> ;
    rdfs:range <RNICD9MDcFQJJX6nxX11Vt>,
        <RnKWv1E6U2Ssc5SRsG14NO> ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf <R7VtpAC807aOYLVtKmPvFRt> ;
    skos:altLabel "asserted",
        "claimed",
        "declared",
        "folio:declared",
        "folio:proclaimed",
        "folio:stated",
        "proclaimed",
        "stated" ;
    skos:definition "\"Asserted\" in a legal context refers to the act of confidently stating or declaring a fact, right, or legal position, typically as part of a legal claim or defense. This assertion forms the basis of a party's argument or claim in legal proceedings, setting the stage for the legal debate and burden of proof. Compared with the more-argumentative terms \"opposed\" or \"supported,\" the term \"asserted\" is more neutral." ;
    skos:prefLabel "folio:claimed" .

