<RCGquLtBt00CMIRpIU9jQqB> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Involuntary Commitment to a Mental Health Facility" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDmZbwmBBKWQ3vGof1sh1kB> ;
    skos:definition "Involuntary commitment to a mental health facility is a legal process where an individual is mandated to be admitted to a psychiatric hospital or clinic against their will. This typically occurs when the individual poses a significant risk to themselves or others due to a mental disorder, and the decision is often based on medical evaluations and established legal criteria." .

<RCGsTH2ii3FRZBJLRhm5WNk> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Arkansas Circuit Court - Garland Cty." ;
