    skos:definition "A domestic servitude claim is a legal allegation that a person is being forced to work in a household setting against their will, often through manipulation or coercion. This is a form of human trafficking and is considered a violation of labor laws and human rights." .

<RCKTj1C4x6LkM3Chp27f6sn> a owl:Class ;
