    skos:altLabel "An Informational Advertisement, also known as a Public Service Announcement (PSA), is a type of advertising aimed at raising awareness, educating the public, or promoting beneficial behaviors and social issues. These advertisements are typically sponsored by government agencies, non-profit organizations, or public health groups and focus on delivering important messages to the community.",
        "Awareness Campaign",
        "PSA" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Public Service Announcement" .

<RCKVhlaLqw1y0DATZf5mOzi> a owl:Class ;
