    rdfs:subClassOf <RCzQzQSPRAB9cLkvDtBJFn> ;
    skos:altLabel "Prior Appropriation Rights" ;
    skos:definition "Also known as \"appropriative rights,\" diversion rights allow entities to divert water from its natural source for use in a different location. These rights are typically granted based on a \"first in time, first in right\" principle, meaning the earliest users have senior rights to the water source. This system is common in parts of the western United States." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Appropriative Rights" .

