    skos:altLabel "Signing Date" ;
    skos:definition "Date Signed refers to the specific calendar date on which a legal document or contract is executed by the involved parties. This date is crucial as it often marks the commencement of the document’s legal effect and the start of obligations or rights." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Execution Date" .

