<RD3FnQpzvyCcGyILkgICREk> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Natural Born Citizen Clause Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDdZDW8VIPVbM8gI4n7Ippf> ;
    skos:altLabel "Anspruch auf die Klausel zum natürlichen geborenen Bürger"@de-de,
        "Natural Born Citizen Clause Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamo de la Cláusula de Ciudadano Natural Nacido"@es-es,
        "Reclamo de la Cláusula de Ciudadano Natural Nacido"@es-mx,
        "Revendication de la clause de citoyenneté naturelle"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת סעיף אזרח טבעי נולד"@he-il,
        "प्राकृतिक जन्म नागरिक धारा दावा"@hi-in,
        "自然生まれた市民条項の主張"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação da Cláusula do Cidadão Natural Nascido"@pt-br,
        "天生公民条款要求"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Natural Born Citizen Clause claim is a legal argument asserting that a person's eligibility to hold the office of the President of the United States is in question due to the interpretation and application of the Natural Born Citizen Clause in the United States Constitution. This claim contends that the person in question does not meet the constitutional requirement of being a natural-born citizen, either due to their birth circumstances or the citizenship status of their parents, potentially rendering their candidacy or presidency invalid." .

