<RDAerGeqJPhby1NWQD5fX4A> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Truancy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RraVbXQhP74EFbW54D6Why> ;
    skos:definition "Truancy refers to the act of a student intentionally and regularly missing school without a valid excuse or permission from their parents or guardians. Truancy can have legal consequences, and it is often seen as a concern because it can negatively impact a student's education and future prospects." .

