    rdfs:subClassOf <R7KnhbKXnWBeCBhayT7e9BY> ;
    skos:definition "A Warranty is a promise or guarantee provided by a manufacturer or seller to the buyer concerning the quality, condition, or functionality of a product for a specified period. If the product fails to meet the stipulated conditions during the warranty period, the manufacturer or seller is obliged to repair, replace, or refund the product." .

