        "Place of Christian Burial"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Cemetery is sacred ground designated for the burial of the dead and blessed or consecrated by ecclesiastical authority. A cemetery expresses reverence for the human body and hope in the resurrection of the dead."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "A Catholic cemetery provides sacred ground for the burial of the faithful departed."^^xsd:string,
        "A columbarium holds cremated remains in a sacred setting."^^xsd:string,
        "A monastic cemetery is reserved for members of a religious community."^^xsd:string,
        "The faithful visit a cemetery to pray for the dead and affirm hope in the resurrection."^^xsd:string .

