        "Sacramental Celebrant"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "A Sacramental Minister is the person authorized by the Church to validly and licitly celebrate a sacrament by applying the sacramental matter and pronouncing the sacramental form with proper intent. Through this minister, Christ himself acts to confer sacramental grace."^^xsd:string ;
