        "Quantum Meruit"@pt-br,
        "Quantum Meruit"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A claim for quantum meruit is a legal action seeking payment for the reasonable value of services or goods provided, when there is no contract or the contract is unenforceable, and is typically brought under the category of equitable relief or quasi-contract claims." .

