    skos:definition "The hobbies market segment refers to a division of the market that is specifically targeted towards consumers who are interested in activities and products related to leisure and recreational pursuits. This segment encompasses products and marketing strategies that are designed to cater to the needs, preferences, and interests of individuals who seek to engage in hobbies for relaxation, enjoyment, and personal fulfillment." ;
    skos:example "Antiquing and Antiques",
        "Birdwatching Market",
        "Collectibles Market",
