        "违约侵权"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Tortious Breach of Contract is a legal concept that occurs when one party breaches a contract and causes harm or damages to the other party, resulting in a tort claim in addition to a breach of contract claim." .

<RDjOh6OGqNh0VtIkoaksbPp> a owl:Class ;
