    skos:definition "Plums are smooth-skinned stone fruits from the Prunus genus, known for their juicy flesh and sweet-tart flavor. They are consumed fresh, dried as prunes, or used in cooking, baking, and preserves, valued for their vitamins, antioxidants, and dietary fiber." .

<RDkZ1f1SIdbFYRwzAad7v3D> a owl:Class ;
