    skos:definition "A Real Estate Lease is a contract wherein the owner (lessor) grants the right to occupy and use their property to another party (lessee) for a specified period in exchange for rental payments." .

<RDkcKVfaV3t8ah0WJGdJSAQ> a owl:Class ;
