    skos:altLabel "Chartered Financial Analyst" ;
    skos:definition "The suffix \"C.F.A.\" stands for \"Chartered Financial Analyst\" and is used after a person's name to indicate that they have passed a series of exams and met other requirements set forth by the CFA Institute. This designation signifies the individual's expertise in investment management and financial analysis, and it is commonly used in finance, investment, and academic settings" ;
    skos:prefLabel "C.F.A." .

<RDqZ6dzBBYqQ9q4QLVJRexd> a owl:Class ;
