        "Incorporação por estoppel"@pt-br,
        "禁止否认原则下的公司合并"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A legal doctrine that treats an entity as a corporation, even if it has not completed the formalities required for incorporation, when it has acted as if it were a corporation and others have relied on that assumption to their detriment." .

