    skos:definition "When a business partner fails to uphold their legal obligation to act in the best interest of their co-partner, they are breaching their fiduciary duty and can be held liable for any resulting damages." .

<RHrIIrzJpjzV7eD3r5UMh4> a owl:Class ;
