    skos:definition "The Muslim Religion, or Islam, is a monotheistic faith based on the teachings of the Prophet Muhammad as recorded in the Quran. In legal contexts, it often relates to the protection of religious freedoms, the accommodation of Islamic practices such as prayer and fasting, and the recognition of Islamic laws and principles in certain legal systems." ;
    skos:example "Shia Islam",
        "Sufism",
        "Sunni Islam" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Islam" .

<RUtjBGn84PtIFpGgerOB2g> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Shelter the Homeless" ;
