    skos:definition "The concept of \"Undue Influence Over Testator or Settlor\" refers to the situation where someone exerts pressure or control over a person creating a trust or will, causing them to make decisions that they would not have made otherwise." .

<RW6nX4aKqrx1jH86AzcQsS> a owl:Class ;
