        "धमकी भरा बैटरी हमला"@hi-in,
        "脅迫的な暴行の脅迫"@ja-jp,
        "Ameaça de lesão corporal"@pt-br,
        "威胁性电池袭击"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Threatened Battery Assault refers to a criminal assault where the perpetrator intentionally causes the victim to fear immediate bodily harm or offensive contact, without actually making physical contact." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Threatened Violence" .

