        "Eslavo eclesiástico antigo; Eslavo eclesiástico; Búlgaro antigo; Eslavo eclesiástico antigo; Eslavo eclesiástico"@pt-br,
        "教会斯拉夫语; 古斯拉夫语; 教会斯拉夫文; 古保加利亚语; 古教会斯拉夫语"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A language used in the liturgy and religious texts of the Eastern Orthodox Church, based on Old Bulgarian and Old Macedonian." .

<RWhDw21z1Y8UzluRxSyJxI> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Stakeholder" ;
