    skos:altLabel "Textual Section"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Section is a distinct, labeled subdivision of a text that groups related paragraphs, articles, or canons under a specific heading. It structures content for clarity, navigation, and precise citation."^^xsd:string ;
