    rdfs:subClassOf <RDBbmSqBVTGWStGET9PQuFk> ;
    skos:altLabel "ARR" ;
    skos:definition "Annual Recurring Revenue (ARR) is a metric commonly used by subscription-based businesses to measure the total amount of predictable revenue generated from subscriptions over a one-year period. Unlike Monthly Recurring Revenue (MRR), ARR provides a longer-term view of revenue stability and is often used for strategic planning and valuation purposes." .

