        "Custodial Care Authority"^^xsd:string,
        "Supportive Care Authority"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Caregiver Authority is the moral and practical authority entrusted to a person who provides ongoing care for another who cannot fully care for himself or herself. Caregiver Authority obliges the caregiver to act with charity, prudence, and respect for human dignity, always ordered toward the care recipient’s true good."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "A caregiver adapts routines to respect the care recipient’s dignity and preferences."^^xsd:string,
        "A caregiver administers prescribed medication according to medical instructions."^^xsd:string,
        "A family member manages daily meals and hygiene for an elderly relative."^^xsd:string,
        "A home health aide assists a disabled adult with mobility and personal care."^^xsd:string .

<RjAR6LD9HeCJgI2GEuJQtk> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "New York Court on the Judiciary" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R3391bdB1A2adE51071C7cf7> ;
    skos:definition "The New York Court on the Judiciary is a specialized court within the New York State Courts system that is responsible for investigating and disciplining judges who have engaged in misconduct." .

<RjAfjZzqaSvOTP7iz9NmuA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Washington Superior Court - Columbia County" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RChEjOHUONk1Yp2qm3OHJdc> ;
    skos:definition "Washington Superior Court - Columbia County refers to a specific court within the Washington Superior Court system that has jurisdiction over legal matters in Columbia County." .

<RjDhDDjUUDTnXvhNYE2GNj> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Arugula" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R74NaktGSuv9KJ3aBnw26GP> ;
    skos:altLabel "Eruca Vesicaria" ;
    skos:definition "Arugula, also known as rocket, is a leafy green vegetable from the Eruca vesicaria species, known for its peppery flavor and tender texture. It is commonly used in salads, sandwiches, and as a garnish, valued for its nutritional benefits, including high levels of vitamins A, C, and K, as well as calcium and antioxidants." .

<RjFYr8GZjMayrsvnEqXDNZ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Collateral Appeal" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDv8hBbEMrPuIgEyXvljAYY> ;
    skos:altLabel "Collateral Attack" ;
    skos:definition "A collateral appeal, also known as a collateral attack, is a legal challenge to a criminal conviction that occurs outside the direct appeal process. Instead of challenging the validity of the conviction based on the record of the original trial (as in a direct appeal), a collateral appeal addresses issues such as newly discovered evidence, ineffective assistance of counsel, or constitutional violations that weren't raised during the trial or on direct appeal. This form of relief is often sought after all direct appeals have been exhausted." .

<RjGC9ag68KwoZVYSjOBbJI> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fixation in a Tangible Medium" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8O3PoolmgHAy2hrZsguhqy> ;
    skos:altLabel "Material Embodiment" ;
    skos:definition "Fixation in a Tangible Medium, a cornerstone of copyright law, requires that a work must be fixed in a medium of expression from which it can be perceived, reproduced, or otherwise communicated. This concept ensures that copyright protects not the idea itself but its expression in a form that can be physically or digitally captured and reproduced.",
        "Tangible Expression" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fixation" .

<RjId5qUUyYquw8QeFRCvTa> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Stale Rent" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCzs34uEQI9f4cuWp3bQO0P> ;
    skos:altLabel "Veraltete Miete"@de-de,
        "Stale Rent"@en-gb,
        "Alquiler vencido"@es-es,
        "Renta vencida"@es-mx,
        "Loyer en souffrance"@fr-fr,
        "שכירות מיושנת"@he-il,
        "बेकार किराया"@hi-in,
        "滞納家賃"@ja-jp,
        "Aluguel atrasado"@pt-br,
        "滞租"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Rent that remains unpaid or uncollected for a prolonged period of time, which may be used as a defense in a civil litigation case." .

<RjLrw4pDrBHKT8XC2lfAKh> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Merger of Idea and Expression" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9qhyZbQlG5lHtijZL6Kt3l> ;
    skos:definition "The Merger of Idea and Expression doctrine in copyright law applies when an idea and its expression are so intertwined that the idea cannot be expressed in any other way, making the expression non-protectable. This principle recognizes that when only one or very few ways exist to express an idea, protecting such expression would effectively grant a monopoly over the idea itself." .

<RjNGPD1lRULk52cpTgbztf> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Virgin Islands Municipal Court" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R752LnUHc6rfnv4O2TfcpZl> ;
    skos:definition "The Virgin Islands Municipal Court is a court of limited jurisdiction within the Virgin Islands Territory Courts, responsible for hearing cases related to local ordinance violations and misdemeanors." .

<RjRtAyw9wyKc3tVk8GsLoi> a owl:Class ;
