    skos:definition "Endometrial cancer is a type of cancer that begins in the endometrium, the lining of the uterus. It often presents with abnormal vaginal bleeding and typically requires treatments such as surgery, radiation therapy, and chemotherapy." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Uterine Cancer" .

