    skos:altLabel "Dual-Use Export Violation Claim",
        "EAR Violation Claim" ;
    skos:definition "An EAR Claim arises when an individual or entity violates the Export Administration Regulations, which govern the export and re-export of dual-use items, software, and technology from the United States. This claim involves allegations of unauthorized export, re-export, or transfer of items subject to EAR to prohibited destinations, entities, or individuals." .

<RsV9iqJSb9nvczqBNpCgAv> a owl:Class ;
