    skos:definition "Lesbian refers to a woman who is attracted to other women. It is a sexual orientation that is part of the LGBTQIA+ spectrum, and like other orientations, the experience of being lesbian can vary among individuals." .

<Rz1yyhKFaBoVC4ilqxUXgJ> a owl:Class ;
