    rdfs:subClassOf <w50dqnD8RjKB5477dFN8ig> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) mixing pigments, solvents, and binders into paints and other coatings, such as stains, varnishes, lacquers, enamels, shellacs, and water-repellent coatings for concrete and masonry, and/or (2) manufacturing allied paint products, such as putties, paint and varnish removers, paint brush cleaners, and frit." .

<jw3d8dHtStmJJNu0eaZzyQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Racetracks" ;
