    rdfs:subClassOf <gQ5-x_LgT1Sq3-WCNHDHLg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing computing infrastructure, data processing services, Web hosting services (except software publishing), and related services, including streaming support services (except streaming distribution services). Data processing establishments provide complete processing and specialized reports from data supplied by clients or provide automated data processing and data entry services." ;
