    skos:altLabel "Fahrlässiges Versäumnis, vor gefährlichen Bedingungen zu warnen"@de-de,
        "Negligent Failure to Warn of Dangerous Condition"@en-gb,
        "Falta negligente de advertencia sobre una condición peligrosa"@es-es,
        "Falta negligente de advertencia sobre una condición peligrosa"@es-mx,
        "Défaut négligent d'avertir d'une condition dangereuse"@fr-fr,
        "כשל לאזהר על מצב מסוכן באופן שגוי"@he-il,
        "खतरनाक स्थिति की चेतावनी करने में लापरवाही से असफलता"@hi-in,
        "危険な状態の警告の怠慢な不履行"@ja-jp,
        "Falha negligente em alertar sobre condição perigosa"@pt-br,
        "疏忽未能警告危险情况"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Negligent Failure to Warn of Dangerous Condition refers to a legal claim made by an individual who has suffered harm due to a failure to warn of a dangerous condition, where the failure to warn was due to negligence." .

