        "Christian Initiation Rite"^^xsd:string,
        "Initiation Process of the Church"^^xsd:string,
        "Rite of Initiation"^^xsd:string,
        "The Easter Vigil is central to the rite of Christian initiation."^^xsd:string,
        "The rite of Christian initiation guides adults into full communion with the Church."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "The Rite of Christian Initiation is the liturgical and catechetical process by which persons are gradually introduced into the Christian faith and sacramental life of the Church. It culminates in the celebration of the sacraments of initiation and incorporation into the Church."^^xsd:string .

