        "非法披露大陪审团程序"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of \"Grand Jury Proceedings Unlawfully Disclosed\" refers to the illegal act of revealing information about a grand jury investigation, which is supposed to be kept confidential, without proper authorization or legal justification." .

<R81vvUfjtIynvagUMuGiDdV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Intended Spouse" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <ReA0gy8mOLrqG7eTtFxnTh> ],
        <RDlYI2CbQn1u95Hs6otNU2O> ;
    skos:altLabel "Fiancéé" ;
    skos:definition "An Intended Spouse is a person who is engaged to be married and has a clear intention to enter into a legally recognized marriage. This status often involves legal considerations, such as immigration benefits, where the intended spouse may apply for a visa to join their partner in another country for the purpose of marriage." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Fiancé" .

<R823glDLgYxwmTy40ur3kxA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Poaching" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7c5BcqV4pI9L9rPupIV17C> ;
    skos:altLabel "Illegal Wildlife Harvesting",
        "Unauthorized Hunting",
        "Unauthorized Wildlife Harvesting" ;
    skos:definition "Poaching is the illegal hunting, capturing, or killing of wildlife, often in violation of local, national, or international conservation laws. This activity typically targets endangered or protected species for their meat, fur, or body parts." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Illegal Hunting" .

<R82YwnDd4g8kOAQ7Ekb3bca> a owl:Class ;
