        "Empresa de private equity"@pt-br,
        "私募股权公司"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Private Equity Company is a type of investment firm that uses capital from institutional investors and high-net-worth individuals to acquire controlling equity stakes in companies. These firms aim to improve the operational efficiency of the acquired company with a goal of selling it at a profit, typically over a medium to long-term investment horizon." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Private Equity Firm" .

