        "Dispensa retaliatória"@pt-br,
        "报复性解雇"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Retaliatory Discharge refers to the act of an employer firing an employee in response to the employee engaging in a protected activity, such as reporting discrimination or harassment, in violation of employment laws." .

<R8Jf4dr3IkvxQZBbs7AlZBg> a owl:Class ;
