        "合同重订"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Contract Reformation refers to the legal remedy of modifying or changing the terms of a contract in order to correct a mistake or address an unfair situation, and is a type of equitable relief." .

<R8Oek9P5OcDc0RoLp6ZB93x> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Local Governmental Leader" ;
