        "Town Official" ;
    skos:definition "A Local Governmental Leader is an elected or appointed official who holds a position of authority in a municipal or regional government body. This individual is responsible for making decisions, implementing policies, and representing the interests of their constituents within a specific geographic area smaller than a state or province." ;
    skos:prefLabel "City Official" .

<R8Or6YYYUGsKjIbyh7L2NzM> a owl:Class ;
