        "Frais d'experts"@fr-fr,
        "הוצאות מומחים"@he-il,
        "विशेषज्ञ व्यय"@hi-in,
        "専門家費用"@ja-jp,
        "Despesas de especialistas"@pt-br,
        "专家费用"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The cost incurred by a party in a legal matter for the services of a professional with specialized knowledge or skills, such as a consultant or witness." .

<R8ifazW1D1PDee0OGJlWVpG> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fortitude" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7QF58SulRGe1zlQ8gCzVSF> ;
    skos:altLabel "Constancy"^^xsd:string,
        "Endurance"^^xsd:string,
        "Moral Strength"^^xsd:string,
        "Patience in Adversity"^^xsd:string,
        "Perseverance"^^xsd:string,
        "Resilience"^^xsd:string,
        "Steadfastness"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Fortitude is the cardinal virtue that strengthens the will to face difficulty, danger, and suffering for the sake of the good. Fortitude enables perseverance and courage in pursuing what is right despite fear, fatigue, or opposition."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Fortitude empowers resistance to temptation despite fear or pressure."^^xsd:string,
        "Fortitude enables a person to endure suffering without abandoning moral commitments."^^xsd:string,
        "Fortitude strengthens courage to defend truth in the face of opposition."^^xsd:string,
        "Fortitude supports perseverance in long and demanding responsibilities."^^xsd:string,
        "Fortitude sustains faithful witness under persecution or hardship."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel "Courage"^^xsd:string .

<R8j2m6py7eEfIzJBp4nxyM3> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Right to Food and Water" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBJlYzE4ZY14dTEghzbbMHg> ;
    skos:definition "The right to food and water refers to the human entitlement to access adequate food and clean water necessary for survival and well-being. This right is often recognized under international law, such as the International Covenant on Economic, Social and Cultural Rights, and aims to prevent malnutrition, starvation, and water-borne diseases by ensuring equitable distribution of essential resources." .

<R8jub69dsTeA4UUodPgmxsW> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Temporary Religious Worker Visa" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RD1oQDMlC6FytjOndhJTMy8> ;
    skos:altLabel "R-1 Visa" ;
    skos:definition "This visa (in the U.S., R-1 visa) is a non-immigrant visa designated for religious workers who are coming to the destination country (e.g., U.S.) to work in a religious capacity. The initial period of stay can be up to 30 months, with the possibility of extending for an additional 30 months, for a maximum total stay of 60 months" .

<R8kOvHwkY6TrQmB7RnYiWNO> a owl:Class ;
