        "Despejo construtivo do inquilino"@pt-br,
        "房客的建设性驱逐"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Constructive Eviction of Tenant is a legal concept that occurs when a landlord's actions or omissions make a rental property uninhabitable, forcing the tenant to move out, and is considered a form of Unlawful Eviction of Tenant." .

<R8nNqRKHdgIKZbyfzAg2v8I> a owl:Class ;
