        "הוצאות עדים"@he-il,
        "साक्षी शुल्क व्यय"@hi-in,
        "証人費用支出"@ja-jp,
        "Despesas com honorários de testemunhas"@pt-br,
        "证人费用支出"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A witness fees expense is a type of expense that refers to the compensation paid to a person who provides testimony in a legal proceeding, which may include fees for travel, lodging, and other related expenses." .

<R9h5aaQVsZ4v7eZ45w3c8EG> a owl:Class ;
