    skos:altLabel "K-1 Visa",
        "This non-immigrant visa category for the intended spouse or fiancé(e) of a destination-country citizen (in the U.S., the K-1 visa) allows the foreign-citizen fiancé(e) to travel to the destination country for the purpose of marrying their citizen sponsor within a short period (e.g., within 90 days of arrival), after which they can apply for adjustment of status to become a lawful permanent resident",
