<RCDOABUr8ZTMQ7N7Rydeius> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "folio:signed" ;
    rdfs:domain <R8CdMpOM0RmyrgCCvbpiLS0> ;
    rdfs:range <RDt4vQCYDfY0R9fZ5FNnTbj> ;
    rdfs:subPropertyOf owl:topObjectProperty ;
    skos:altLabel "signed" ;
    skos:definition "\"Signed\" in a legal context refers to the act of putting one's signature on a legal document, such as a pleading, contract, or order. This signature signifies the individual's approval, authorization, or acknowledgement of the content of the document, and is often a requisite for the document's legal validity and enforceability." ;
    skos:example "Judge Signed Order",
        "Lawyer Signed Pleading",
        "Party Signed Contract" .

<RCDSfbsnspcBgvfUnoT77Gy> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Homeowners' Association" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <Rb83PjlzxELY9WY21pSO81> ;
    skos:altLabel "HOA" ;
    skos:definition "A homeowners' association (HOA) is an organization formed by residents in a planned community or housing development, such as a neighborhood of single-family homes or a condominium complex. The HOA is responsible for managing and maintaining common areas, enforcing community rules and regulations, and collecting dues or assessments from homeowners to fund these activities. Homeowners' associations help ensure the upkeep and overall quality of life in the community but may also impose restrictions and guidelines on property use and appearance." .

