        "裁判所規則に基づく控訴"@ja-jp,
        "Recursos sob a Regra do Tribunal"@pt-br,
        "根据法院规则的上诉"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Appeals Under Court Rule refers to the process of challenging a lower court's decision by filing a request for review with a higher court, as governed by the specific procedural rules established by that court." .

<RCMbCsfImEf6Qw94nFcIfw5> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Business Executive" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RkIejtiO3CUzgQe98NWyPq> ;
    skos:altLabel "Executive" ;
    skos:definition "A business executive is someone holding a senior management position within a company or organization, responsible for making strategic decisions and overseeing the implementation of the company's policies and objectives. Executives typically include roles such as Chief Executive Officer (CEO), Chief Information Officer (CIO), Senior Vice President (SVP), and Vice President (VP), among others." .

<RCMeywGHqtDlkLxwnDrD0CF> a owl:Class ;
