        "Activos de bonos"@es-mx,
        "Actifs obligataires"@fr-fr,
        "נכסי אגרות חוב"@he-il,
        "बॉन्ड संपत्ति"@hi-in,
        "債券資産"@ja-jp,
        "Ativos de títulos"@pt-br,
        "债券资产"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A bond is a fixed income instrument that represents a loan made by an investor to a borrower (typically corporate or governmental). A bond could be thought of as an I.O.U. between the lender and borrower that includes the details of the loan and its payment." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "BONDA" .

<RCxfiZzG4dF6wN0pVL57OS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Real Estate Fraud" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8GyyJdxlZtc7PsW9vLAKfE>,
