        "Administração de Pequenas Empresas dos EUA"@pt-br,
        "美国小型企业管理局"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The U.S. Small Business Administration (SBA) is a federal agency responsible for providing support to small businesses in the United States, including access to capital, entrepreneurial development, and government contracting." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "SBA" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Small Business Administration" .

