    rdfs:subClassOf <R7Npz2dMwAvM2YkbcTKhvKy> ;
    skos:definition "Canon Law Canon is a numbered legal provision within the Code of Canon Law or another canonical code that establishes a specific norm, right, obligation, or definition. It serves as a binding unit of ecclesiastical law according to its scope and promulgation."^^xsd:string .

