        "公用事业责任"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Public Utility Liability is the legal responsibility of a utility company for any harm caused to the public due to their actions or negligence, and falls under the categories of agency and vicarious liability." .

<RDFd7fIt2iST6CSAzHKiMqN> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Health Care Directive" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RB4GQZ26zq1PJ9m6vGUuoiy> ;
    skos:altLabel "Healthcare Directive",
        "Patientenverfügung"@de-de,
        "Health Care Directive"@en-gb,
        "Directiva de atención médica"@es-es,
        "Directiva de atención médica"@es-mx,
        "Directive anticipée de soins"@fr-fr,
        "הוראות טיפול ברפואה"@he-il,
        "स्वास्थ्य देखभाल निर्देशिका"@hi-in,
        "医療指示書"@ja-jp,
        "Diretiva antecipada de vontade"@pt-br,
        "医疗保健指令"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Health Care Directive is a legal document that outlines an individual's wishes regarding medical treatment and end-of-life care in the event they become unable to make decisions for themselves." .

<RDFgKHH89MV9zwwkinVZtzk> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "11th Amendment Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7MGQ9xUx0PxGLp5yxprdpZ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Eleventh Amendment Claim",
        "11. Änderungsantrag"@de-de,
        "11th Amendment Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamación de la 11ª Enmienda"@es-es,
        "Reclamo de la 11ª Enmienda"@es-mx,
        "Réclamation de 11ème amendement"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת התיקון ה-11"@he-il,
        "11वीं संशोधन दावा"@hi-in,
        "第11修正案請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação da 11ª Emenda"@pt-br,
        "第十一修正案索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "An Eleventh Amendment claim is a legal argument asserting that a lawsuit against a state government or its agencies violates the Eleventh Amendment of the United States Constitution, which provides states with sovereign immunity from certain types of lawsuits in federal courts. These claims typically involve disputes over whether a state has consented to be sued or if there are specific exceptions that permit the lawsuit to proceed despite the Eleventh Amendment's protections." .

<RDFnGjQt5EwLENQv2FE8JE3> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Speculation Objection" ;
    dc:source "Fed. R. Evid. 601",
        "Fed. R. Evid. 701" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCEx7g3wSm7TRkpl2WQko0s> ;
    skos:altLabel "Conjecture Objection",
        "Guesswork Objection",
        "Unfounded Conclusion Objection" ;
    skos:definition "Speculation Objection is a legal objection raised when a question or testimony calls for an answer based on conjecture or guesswork rather than personal knowledge or facts. It is used to prevent witnesses from providing opinions or conclusions without a proper foundation" .

<RDGL2gCEacTZDXEK0m1dhp2> a owl:Class ;
