        "अनुरोध"@hi-in,
        "募集"@ja-jp,
        "Solicitação"@pt-br,
        "征求"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Solicitation refers to the act of encouraging, requesting, or commanding another person to commit a crime, with the intent that the crime be committed." .

<RDGUE77tzDuRstdi916e1Vv> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Professional Association" ;
    dc:source <https://bizcounsel.com/articles/What-is-a-Professional-Association>,
        <https://mollaeilaw.com/blog/is-a-professional-association-a-corporation/>,
        <https://statutes.capitol.texas.gov/Docs/BO/htm/BO.301.htm> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBDPzIFUWJsqqM1kkNffPeu> ],
        <Rb83PjlzxELY9WY21pSO81> ;
    skos:definition "A Professional Association is an organization founded and operated by professionals who share a common field of expertise or occupation. The association promotes standards, offers networking opportunities, and provides various professional development resources to its members." .

<RDGdDmBhMZICUDoXt6HEEbr> a owl:ObjectProperty ;
    rdfs:label "folio:hastype" ;
    rdfs:comment "RIEHL NOTE: This was originally conceived as a `New York Courts folio:hasType Dispute Forum` but that will likely be deprecated in favor of having Courts be Individuals (not Classes)." .

<RDH6PhhXYNXaBHi0DaFtrdS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Zoning Ordinance" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RpTUD0qxHw05RgxAtgCJOW> ],
        <RDoLngQAXQVu1WYzZlGsAQd> ;
    skos:altLabel "Zoning Code",
        "Zoning Regulation" ;
    skos:definition "A Zoning Ordinance is a set of legal regulations adopted by municipal or other local government bodies that specifies the types of land use permitted within certain geographic areas. The ordinance usually includes zoning maps and text detailing the land use regulations for different zones, such as residential, commercial, industrial, and other specialized categories." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Land Use Ordinance" .

<RDJ5gLF3diEDjeGSux0X4TJ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Undersecured Creditor" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7PHFZzZmVmczzNQl6iZKsa> ;
    skos:altLabel "Inadequately Secured Creditor",
        "Insufficiently Secured Lender",
        "Partially Secured Creditor" ;
    skos:definition "An Undersecured Creditor is a lender whose collateral value securing a loan is less than the outstanding debt owed by the borrower. This situation often arises in bankruptcy contexts, affecting the creditor’s ability to fully recover the loan amount through collateral liquidation." .

<RDJssYq6dD0i6zlieP3cotj> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Crewmember Visa" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RD1oQDMlC6FytjOndhJTMy8> ;
    skos:altLabel "D-1 Visa"@en-us ;
    skos:definition "A Crewmember Visa is a specific type of visa issued to individuals who work on board a sea vessel or international airline, such as pilots, flight attendants, or ship crew members. This visa allows the holder to enter and stay in a foreign country for a limited period, strictly for the purpose of joining, working on, or disembarking from their vessel or aircraft." .

<RDK00RGn4D8WBqOyOXqlrfn> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Legislative Proceedings" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9v17ZYsnDkNSEZkvD36nhT> ;
    skos:definition "Legislative Proceedings refer to the formal discussions and decision-making processes carried out by a governing body, such as a parliament or congress, in order to create or amend laws." .

<RDK6KqszFBwtJBxdJtoGdQ9> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Squash" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCIv9j8UdKC0YVPrbl5EGRq> ;
    skos:altLabel "Cucurbita" ;
    skos:definition "Squash refers to a diverse group of fruit vegetables from the Cucurbitaceae family, known for their various shapes, sizes, and flavors. They are categorized into summer and winter types, and are valued for their culinary versatility, nutritional benefits, including vitamins A and C, fiber, and antioxidants." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Gourds" .

<RDLIpK2R8t5eS7LDT636F0h> a owl:Class ;
