        "Guarda de Menores"@pt-br,
        "未成年人监护"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The legal concept of Guardianship of Minor refers to the legal authority and responsibility given to a person or entity to care for and make decisions on behalf of a minor child who is not able to care for themselves." .

<RT2d0T4EpePjvAggumq3Dx> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Treaty Trader Visa" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RD1oQDMlC6FytjOndhJTMy8> ;
    skos:altLabel "E-1 Visa"@en-us ;
    skos:definition "The Treaty Trader Visa is a visa category designed for nationals of countries with which the United States maintains a treaty of commerce and navigation. The visa allows individuals or companies to enter and conduct substantial trade activities, such as the exchange of goods, services, or technology, between the host and treaty countries." .

<RTUYPssMryBw6n3gCyegpE> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Hope" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBZqFAgKcZ5EESijJoUuppE> ;
    skos:altLabel "Christian Hope"^^xsd:string,
        "Confidence in Grace"^^xsd:string,
        "Hope against Despair"^^xsd:string,
        "Trust in Divine Promise"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Hope is the theological virtue by which a person confidently desires and expects eternal life and the means to attain it, trusting in God’s promises and grace. Hope sustains perseverance amid difficulty by anchoring the heart in God’s faithfulness rather than human strength."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Hope counters despair by anchoring expectation in God’s mercy."^^xsd:string,
        "Hope directs human longing toward eternal communion with God."^^xsd:string,
        "Hope moves a person to persevere in prayer despite apparent delay."^^xsd:string,
        "Hope strengthens moral resolve when outcomes remain uncertain."^^xsd:string,
        "Hope sustains a believer’s trust in God during prolonged suffering."^^xsd:string .

<RUNLCn2Rg6sTs0a0jQPg6O> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Colleges, Universities, and Professional Schools Industry" ;
    dc:identifier "EDU-COLU" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RB7IaNyshrHiqug0LlmK6J2> ;
    skos:altLabel "Colleges, Universities, and Professional Schools",
        "Colleges, Universities, and Professional Schools Industry"@en-gb,
        "Industria de Colegios, Universidades y Escuelas Profesionales"@es-es,
        "Industria de Colegios, Universidades y Escuelas Profesionales"@es-mx,
        "תעשיית מכללות, אוניברסיטאות ובתי ספר מקצועיים"@he-il,
        "कॉलेज, विश्वविद्यालय और पेशेवर स्कूल उद्योग"@hi-in ;
    skos:definition "Colleges, universities, and professional schools furnishing academic courses and granting academic degrees. The requirement for admission is at least a high school diploma or equivalent general academic training." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "COLU" .

<RV1sBg6qkfqNkfEqQ8FnMc> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Environmental Review Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBeZkopwGsxt3K5BXOgNBNF> ;
    skos:altLabel "Environmental Impact Assessment Claim" ;
    skos:definition "An Environmental Review Claim is a legal action asserting that a project or action has not adequately complied with environmental impact assessment requirements mandated by law. Such claims typically allege insufficient analysis of potential environmental effects, failure to consider alternatives, or inadequate mitigation measures for identified impacts." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Ecological Impact Evaluation Claim" .

<RV4L5X2yX1m5QEAPC9Ys6m> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Middle Eastern / North African" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC50Vs3pkDyvqMHRukXE98O> ;
    skos:altLabel "MENA",
        "Naher Osten / Nordafrika"@de-de,
        "Moyen-Orient / Afrique du Nord"@fr-fr,
        "中東/北アフリカ"@ja-jp,
        "Oriente Médio / Norte da África"@pt-br,
        "中东/北非"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Middle Eastern / North African (MENA) is an ethnicity that refers to individuals who originate from or have ancestry in the regions of the Middle East and North Africa, which encompass countries such as Egypt, Iran, Iraq, Israel, Lebanon, Morocco, Saudi Arabia, and Turkey, among others. This diverse group of people shares historical, cultural, linguistic, and religious ties, while also exhibiting distinct differences across the various nations and communities." .

<RVR7H8k9X3Zf9PluTbj8J2> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Forgiveness" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9F1zhfl4EiAf0VCEYCEnon> ;
    skos:altLabel "Merciful Pardon"^^xsd:string,
        "Reconciliation of Heart"^^xsd:string,
        "Release of Resentment"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Forgiveness is the moral and spiritual act by which a person freely releases resentment and the desire for revenge against one who has caused harm. Forgiveness restores charity by entrusting justice to God and opening the possibility of reconciliation and healing."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Forgiveness allows healing to begin even when reconciliation is not yet possible."^^xsd:string,
        "Forgiveness enables a person to relinquish bitterness after being wronged."^^xsd:string,
        "Forgiveness moves a believer to pray for those who caused harm."^^xsd:string .

<RWPAR8mURSWNvu-4-zNhvQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Confectionery Merchant Wholesalers" ;
