    skos:example "Catholic doctrine teaches that God the Son became incarnate as Jesus Christ." ;
    skos:example "Christians worship God the Son together with the Father and the Holy Spirit." ;
    skos:example "The Creed proclaims the Son as eternally begotten of the Father." ;
