        "Créancier non garanti"@fr-fr,
        "גורם יוצא מן הכלל"@he-il,
        "असुरक्षित ऋणदाता"@hi-in,
        "未担保債権者"@ja-jp,
        "Credor quirografário"@pt-br,
        "无抵押债权人"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "An unsecured creditor is an individual or institution that lends money without obtaining specified assets as collateral. If a borrower fails to make payment on debt that is unsecured, the creditor cannot take any of the borrower's assets without winning a lawsuit first." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "UCRD" .

