<R2KPYsdWkWMbWmP6hpsr2c> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Universal Healthcare Coverage Policy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9ihoRPcnCIxjpGoNYzMi2Y> ;
    skos:definition "Universal healthcare coverage refers to a system where all residents of a country have access to healthcare services, usually funded by the government. In the U.S., Medicare is often cited as an example, though it primarily serves individuals 65 and older or those with specific disabilities, rather than the entire population." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Medicare Coverage" .

<R35766718645c394c2615294> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Office of Special Counsel for Immigration-Related Unfair Employment Practices" ;
    dc:identifier "US-FD-DOJ-CRD-OSC" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <REC6f02781e263496ed08afb> ;
    skos:altLabel "Büro des Sonderberaters für Einwanderungsbezogene Unfaire Beschäftigungspraktiken"@de-de,
        "Office of Special Counsel for Immigration-Related Unfair Employment Practices"@en-gb,
        "Oficina del Consejero Especial para Prácticas de Empleo Injustas Relacionadas con la Inmigración"@es-es,
        "Oficina del Consejero Especial para Prácticas de Empleo Injustas Relacionadas con la Inmigración"@es-mx,
        "Bureau du conseiller spécial pour les pratiques d'emploi injustes liées à l'immigration"@fr-fr,
        "המשרד לייעוץ מיוחד לפעילויות עסקיות בתחום ההעסקה עם עובדים זרים"@he-il,
        "विशेष जांच अधिकारी कार्यालय फॉर इमिग्रेशन-संबंधित अन्यायपूर्ण रोजगार प्रथाओं के लिए"@hi-in,
        "移民関連の不当な雇用慣行に関する特別顧問の事務局"@ja-jp,
        "Escritório do Conselheiro Especial para Práticas de Emprego Injustas Relacionadas à Imigração"@pt-br,
        "移民相关不公平就业实践特别顾问办公室"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Office of Special Counsel for Immigration-Related Unfair Employment Practices (OSC) investigates and prosecutes allegations of national origin and citizenship status discrimination in hiring, firing, and recruitment or referral for a fee, as well as unfair documentary practices during the employment eligibility verification process and retaliation under the anti-discrimination provision of the Immigration and Nationality Act (INA). In addition, OSC conducts outreach aimed at educating employers, workers and the general public about their rights and responsibilities under the INA's anti-discrimination provision." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "OSC" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Office of Special Counsel for Immigration-Related Unfair Employment Practices" .

<R3JSBxP8r1OUSNgxHhgv9> a owl:Class ;
