        "Delitos Incompletos"@pt-br,
        "未遂犯罪行为"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Inchoate Criminal Offenses are incomplete or anticipatory criminal acts that have not yet been fully carried out, but are still punishable by law." .

<R7nCzcmx7E2irmj7iF0N1Uk> a owl:Class ;
