        "वस्तुओं और सेवाओं की श्रेणियाँ"@hi-in,
        "商品・役務のクラス"@ja-jp,
        "Classes de bens e serviços"@pt-br,
        "商品和服务类别"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "When filing for trademark registration, the classes of goods or services that the trademark covers (e.g., clothing, electronics, musical groups), as defined by the regulatory agency (e.g., U.S. Patent & Trademark Office)." .

<RBn4ChBncWmOuUIe6bkjBAV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Paternity Acknowledgement" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBCzyIAi2Hjl80hfQr8wAMR> ;
    skos:definition "Paternity acknowledgement is a legal document or process by which a man formally recognizes and claims himself to be the biological father of a child born outside of marriage. Signing this acknowledgement typically grants the father certain rights and responsibilities related to the child, such as custody or support, and establishes the child's legal relationship to the father." .

<RBoWiy766xn2DwDMjWqMUbb> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Criminal Intent" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RDxGK5OqVpRO03T7ZY8jtBe> ],
