        "Réclamations de responsabilité alimentaire"@fr-fr,
        "תביעות אחריות מזון"@he-il,
        "खाद्य दायित्व दावे"@hi-in,
        "食品責任請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicações de responsabilidade alimentar"@pt-br,
        "食品责任索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A food liability claim is a civil claim related to harm caused by consuming contaminated or poisoned food products." .

<RBqyMMilyJsOelem8C8QQRu> a owl:Class ;
