        "Separación Legal"@es-mx,
        "Séparation de corps"@fr-fr,
        "הפרדה משפטית"@he-il,
        "कानूनी अलगाव"@hi-in,
        "別居"@ja-jp,
        "Separação judicial"@pt-br,
        "法律分居"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Legal Separation: A legal process that allows a married couple to live apart while remaining legally married, often involving court orders regarding property division, child custody, and support." .

<RBxqZs1JzyYftyuWzx1yHib> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Bystander Emotional Distress" ;
