        "Indústria de materiais de construção e equipamentos de jardim"@pt-br,
        "建筑材料和园艺设备行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Industries in the Building Material and Garden Equipment and Supplies Dealers subsector retail new building materials, hardware, paint, and garden and outdoor power equipment and supplies.  Establishments in this subsector with fixed point-of-sale locations, including home centers and retail lumber yards, may display merchandise either indoors or outdoors under covered areas.  The staff is usually knowledgeable in the use of the specific products being retailed in the construction, repair, and maintenance of the home and associated grounds." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "BMGD" .

