<RCH1NJTVGwEmadkYOldsHtQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Mutual Fund" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCzxVprwB3RwZ8EMewt18Jt> ;
    skos:definition "A Mutual Fund is an investment vehicle that pools money from various investors to purchase a diversified portfolio of assets, which can include stocks, bonds, money market instruments, or other securities. Managed by professional portfolio managers, the fund aims to generate returns for its investors according to its stated investment objectives, while spreading risk across a range of assets." .

<RCLhlWbP1bW4sRAflunmrrz> a owl:Class ;
