        "Visual Art" ;
    skos:definition "Art refers to the expression or application of human creative skill and imagination, typically in a visual form such as painting or sculpture, producing works to be appreciated primarily for their beauty or emotional power. It encompasses various mediums, techniques, and styles, which are often subject to cultural and historical context." .

<RCXmZbkCGNYfkmZHX1WWCqW> a owl:Class ;
