        "律师在某个司法管辖区的执业准入"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of \"Lawyer's Admission to Practice in a Jurisdiction\" refers to the process and requirements for a lawyer to be authorized to practice law in a specific geographic area, including the lawyer's identification number and the year of admission." .

<RChhcQCDBa1uy1Bh7EJHlwO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Environmental Obligations" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBeZkopwGsxt3K5BXOgNBNF> ],
        <R8Gt68Hspze0zsEdYzUS2Fq> ;
    skos:altLabel "Environmental Liability" ;
    skos:definition "Environmental Obligations, also known as Environmental Liabilities, refer to a company's legal responsibilities for the remediation or restoration of environmental damage, often due to its operations or business practices. These obligations are recorded as liabilities on the company's balance sheet and can include costs for cleanup, legal penalties, and ongoing monitoring, which may be significant and long-term." .

<RChjSc2XuaDiZnlxpusNIxT> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Physical Examination" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty <RznfymBGs7WesrwWNzQLov> ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RWfagTf41k5BuDMRrHd87x> ],
        <R9XqhlDRrcrbyXu5YJVhaoW> ;
    skos:altLabel "Physical Exam",
        "Körperliche Untersuchung"@de-de,
        "Physical Examination"@en-gb,
        "Examen Físico"@es-es,
        "Examen Físico"@es-mx,
        "Examen physique"@fr-fr,
        "בדיקה פיזית"@he-il,
        "शारीरिक जांच"@hi-in,
        "身体検査"@ja-jp,
        "Exame físico"@pt-br,
        "体格检查"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Physical Examination is a type of Discovery Event that involves a medical professional examining a person's body to assess their health and identify any physical evidence that may be relevant to a legal case." .

<RCkVEfL4H41pColicGhkXJb> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Lymphoma" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/13.00-NeoplasticDiseases-Malignant-Adult.htm#13_05> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDF3VrmH1eapfkrSQstevLs> ;
    skos:altLabel "Lymphatic Cancer",
        "Lymphatic System Cancer",
        "Malignant Lymphoma" ;
    skos:definition "Lymphoma is a type of cancer that originates in the lymphatic system, which includes the lymph nodes, spleen, thymus gland, and bone marrow. It encompasses various subtypes, including Hodgkin lymphoma and Non-Hodgkin lymphoma, with distinct characteristics and treatment approaches, but excludes T-cell lymphoblastic lymphoma." .

<RClFNLrDawcQ4HuRbzm6JJI> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Obligation Directionality" ;
    rdfs:seeAlso "folio:hasObligation"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R8428LJEfCIiJBkESQPpEhQ> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R8VN5tK4TtD0GqDw2NCbaLr> ],
        <RDtFkLR3v97fran5zQ3ugao> ;
    skos:altLabel "Contractual Directionality" ;
    skos:definition "In which direction does the contractual right and/or obligation flow? Example: \"Party A indemnifies Party B.\"" ;
    skos:example "Party A indemnifies Party B."^^xsd:string,
        "Party X promised to pay Party Y."^^xsd:string .

<RCruZXlq2qqJ1radTwtBG4o> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Ethical Concepts" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDQC6BrYjcS3V0gZcYzqc8O> ;
    skos:altLabel "Concepts of Ethical Evaluation"^^xsd:string,
        "Ethical Notions"^^xsd:string,
        "Normative Ethical Concepts"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Ethical Concepts are normative ideas that articulate standards of right and wrong human action, character, and intention. Ethical Concepts guide moral judgment by expressing values and principles that order human behavior toward the good."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Beneficence motivates actions intended to promote another’s well-being."^^xsd:string,
        "Justice guides decisions about distributing benefits and burdens fairly."^^xsd:string,
        "Nonmaleficence restrains actions that would cause unjustified harm."^^xsd:string,
        "Respect for dignity limits how persons may be used to achieve good ends."^^xsd:string,
        "Solidarity shapes ethical responses to social and communal needs."^^xsd:string .

<RCtVq1uma9QpsVZHKZuLBkJ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Insurance Document" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBCzyIAi2Hjl80hfQr8wAMR> ;
    skos:definition "An Insurance Document is a formal written record that encompasses all types of materials related to the underwriting, administration, and execution of insurance policies. Examples include insurance forms, policies, and reinsurance agreements." .

<RCuTj4Z7aSLh4BBpXWs0ci4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Transit Visa" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RD1oQDMlC6FytjOndhJTMy8> ;
    skos:altLabel "C-1 Visa"@en-us ;
    skos:definition "A transit visa is a short-term visa that allows travelers to pass through a foreign country en route to another destination. This type of visa is generally valid for a very limited period, often 24 to 72 hours, and does not permit the holder to engage in activities like tourism or business within the transit country." .

<RCumhwfe7bWcT6Z8Z8sw9fh> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Executive Branch" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R9F95mfTrWVKPo393htsyq1> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RsDXW4XOplruZcWE3sKbal> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R34OeWRUurl4TJP99m6uiC> ],
        <RS4MNLzEw9KGWGaiRAbgdF> ;
    skos:definition "The executive branch is responsible for implementing, administering, and enforcing the laws enacted by the legislative branch. It is typically headed by a president, prime minister, or monarch, and includes various administrative agencies and departments." .

<RCvb7DRTrs3IXqMIxQebYS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Creation of the World" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9UDmEBnO3ljL9IWnuJcCnY> ;
    skos:altLabel "Creation of the Cosmos"^^xsd:string,
        "Creation of the Heavens and the Earth"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Creation of the World means the divine act by which God brought the universe into existence from nothing, ordering all that is according to wisdom and goodness. Creation of the World reveals God as the sole Creator and affirms the inherent goodness and intelligibility of all creation."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Catholic theology affirms the creation of the world as a free and loving act of God."^^xsd:string,
        "The Book of Genesis proclaims that God created the heavens and the earth in the beginning."^^xsd:string .

<RCwT0yMShmi5V0Q2Y9Yn070> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Wage Theft Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9UYGSnWQz2MvNsWUofGb6J> ;
    skos:altLabel "Lohnraubanspruch"@de-de,
        "Wage Theft Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamación de robo de salarios"@es-es,
        "Reclamo de robo de salarios"@es-mx,
        "Réclamation de vol de salaire"@fr-fr,
        "תביעה על גניבת שכר"@he-il,
        "वेतन चोरी का दावा"@hi-in,
        "賃金盗難請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação de roubo de salário"@pt-br,
        "工资盗窃索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A wage theft claim is a legal action taken by an employee against an employer for the unlawful withholding of wages or benefits that the employee is entitled to receive." .

<RCx9GuPni9uwMsDX2m5EXxB> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Negligent Operation of Activity Requiring Franchise or License" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R85GQaqi3P8fuEDkEpx55YE> ;
    skos:altLabel "Fahrlässiger Betrieb einer Tätigkeit, die eine Franchise oder Lizenz erfordert"@de-de,
        "Negligent Operation of Activity Requiring Franchise or License"@en-gb,
        "Operación negligente de actividad que requiere franquicia o licencia"@es-es,
        "Operación negligente de actividad que requiere franquicia o licencia"@es-mx,
        "Exploitation négligente d'une activité nécessitant une franchise ou une licence"@fr-fr,
        "פעולה שלא יסודית של פעילות הדורשת רישיון או רישיון ייצור"@he-il,
        "फ्रैंचाइज़ या लाइसेंस की आवश्यकता वाली गतिविधि के लिए लापरवाह ऑपरेशन"@hi-in,
        "フランチャイズまたはライセンスを必要とする活動の過失操作"@ja-jp,
        "Operação negligente de atividade que requer franquia ou licença"@pt-br,
        "需要特许经营或许可证的活动的疏忽操作"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Negligent Operation of Activity Requiring Franchise or License refers to a legal claim for damages resulting from the careless or reckless operation of a business or activity that requires a franchise or license to operate, such as a taxi service or a liquor store." .

<RD0fU7sBZWOEYH2VBJIO7p> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Employee Hire Event" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBila9ckW95W84Tk54tGfZO> ;
    skos:definition "An Employee Hire Event refers to the specific instance when an individual formally becomes an employee of a company, often marked by the signing of an employment contract and completion of onboarding processes. The official start date of employment may affect benefits, seniority, and other employment conditions." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Employee Start Date",
        "Hiring Event" .

<RD2RElTCvTbk5aUX9CfbJC5> a owl:Class ;
