        "Lei questionávelmente operativa"@pt-br,
        "有争议的适用法律"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The efficacy of a legal authority (e.g., judicial opinion, statute, regulation) is in doubt, usually through the action of some decisionmaker (e.g., judge, regulator, legislator), through some act (e.g., statutory codification, review of statutory constitutionality)." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Citator - Orange Flag" .

<RDDmzFedWDpLN1Xtuy3FiLh> a owl:Class ;
