        "दबाव"@hi-in,
        "強要"@ja-jp,
        "Coação"@pt-br,
        "胁迫"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Duress is a legal defense that can be used in civil litigation to excuse or justify a party's actions when they were performed under the threat of harm or coercion." .

<RDE27640D20253AD6e26B78e> a owl:Class ;
