        "गलत निकास या अंतिम करना"@hi-in,
        "不当解雇または終了"@ja-jp,
        "Demissão ou rescisão injusta"@pt-br,
        "非法解雇或终止"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Wrongful Discharge or Termination refers to the illegal firing or dismissal of an employee by an employer, in violation of the law or employment contract." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Wrongful Termination" .

<RDJvfvUzCUfCqBqkpPjclIi> a owl:Class ;
