        "Crowned Head",
        "Her Majesty",
        "Majesty",
        "Ruler",
        "Sovereign",
        "Sultan" ;
    skos:definition "A Monarch is a sovereign head of state, typically a king or queen, who reigns over a country or territory by hereditary right or election. This individual holds a position of supreme authority within a monarchy, often serving as both the ceremonial figurehead and, in some cases, an active participant in governance." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Emperor" .

<RDlItdnVxvODqT0Waa9XBcg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Theological Dispute" ;
    rdfs:comment "In a global Catholic ontology, a Theological Dispute involves a formal or informal disagreement regarding the interpretation of the Deposit of Faith, sacred scripture, or ecclesiastical tradition. The Church views these events as critical moments for clarification, where the Magisterium exercises its authority to preserve the unity of the faith and protect the truth from error."^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7O9EXc5CO83M0CzT8VzNFT> ;
    skos:altLabel "Dogmatic Debate"^^xsd:string,
        "Ecclesiastical Dispute"^^xsd:string,
        "Religious Dissension"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "A Theological Dispute is a formal or informal contention between individuals or groups concerning the interpretation of divine revelation, doctrine, or Church law. It necessitates a rigorous intellectual and spiritual examination to discern the truth and maintain the ecclesial communion of the faithful."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Conducting a formal dialogue between theologians to resolve differing interpretations of a specific papal encyclical."^^xsd:string,
        "Engaging in an ecumenical council to address widespread confusion regarding a particular article of faith."^^xsd:string,
        "Mediating a disagreement within a religious community regarding the application of a liturgical norm."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:prefLabel "Doctrinal Controversy"^^xsd:string .

<RDlMwQ5nSrgZMByjzjtXnUO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Government Representative" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R8gPVPSW76auMkhwuIg1CBc> ],
        <RD2KAbcnrk0vfpUCEog3N9F> ;
    skos:definition "A Government Representative refers to any individual who acts on behalf of a governmental body, whether they are an elected official, an appointed official, or a regular employee. The term encompasses a wide range of roles, from high-ranking government officials who make policy decisions to government employees who carry out administrative tasks, all serving the interests of the state or public they represent." .

<RDlUNUSYsLydg1YtgDPDCk5> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Farmland" ;
