        "Davidic Covenants"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Historical moments and theological developments surrounding God's eternal promise to King David that his dynasty would endure forever and that the Messiah would come from his lineage. These events establish the foundation for understanding Christ as the fulfillment of God's covenantal promise to David."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "God promised David through the prophet Nathan that his throne would endure forever."^^xsd:string,
        "Solomon built the temple, fulfilling God's promise that David's son would construct a house for the Lord's name."^^xsd:string,
        "The angel Gabriel announced to Mary that her son would receive the throne of David."^^xsd:string .

