    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in preparing the dead for burial or interment, conducting funerals, operating sites or structures reserved for the interment of human or animals remains, and/or cremating the dead." .

<n3Z4zQ2sSTSaYIkP3lfRqw> a owl:Class ;
