        "Objetivos Transaccionales"@es-mx,
        "Objectifs transactionnels"@fr-fr,
        "מטרות עסקיות"@he-il,
        "लेन-देन उद्देश्य"@hi-in,
        "トランザクション目標"@ja-jp,
        "Objetivos transacionais"@pt-br,
        "交易目标"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Transactional Objectives are specific aims, goals, plans, or intentions related to a legal transaction, such as a merger or acquisition, and the frameworks that support their execution." .

