<R72p6HAKCuvyIWvgxuoCM9R> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Employment Hierarchical Role" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RGOU62BPz1QTVsWRE2Nodz> ;
    skos:definition "Employment Hierarchical Role refers to an employee's position within the organizational structure in terms of authority and responsibility. Common hierarchical roles include managers, who have oversight and decision-making responsibilities for a team, and individual contributors, who are subject matter experts or skilled workers that focus on executing specific tasks without direct managerial duties." .

<R75X7YZe3jw77Sogk8Vz8NT> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Home Insurance Policy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9uTFHGFCMBjtYw5MOmpotJ> ;
    skos:definition "A home insurance policy is a contract between a homeowner and an insurance provider that offers financial protection against damages to the home, its contents, or liability claims arising from injuries on the property. The policy outlines the covered perils, such as fire, theft, or natural disasters, and requires the payment of premiums for the coverage to remain active." .

<R765fdd1D03d3269330E964e> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "National Institute for Occupational Safety and Health" ;
    dc:identifier "US-FD-HHS-CDC-NIOSH" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R94B33d82F0f400A2318D6d5> ;
    skos:altLabel "Nationales Institut für Arbeitsschutz und Gesundheitsschutz am Arbeitsplatz"@de-de,
        "National Institute for Occupational Safety and Health"@en-gb,
        "Instituto Nacional de Seguridad e Higiene en el Trabajo"@es-es,
        "Instituto Nacional de Seguridad e Higiene en el Trabajo"@es-mx,
        "Institut national pour la sécurité et la santé au travail"@fr-fr,
        "המכון הלאומי לבטיחות ובריאות בעבודה"@he-il,
        "राष्ट्रीय व्यावसायिक सुरक्षा और स्वास्थ्य संस्थान"@hi-in,
        "労働安全衛生研究所"@ja-jp,
        "Instituto Nacional de Segurança e Saúde Ocupacional"@pt-br,
        "国家职业安全健康研究所"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The National Institute for Occupational Safety and Health (NIOSH) is the United States federal agency responsible for conducting research and making recommendations for the prevention of work-related injury and illness." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "NIOSH" ;
    skos:prefLabel "National Institute for Occupational Safety and Health" .

<R78628205A89f066538E9835> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Illinois State Courts" ;
    dc:identifier "USCTS-STCOUS-IL" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
