        "Objectionable Material",
        "Prohibited Material",
        "Unsuitable Content" ;
    skos:definition "Inappropriate Content refers to claim regarding material that is deemed offensive, objectionable, or unsuitable for certain audiences, often violating societal norms or legal standards. This can include offensive language, explicit material, or any content that is considered harmful or inappropriate for public display or consumption." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Offensive Material" .

