        "Industria de gestión y remedio de residuos"@es-mx,
        "Industrie des services de gestion des déchets et de remédiation"@fr-fr,
        "תעשיית ניהול וטיפול בפסולת"@he-il,
        "कचरा प्रबंधन और उपचार सेवा उद्योग"@hi-in,
        "廃棄物管理および浄化サービス産業"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de serviços de gerenciamento de resíduos e remediação"@pt-br,
        "废物管理和修复服务行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Industries in this group are engaged in the collection, treatment, and disposal of waste materials. This includes establishments engaged in local hauling of waste materials; operating materials recovery facilities (i.e., those that sort recyclable materials from the trash stream); providing remediation services (i.e., those that provide for the cleanup of contaminated buildings, mine sites, soil, or ground water); and providing septic pumping and other miscellaneous waste management services. There are three industry groups within the subsector that separate these activities into waste collection, waste treatment and disposal, and remediation and other waste management." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "WAST" .

<R8RJIpODageO9V5kZNQgKns> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Food Services and Drinking Places Industry" ;
    dc:identifier "AFS-FSDP" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDeR0053Q1cPSk9hSjORcBT> ;
    skos:altLabel "Food Services and Drinking Places",
        "Gastronomie- und Getränkebranche"@de-de,
        "Food Services and Drinking Places Industry"@en-gb,
        "Industria de Servicios de Comida y Bebida"@es-es,
        "Industria de Servicios de Alimentos y Bebidas"@es-mx,
        "Industrie des services alimentaires et des boissons"@fr-fr,
        "תעשיית שירותי מזון ומשקאות"@he-il,
        "खाद्य सेवा और पेय प्लेस उद्योग"@hi-in,
        "飲食サービス業"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de serviços de alimentação e bebidas"@pt-br,
        "餐饮服务和饮料行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Industries in this froup prepare meals, snacks, and beverages to customer order for immediate on-premises and off-premises consumption. There is a wide range of establishments in these industries. Some provide food and drink only; while others provide various combinations of seating space, waiter/waitress services and incidental amenities, such as limited entertainment. The group includes special food services, such as food service contractors, caterers, and mobile food services; drinking places; and restaurants and other eating places." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "FSDP" .

<R8YA4v37gGvqOV4PG5iNn6j> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Household Appliances and Electrical and Electronic Goods Merchant Wholesalers Industry" ;
    dc:identifier "WHT-WHEL" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=4236> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R97XG1bV4Mx6t2B4cpMlF0U> ;
    skos:altLabel "Wholesale Electronic Markets",
        "Großhandel mit elektronischen Märkten"@de-de,
        "Wholesale Electronic Markets Industry"@en-gb,
        "Industria de Mercados Electrónicos Mayoristas"@es-es,
        "Industria de Mercados Electrónicos al por Mayor"@es-mx,
        "Industrie des marchés électroniques de gros"@fr-fr,
        "תעשיית שווקי מכירה בתפזורת אלקטרוניים"@he-il,
        "होलसेल इलेक्ट्रॉनिक मार्केट उद्योग"@hi-in,
        "卸売電子市場産業"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de mercados eletrônicos de atacado"@pt-br,
        "批发电子市场行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in the merchant wholesale distribution of electrical apparatus and equipment, wiring supplies, and related equipment; household appliances, electric housewares, and consumer electronics; and other electronic parts and equipment." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "WHEL" .

<R8Yn0rpoHNTFiymo0I8CAVf> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Somatic Symptom and Related Disorders" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/12.00-MentalDisorders-Adult.htm#12_00B1>,
        <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/12.00-MentalDisorders-Adult.htm#12_07> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RN3TubQIlusDFnPgrNAk8D> ;
    skos:altLabel "Somatic Disorders" ;
    skos:definition "These disorders are characterized by physical symptoms or deficits that are not intentionally produced or feigned, and that, following clinical investigation, cannot be fully explained by a general medical condition, another mental disorder, the direct effects of a substance, or a culturally sanctioned behavior or experience. These disorders may also be characterized by a preoccupation with having or acquiring a serious medical condition that has not been identified or diagnosed. Symptoms and signs may include, but are not limited to, pain and other abnormalities of sensation, gastrointestinal symptoms, fatigue, a high level of anxiety about personal health status, abnormal motor movement, pseudoseizures, and pseudoneurological symptoms, such as blindness or deafness." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Somatoform Disorders" .

<R8ZoCkJhvFXilc4nMQUQffJ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Christ-Centered Devotions" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDJkQMNK5utxd5sRAmWPnUw> ;
    skos:altLabel "Christological Devotions"^^xsd:string,
        "Devotions to Jesus Christ"^^xsd:string,
        "Devotions to Our Lord"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Christ-Centered Devotions are devotional practices that focus directly on the person, mysteries, and saving work of Jesus Christ. They foster deeper union with Christ and complement the Church’s liturgy without replacing it."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Christ-centered devotions deepen personal relationship with Jesus."^^xsd:string,
        "These Christ-centered devotionssupport, but do not replace, the liturgy."^^xsd:string .

<R8bNzp6lTyATfctRVnXr5rl> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Driver" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R1okJKMvv4mMHv7m4TzwBe> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
