        "Empleado"@es-mx,
        "Employé"@fr-fr,
        "עובד"@he-il,
        "कर्मचारी"@hi-in,
        "従業員"@ja-jp,
        "Funcionário"@pt-br,
        "雇员"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "An employee is a person who is hired for a wage, salary, fee or payment to perform work for an employer." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "EMPE" .

<R8eB4tGcIUItbvkSlnjfbOw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Jesus' Nature Miracles" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RvsGnqbpH0lHwlXuGAmIqD> ;
    skos:altLabel "Miracles over Creation"^^xsd:string,
        "Nature Miracles of Jesus"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Jesus’ Nature Miracles means the miraculous acts by which Jesus Christ exercised authority over the natural world during his public ministry. Jesus’ Nature Miracles reveal Christ as Lord of creation and manifest divine power over forces of nature."^^xsd:string .

<R8fFf9YNTCtz4Q15Jjj7AXF> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Sentence Type" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R0tJKDoGSixec7FgGKnAAl> ;
    skos:altLabel "Judicial Penalty Type",
        "Sentencing Option" ;
    skos:definition "A Sentence Type refers to the specific form of punishment or rehabilitation imposed by a court upon a convicted offender. This category encompasses various approaches to criminal sentencing, each designed to address the nature of the offense, the circumstances of the offender, and the goals of the justice system." .

<R8gPVPSW76auMkhwuIg1CBc> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Transit Visa for Government Officials and Entourage" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCuTj4Z7aSLh4BBpXWs0ci4> ;
    skos:altLabel "C-3 Visa"@en-us ;
    skos:definition "A transit visa for government officials and their entourage is a specialized type of visa that allows high-ranking government representatives and their accompanying staff to pass through a foreign country en route to another destination for official duties. This visa is generally valid for a limited period and may come with certain privileges or immunities, depending on the diplomatic agreements between the countries involved." .

<R8hTuQBrWujQeiTDrPH1tbQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Furniture, Home Furnishings, Electronics, and Appliance Retailers Industry" ;
    dc:identifier "RET-ELAP" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=449> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDfdmGR6iPi4k2t6ecIUBkP> ;
    skos:altLabel "Electronics and Appliance Stores",
        "Elektronik- und Haushaltsgerätehandel"@de-de,
        "Electronics and Appliance Store Industry"@en-gb,
        "Industria de tiendas de electrónica y electrodomésticos"@es-es,
        "Industria de tiendas de electrónica y electrodomésticos"@es-mx,
        "Industrie des magasins d'électronique et d'appareils électroménagers"@fr-fr,
        "תעשיית חנויות אלקטרוניקה ומכשירי חשמל"@he-il,
        "इलेक्ट्रॉनिक्स और उपकरण स्टोर उद्योग"@hi-in,
        "電子製品および家電店業界"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de lojas de eletrônicos e eletrodomésticos"@pt-br,
        "电子和家电商店行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Industries in the Furniture, Home Furnishings, Electronics, and Appliance Retailers subsector retail new furniture, home furnishings, electronics, and appliances.  Establishments in this subsector with fixed point-of-sale locations may operate from showrooms or other locations that have substantial areas for the presentation or demonstration of their products.  Establishments in this subsector may provide incidental services, including interior decorating, product assembly, installation, or repair services." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "ELAP" .

<R8hw8N5f6CCS519HZccaPdl> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Arrest of Jesus" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RD0JfBltrTwUJkeYjw8iN1P> ;
    skos:altLabel "Seizure of Jesus"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Arrest of Jesus means the seizure of Jesus Christ by the Temple authorities, accompanied by Roman involvement, in the Garden of Gethsemane following his betrayal. Arrest of Jesus initiates the formal sequence of judicial and extrajudicial actions leading to Christ’s Passion and death."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Christian tradition reflects on the arrest of Jesus as the moment he freely submits to unjust suffering."^^xsd:string,
        "The Gospels recount Jesus being arrested in the Garden of Gethsemane after Judas’ betrayal."^^xsd:string .

<R8ibMTtrBCWGIGOeFjTLtL0> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Correctional Facility - Real Estate Asset" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RUhSbbDJZa8Crs3tIWcIfV> ;
    skos:altLabel "Correctional Facility",
        "Correctional Property",
        "Incarceration Facility" ;
    skos:definition "A Correctional Facility includes properties specifically designed, constructed, and operated to confine individuals who have been arrested, are awaiting trial, or have been convicted of crimes. These assets encompass a range of facilities, including prisons, jails, detention centers, and penitentiaries, and are critical components of the criminal justice system." .

<R8jIR8iqxwPvaiF10RkWcgO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Improper Opinion Objection" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBKBnWyBmr5Hmg5T3VdTFxL> ],
        <RCEx7g3wSm7TRkpl2WQko0s> ;
    skos:definition "An Improper Opinion Objection is raised when a party in a legal proceeding believes that a witness is offering an opinion or conclusion that is not based on their expertise or is not permissible under the rules of evidence. This objection aims to ensure that opinions presented in court are relevant, based on proper expertise, and allowed by law." .

<R8jqfUwpteNxuBdyvBeZXp3> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Good Samaritan Liability" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R9jNLx5iR4vOfU2Gp8bOZ3K> ],
        <RCfunX4u69LUQ3gbhckE0oI> ;
    skos:altLabel "Emergency Aid Not Given or Not Properly Given",
        "Haftung des guten Samariters"@de-de,
        "Good Samaritan Liability"@en-gb,
        "Responsabilidad del buen samaritano"@es-es,
        "Responsabilidad del buen samaritano"@es-mx,
        "Responsabilité du bon samaritain"@fr-fr,
        "אחריות הסמרטן הטוב"@he-il,
        "अच्छा समरिटन दायित्व"@hi-in,
        "善意のサマリア人責任"@ja-jp,
        "Responsabilidade do bom samaritano"@pt-br,
        "好心人责任"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Good Samaritan Liability refers to the legal responsibility of an individual who fails to provide or properly provide emergency aid to someone in need, despite having the ability to do so, and may be held liable for any resulting harm." .

<R8mhr9YGlyTNig0Qdru2f4t> a owl:Class ;
