    skos:definition "The concept of \"Case Transferred\" refers to the action of moving a legal matter from one court or jurisdiction to another, and is a subcategory of the broader concept of \"Case Closed / Disposed\"." .

<R95guixnTkbGJG76O2QxnVx> a owl:Class ;
