    skos:definition "Negligent Infliction of Emotional Distress refers to a legal claim that arises when a person suffers emotional harm due to the negligent actions of another party, either as a direct victim or as a bystander." .

<RCUAcLSyxeRKsnkjTydl6sM> a owl:Class ;
