    rdfs:subClassOf <RClhbl4E1TJp9LygIXewIhn> ;
    skos:definition "In a legal context, an exception refers to a situation or circumstance that deviates from the general rule or norm. Exceptions are typically invoked to address specific conditions or cases that require special consideration or treatment within a legal framework." .

