        "Bergbau- und Rohstoffextraktionsindustrie"@de-de,
        "Mining and Natural Resources Extraction Industry"@en-gb,
        "Industria minera y de extracción de recursos naturales"@es-es,
        "Industria minera y de extracción de recursos naturales"@es-mx,
        "Industrie minière et d'extraction des ressources naturelles"@fr-fr,
        "תעשיית החציבה והחקלאות הטבעית"@he-il,
        "खनन और प्राकृतिक संसाधन निष्कर्षण उद्योग"@hi-in,
        "鉱業および天然資源採取産業"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de mineração e extração de recursos naturais"@pt-br,
        "采矿和自然资源开采行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Mining and Natural Resources Extraction industry group comprises establishments that extract naturally occurring mineral solids, such as coal and ores; liquid minerals, such as crude petroleum; and gases, such as natural gas. The term mining is used in the broad sense to include quarrying, well operations, beneficiating (e.g., crushing, screening, washing, and flotation), and other preparation customarily performed at the mine site, or as a part of mining activity." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "NRS" .

<ROjlFsq58MnIV2nxc0IvNu> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Garnishee" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RijIqw1HEfQF4ctjWUlgnq> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R7OJQHant3Dx172WXuPbWgx> ],
        <RCEDL3kMYgjFUEOhOyGp3IE> ;
    skos:altLabel "Drittschuldner"@de-de,
        "Garnishee"@en-gb,
        "Embargado"@es-es,
        "Embargado"@es-mx,
        "Tiers saisi"@fr-fr,
        "גרנישי"@he-il,
        "गार्निशी"@hi-in,
        "差し押え"@ja-jp,
        "Terceiro executado"@pt-br,
        "扣押令"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A person who owes a debt to a judgment debtor, or a person other than the judgment debtor who has property in his possession or custody in which a judgment debtor has an interest. NY CPLR § 105.",
        "From U.S. District Court PACER" .

<RPkiSm11zOecVvnpuZ5VVH> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Senior Citizen" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RDa0nehxECXxnQM6X3gAbNJ> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RDSTWxMJK0mcdxB1oQtK7jC> ],
        <R8YEKFiYkowitD7dlvVs9Dj> ;
    skos:definition "A senior citizen, also referred to as an elderly person, is an individual who has reached an age where they are generally considered to be in the later stage of life, often defined as 65 years old or older in many societies. This age group may be eligible for certain benefits like retirement pensions, healthcare coverage, and various social services designed to support their well-being." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Elderly" .

<RQbVKPVl5dj5nW6aXoNxx4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Price-Based Market Segments" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7KxYUBMSAuzPHdBhWfPSv7> ;
    skos:definition "Price-based segments refer to divisions of the market that are categorized based on the pricing and affordability of products and services. These segments include luxury, budget, and mass market, each targeting consumers with different levels of purchasing power and preferences for price versus quality." .

<RSwOCeFhWxUA3fOiTvlja4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Government Benefits" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RLrqGkP9fi5OO2RhpttmVI> ;
    skos:altLabel "Public Assistance",
        "Social Benefits",
        "State Benefits" ;
    skos:definition "Government Benefits are financial assistance programs provided by the government to individuals in need, designed to support basic living expenses, healthcare, and other essential needs. These benefits include payments such as Social Security, unemployment benefits, and welfare payments, which help to ensure a safety net for the vulnerable and unemployed." .

<RUH9A0VJfKpItj0UkMldZQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Citations to Another Document" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDmbgHQXJxEvx3QYfR6qWAn> ;
    skos:altLabel "Verweise auf ein anderes Dokument"@de-de,
        "Citations to Another Document"@en-gb,
        "Citas a Otro Documento"@es-es,
        "Citas a Otro Documento"@es-mx,
        "Citations à un autre document"@fr-fr,
        "ציטוטים למסמך אחר"@he-il,
        "एक अन्य दस्तावेज़ को उद्धरण"@hi-in,
        "他の文書への引用"@ja-jp,
        "Citações a outro documento"@pt-br,
        "对另一份文件的引用"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A document's citations to other documents (e.g., legal authorities, exhibits, other documents)." .

<RUgWyAVlkn9ysIUzCG1Ahb> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Matter ID" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy "From LEDES (Legal Electronic Data Exchange Standard). https://ledes.org/" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8EoZh39tWmXCkmP2Xzjl6E>,
        <R9CZTlyeU1hg4NPl7hcDKI2> ;
    skos:altLabel "Vorgangs-ID"@de-de,
        "Matter ID"@en-gb,
        "ID de asunto"@es-es,
        "ID de asunto"@es-mx,
        "ID de l'affaire"@fr-fr,
        "מזהה נושא"@he-il,
        "मामला आईडी"@hi-in,
        "マターID"@ja-jp,
        "ID do assunto"@pt-br,
        "事项编号"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Matter ID refers to a unique identifier assigned to a specific legal matter within an engagement for providing legal services. That matter identifier (e.g., IRIs, UUIDs, GUIDs) can be created and stored within the systems of various stakeholders (e.g., vendors, sellers, buyers, courts, regulators)." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Matter Identifier" .

<RVu433XojPQPseoDXhidgO> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Population Density Market Segment" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7z0ey8ZMeOT1q01VNPe1HY> ;
    skos:definition "The population density market segment classifies consumers or businesses based on the density of people in their geographic area, such as urban, rural, or suburban regions. This segmentation helps businesses understand and address the varying needs, preferences, and purchasing behaviors of customers living in areas with different levels of population concentration." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Area Density Market Segment" .

<RYqnzVgHfUjot8PC4mJs0G> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Advertisement" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RVaHiNBU68DENmeHicnzro> ;
    skos:altLabel "Commercial Content",
        "Marketing Asset",
        "Marketing Content",
        "Promotional Material" ;
    skos:definition "An Advertisement, as a type of copyright asset, is a creative work designed to promote products, services, or ideas, protected under copyright law. This includes various forms of media such as print, digital, audio, and visual content, ensuring exclusive rights to the creator or owner against unauthorized use." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Advertising Asset" .

<RZ6hoxQD6Sa9Hi4bnv1jgC> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Age-Based Market Segment" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R8jMPIyAf6QTkMSrGDnGYz1> ],
        <R7KxYUBMSAuzPHdBhWfPSv7> ;
    skos:definition "Age-based market segments refer to divisions of the market that are categorized based on the age of consumers. These segments allow businesses to tailor their products, services, and marketing strategies to specific age groups, taking into account their unique preferences, lifestyles, and purchasing behaviors." .

<RaQIRktfYrGWDS7HAq0N6f> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Donation" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9sdPQV8kCK3BNF8jcPV5cD> ;
    skos:altLabel "Benefaction",
        "Contribution",
        "Endowment",
        "Grant" ;
    skos:definition "A Donation is a voluntary gift of money, goods, services, or property given to an individual, organization, or cause without expectation of reciprocation or direct personal benefit. This act of giving is typically motivated by altruism, support for a specific mission or goal, or a desire to contribute to societal well-being." .

<Rafw4pSzJ3S3d8sq6quprG> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Court Forum" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R85OMPBjCJJv2cpg2RCwYim> ;
    skos:definition "A Court Forum is a type of Dispute Forum that is administered by an organization or government entity and has specific levels and jurisdiction types for resolving legal disputes." .

<Rcm78ktCa1cCaDSJIY93Yz> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Sacramental Elements" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RB91Ir5bSOsoHyaGccORDpQ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Constitutive Elements of a Sacrament"^^xsd:string,
        "Sacramental Components"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Sacramental Elements are the essential components required for the valid celebration of a sacrament. They consist of the outward signs and persons through which Christ acts to confer sacramental grace."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "All sacraments require proper matter, form, and intent."^^xsd:string,
        "Defects in sacramental elements can affect validity."^^xsd:string .

<RepzuKaD1tTAVt1HZzq1U4> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Indigent" ;
    dc:source <https://taxonomy.legal/> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8nREeU6lB0zs0dt9N339nm> ;
    skos:altLabel "Destitute",
        "Impoverished" ;
    skos:definition "Indigent refers to an individual who is financially unable to afford the basic necessities of life, including the costs associated with legal proceedings. In a legal context, indigent status may qualify a person for free legal representation or the waiver of court fees under the principle of in forma pauperis." .

<ReswYRsH8IbmoE68QpgOCd> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Subject-Matter Jurisdiction" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDIuHPBKs3x9tZ0vRBJ76AI> ;
    skos:altLabel "Sachliche Zuständigkeit"@de-de,
        "Subject-Matter Jurisdiction"@en-gb,
        "Jurisdicción de la materia"@es-es,
        "Jurisdicción de la materia"@es-mx,
        "Compétence matérielle"@fr-fr,
        "שיפוט תחום הנושא"@he-il,
        "विषय-वस्तु अधिकरण"@hi-in,
        "審判権限"@ja-jp,
        "Jurisdição da matéria"@pt-br,
        "管辖权"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Subject-Matter Jurisdiction refers to the authority of a court to hear and decide a particular type of legal dispute, based on the subject matter of the case and the laws governing it." .

<Rf3vlNVG6AT99vTWHcqcws> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Baptism" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8IG2xzz6DkWBumc1ZiMyx9> ;
    skos:altLabel "Christian Baptism"^^xsd:string,
        "Regeneration in Christ"^^xsd:string,
        "Sacrament of Baptism"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Baptism is the sacrament of initiation by which a person is freed from sin, reborn as a child of God, and incorporated into Christ and the Church. It is necessary for salvation, at least by desire, and confers an indelible sacramental character."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Baptism initiates a person into the Christian life."^^xsd:string,
        "Baptism leaves a permanent sacramental character."^^xsd:string,
        "Through baptism, original sin is forgiven."^^xsd:string .

<RfEesRQkyv0zcnO5ApLLpP> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Abrahamic Covenant Events" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7hvAdBWgqXF4EHGunMyE3W> ;
    skos:altLabel "Abrahamic Promise Events"^^xsd:string,
        "Covenant with Abraham Events"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Abrahamic Covenant Events encompass the pivotal occasions when God established and reaffirmed the covenant with Abraham, promising land, descendants, and blessing to all nations through his lineage. These events mark God's choice of one family through whom divine promises would flow to all humanity, establishing the foundational covenant upon which later biblical covenants build."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Biblical scholars study Abrahamic Covenant events to understand how divine promise unfolds across generations despite human failure."^^xsd:string,
        "Catechetical programs use Abrahamic Covenant events to teach children about faith's meaning through Abraham's obedience and trust."^^xsd:string,
        "Catholic liturgy proclaims Abrahamic Covenant events during Easter Vigil, connecting Abraham's faith to baptismal covenant renewal."^^xsd:string,
        "Theologians analyze Abrahamic Covenant events as establishing election theology whereby God chooses particular people for universal blessing."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:note """God's Call to Abram (Genesis 12:1-3)
Circumcision as Covenant Sign (Genesis 17:9-14)
Promise of Land and Descendants (Genesis 15:1-21)
Covenant Cutting Ceremony (Genesis 15:7-21)
Name Change from Abram to Abraham (Genesis 17:5)
Covenant Reaffirmation after Isaac's Birth (Genesis 21:1-7)
Testing of Abraham (Genesis 22:1-19)
Covenant Renewal on Mount Moriah (Genesis 22:15-18)
Covenant Confirmation to Isaac (Genesis 26:2-5)
Covenant Extension to Jacob (Genesis 28:13-15)"""^^xsd:string .

<Rgp2p1OFbXqI1lBJieonvK> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Virtue" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCuw9Co5aqGGoEIUhnvjRXK> ;
    skos:altLabel "Excellence of Character"^^xsd:string,
        "Habitual Good Disposition"^^xsd:string,
        "Moral Excellence"^^xsd:string,
        "Moral Virtue"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Virtue is a stable and habitual disposition to choose the good in accordance with right reason and moral truth. Virtue perfects human freedom by enabling consistent action toward authentic human flourishing and holiness."^^xsd:string ;
    skos:example "Virtue enables a person to act honestly even when dishonesty would bring advantage."^^xsd:string,
        "Virtue forms through repeated good actions guided by reason and grace."^^xsd:string,
        "Virtue orders desires and actions toward lasting human fulfillment."^^xsd:string,
        "Virtue strengthens freedom by making good choices easier and more joyful."^^xsd:string .

<RiRZCIYSrlWbUE4T76ifCF> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Law Firm" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RMIoMi1OqwHKqsjgrjdaHj> ;
    skos:altLabel "External Counsel",
        "Solicitors' Firm" ;
    skos:definition "A law firm is a business entity with one or more lawyers and allied legal professionals to engage in the practice of law. It provides legal services to clients, including legal advice, representation in legal proceedings, and assistance with various legal matters." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Firm" .

<RinqHf65TtUhr762WKqN6R> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Personal Jurisdiction" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDIuHPBKs3x9tZ0vRBJ76AI> ;
    skos:altLabel "Persönliche Gerichtsbarkeit"@de-de,
        "Personal Jurisdiction"@en-gb,
        "Jurisdicción Personal"@es-es,
        "Jurisdicción Personal"@es-mx,
        "Juridiction personnelle"@fr-fr,
        "שיפוט אישי"@he-il,
        "व्यक्तिगत अधिकरण"@hi-in,
        "個人管轄権"@ja-jp,
        "Jurisdição pessoal"@pt-br,
        "个人管辖权"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Personal Jurisdiction refers to the power of a court to hear and decide a case involving a particular defendant, based on the defendant's connection to the forum state, as determined by the legal rules and principles governing jurisdiction." .

<RkIejtiO3CUzgQe98NWyPq> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Manager" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R72p6HAKCuvyIWvgxuoCM9R> ;
    skos:definition "A Manager is an individual in an organization who has the responsibility of overseeing a team or a set of processes, making decisions, and ensuring that tasks and goals are successfully completed. Managers often have authority to make personnel decisions, allocate resources, and are accountable for the performance and outcomes of their team or department." .

<RkW2gxg1HbGOAANvNTgOzp> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Claims by Real Estate Agents and Brokers" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDSBerlLWg1ntpLqDQn1eVn> ;
    skos:altLabel "Ansprüche von Immobilienmaklern und -vermittlern"@de-de,
        "Claims by Real Estate Agents and Brokers"@en-gb,
        "Reclamaciones de agentes y corredores de bienes raíces"@es-es,
        "Reclamaciones de agentes y corredores de bienes raíces"@es-mx,
        "Réclamations des agents immobiliers"@fr-fr,
        "תביעות של סוכני נדלן ומתווכים"@he-il,
        "रियल एस्टेट एजेंट और ब्रोकरों द्वारा दावे"@hi-in,
        "不動産エージェントおよびブローカーによる請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicações de corretores e agentes imobiliários"@pt-br,
        "房地产经纪人和经纪人的索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Claims by Real Estate Agents and Brokers refer to legal actions taken by these professionals in order to receive compensation for their services, such as commissions on exclusive listings or breach of implied covenant of good faith and fair dealing, in relation to property and premises liability claims." .

<RkvRD1NfpM4aO12DEEarGf> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Neurodegenerative Disorders of the Central Nervous System" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/11.00-Neurological-Adult.htm#11_17> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7M8wW11LJaLtWjQS7DmTQH>,
        <REFNhmFYG6yk3W0RPLFV6g> ;
    skos:altLabel "Neurodegenerative Diseases",
        "Neurodegenerative Disorders" ;
    skos:definition "Neurodegenerative disorders of the central nervous system involve the progressive degeneration or death of nerve cells (neurons) in the brain and spinal cord. These disorders are characterized by gradual loss of cognitive, motor, or autonomic functions due to the progressive nature of neuronal damage." .

<RlDwAh4h0X7Sosy5SLccvX> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Attorney Fees" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9rEOlPrMiUpUlQrMe18m1X> ;
    skos:altLabel "Anwaltsgebühren"@de-de,
        "Solicitor Fees"@en-gb,
        "Honorarios de Abogados"@es-es,
        "Honorarios de Abogados"@es-mx,
        "Honoraires d'avocat"@fr-fr,
        "דמי עורכי דין"@he-il,
        "वकील शुल्क"@hi-in,
        "弁護士費用"@ja-jp,
        "Honorários advocatícios"@pt-br,
        "律师费用"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Attorney Fees refer to the compensation paid to a lawyer for their legal services, which can be shifted to the losing party in a lawsuit or calculated based on the benefit or value provided to the client." .

<RmafyqOLdKzHzFsjz4ro2r> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "National Legislator" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RPVH5QmsYwXZsVzYrSQZoq> ;
    skos:altLabel "Congressional Representative",
        "Member of National Parliament",
        "Member of Parliament",
        "National Assembly Member",
        "National-Level Legislative Representative" ;
    skos:definition "A National Legislator is an elected or appointed official who serves as a member of a country's national law-making body. This individual is responsible for proposing, debating, and voting on national laws and policies, representing constituents or regions at the federal level, and providing oversight of the executive branch." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Federal Lawmaker" .

<RnE0B1i5s6VPGXFOeVsfcy> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Ecclesiastical Territory" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC7MKaQfZCj3Y1EexCO2Nfo> ;
    skos:altLabel "Canonical Territory"^^xsd:string,
        "Church Territory"^^xsd:string,
        "Ecclesial Jurisdiction"^^xsd:string,
        "Ecclesiastical Jurisdictional Area"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Ecclesiastical Territory is a defined geographic area entrusted to the governance and pastoral care of ecclesiastical authority. Ecclesiastical Territory orders the Church’s mission spatially for the purposes of teaching, sanctifying, and governing the faithful."^^xsd:string .

<RoABbJ9kEFzmBvBSGmbAyq> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Inadmissible Documentary Evidence Objection" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9Bk5v9AAJmhb4WcgIQjy29> ;
    skos:definition "An Inadmissible Documentary Evidence Objection is raised when a party attempts to introduce a document into evidence that fails to meet the necessary legal requirements for admissibility. This objection encompasses various grounds, such as lack of proper authentication or failure to provide the original document when required by the \"original writings\" rule (also known as the best evidence rule)." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Documentary Evidence Admissibility Objection" .

<Rq6neiK9deZLSfSa41jylg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Business Insurance Policy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9uTFHGFCMBjtYw5MOmpotJ> ;
    skos:definition "A business insurance policy is a contract between a business entity and an insurance provider designed to protect the business from various risks like property damage, liability, and business interruption. The terms of the policy will outline the scope of coverage, limitations, and conditions under which claims can be made, in exchange for payment of premiums." .

<Rr7unN3nXmcbbkDTbDWiwb> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Article 3 Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7MGQ9xUx0PxGLp5yxprdpZ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Article III Claim",
        "Anspruch nach Artikel 3"@de-de,
        "Article 3 Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamación del artículo 3"@es-es,
        "Reclamación del artículo 3"@es-mx,
        "Demande en vertu de l'article 3"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת סעיף 3"@he-il,
        "अनुच्छेद 3 दावा"@hi-in,
        "第3条請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação do Artigo 3"@pt-br,
        "第3条索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "An Article III claim pertains to a legal argument based on Article III of the U.S. Constitution, which establishes the judicial branch of the federal government. Such a claim may arise in disputes over federal court jurisdiction, the interpretation of federal laws, or the constitutionality of legislation or executive actions." .

<RtHkyQ5lSxRaJ9oaSOWbkx> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vital Status" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7sHH7RvjZ6aZS7ZExDpYmR> ;
    skos:altLabel "Vitalstatus"@de-de,
        "Statut vital"@fr-fr,
        "生命状態"@ja-jp,
        "Status vital"@pt-br,
        "生命状态"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Vital Status refers to the current state of being either alive or deceased for an individual person." .

<RtNdCOiqmpVOXZef1DicAV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Immigrant Petition for Alien Worker" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RVRrqw2QfVD6UcPQLUMxaq> ],
        <RKY2B2HNSx5K82dgVN6Qn7> ;
    skos:altLabel "I-140 (PERM Based) Petition" ;
    skos:definition "The Immigrant Petition for Alien Worker (in the U.S., I-140 Petition), is a form filed with to initiate the employment-based Permanent Resident (in the U.S., green card) process for a foreign worker. In the United States, this petition is typically filed by the employer to demonstrate that there is a valid job offer and that the foreign worker meets the qualifications for the specific employment-based preference category. For PERM-based I-140 petitions, the employer must first obtain a Labor Certification (PERM) from the U.S. Department of Labor to demonstrate that there are no qualified U.S. workers available for the job position. Once the I-140 is approved, the foreign worker can move forward with the final steps of the green card process, including waiting for a visa number to become available in the relevant preference category" .

<RtSews3LsWL6xdoibt5V5R> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Current Legal Efficacy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1CZydjfH8oiM4W3rCkma3> ;
    skos:altLabel "Aktuelle Rechtswirksamkeit"@de-de,
        "Efficacité juridique actuelle"@fr-fr,
        "現行の法的効力"@ja-jp,
        "Eficácia jurídica atual"@pt-br,
        "当前法律效力"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Property of a Legal Authority, annotating whether that authority (e.g., caselaw, statute, rule, regulation) is currently effective, or whether it is obsolete (e.g., overruled judicial opinion, superseded statute)." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Citator Results" .

<Rte2A8gY3vh8lVIpY5myli> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Pretrial Release" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R9mf4jHGk1EcEkyTBhfv6Zw> ],
        [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBnsEcCI2IYcIzlWhNi3KyD> ],
        <RBV3MQlbGLIUVo5fSiBZ2V4> ;
    skos:altLabel "Vorläufige Freilassung"@de-de,
        "Pretrial Release"@en-gb,
        "Libertad Provisional"@es-es,
        "Liberación Bajo Fianza"@es-mx,
        "Libération provisoire"@fr-fr,
        "שחרור זמני לפני המשפט"@he-il,
        "प्रारंभिक रिहाई"@hi-in,
        "仮釈放"@ja-jp,
        "Liberação provisória"@pt-br,
        "临时释放"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Pretrial Release refers to the legal process of releasing a defendant from custody before their trial, subject to certain conditions such as bail or supervision, as a means of ensuring their appearance in court." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Bail" .

<RwxL1z0C8tiJRzH9j7gwt3> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Location-Based Event" ;
    rdfs:comment "See the Properties `folio:arrived` and `folio:departed`" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7kjCtMcpEem6IjJRJ3OWju> ;
    skos:definition "A Location-Based Event refers to an occurrence tied to a specific geographic location, often marking a change in status or condition for a person or object. Examples include events like a person beginning or ending residency in a particular place, or an item entering or leaving a specified location, which may have legal, social, or logistical implications." ;
    skos:example "After a killing, person left the state.",
        "Immigration Border Crossing",
        "While in a country, person signed a contract" .

<Rx69EnEj3H3TpcgTfUSoYx> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Status" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDXLO9MacR7nBfLLV0hskma> ;
    skos:altLabel "Status"@de-de,
        "Status"@en-gb,
        "Estado"@es-es,
        "Estatus"@es-mx,
        "Statut"@fr-fr,
        "סטטוס"@he-il,
        "स्थिति"@hi-in,
        "ステータス"@ja-jp,
        "Status"@pt-br,
        "状态"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The state or condition of a proceeding, legal element, or legal matter (e.g., open, closed, canceled, expired)." .

<RxkTKgYqWS0WBHnJgrn27Y> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Financial Assets" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://nna.jse.co.za/Help/cfi.htm> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCIwc6WJi6IT7xePURxsi4T> ;
    skos:altLabel "Monetary Assets" ;
    skos:definition "Financial Assets are economic resources that have value and can be owned or controlled with the expectation of generating future income or financial benefits. They can exist in various forms such as cash, stocks, bonds, and real estate." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Capital Resources" .

<RzLNZvmvjHqtxVfg3yhhM9> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Reputational Risk" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.canada.ca/en/treasury-board-secretariat/corporate/risk-management/taxonomies.html> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R8NXBaBIdqkUFrXWxuQCdil> ],
        <RxTxaN981tLTsN82qPBcp> ;
    skos:definition "The threats and opportunities associated with an organization's reputation and credibility with its partners, stakeholders, and the public — that might damage an organization's public image, credibility, or brand value. These risks can stem from various sources, such as operational failures, unethical behavior, or public controversies, potentially leading to diminished customer loyalty, reduced investor confidence, or decreased market opportunities, ultimately impacting the organization's overall performance and growth prospects." .

<Rzy5rvrKtuL8AwKrBTFfBQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Patent Regulatory Objectives" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCDwLiS22z6MzQaQHS08hvk> ;
    skos:altLabel "Ziele der Patentregulierung"@de-de,
        "Patent Regulatory Objectives"@en-gb,
        "Objetivos Regulatorios de Patentes"@es-es,
        "Objetivos Regulatorios de Patentes"@es-mx,
        "Objectifs de réglementation des brevets"@fr-fr,
        "מטרות רגולציה של פטנטים"@he-il,
        "पेटेंट नियामक उद्देश्य"@hi-in,
        "特許規制目標"@ja-jp,
        "Objetivos regulatórios de patentes"@pt-br,
        "专利监管目标"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Patent Regulatory Objectives refer to the specific aims, goals, and plans related to the legal framework governing the registration of patents, including plant, design, and utility patents." .

<S0aqiIi5Q4WHMwEpiXDtkA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other General Purpose Machinery Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3339> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R1mCdY0rwFYwF5UCzk28Qu> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing pumps and compressors, material handling equipment, and all other general purpose machinery (except ventilation, heating, air-conditioning, and commercial refrigeration equipment; metalworking machinery; and engines, turbines, and power transmission equipment)." .

<TIqRyosqTd-D921xWs8ROg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Support Activities for Agriculture and Forestry Industry" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=115> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R92xsHpdHu6BJjtepuRu> ;
    skos:definition "Industries in the Support Activities for Agriculture and Forestry subsector provide support services that are an essential part of agricultural and forestry production.  These support activities may be performed by the agriculture or forestry producing establishment or conducted independently as an alternative source of inputs required for the production process for a given crop, animal, or forestry industry.  Establishments that primarily perform these activities independent of the agriculture or forestry producing establishment are in this subsector." .

<TfrCYTtGTaCrbhjnoTIUvg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Social Advocacy Organizations" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=81331> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <7dledmVRT7ijU7zmHuGdOQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in promoting a particular cause or working for the realization of a specific social or political goal to benefit a broad or specific constituency.  These organizations may solicit contributions and offer memberships to support these goals." ;
    skos:example "Community action advocacy organizations",
        "Conservation advocacy organizations",
        "Environmental advocacy organizations",
        "Firearms advocacy organizations",
        "Human rights advocacy organizations",
        "Wildlife preservation organizations" .

<UMqcn0wCQiKchFW4xdyzfQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Utility System Construction" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=2371> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <kf0tGiE0SVWVbXBjmsd-eA> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in the construction of distribution lines and related buildings and structures for utilities (i.e., water, sewer, petroleum, gas, power, and communication). All structures (including buildings) that are integral parts of utility systems (e.g., storage tanks, pumping stations, power plants, and refineries) are included in this industry group." .

<Wnb0B4vNR66_Oszwz0yiSQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Computer and Peripheral Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33411> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <dXCDkX78TACdoaN2vROpkw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing and/or assembling electronic computers, such as mainframes, personal computers, workstations, laptops, and computer servers; and computer peripheral equipment, such as storage devices, printers, monitors, and input/output devices and terminals.  Computers can be analog, digital, or hybrid.  Digital computers, the most common type, are devices that do all of the following: (1) store the processing program or programs and the data immediately necessary for the execution of the program; (2) can be freely programmed in accordance with the requirements of the user; (3) perform arithmetical computations specified by the user; and (4) execute, without human intervention, a processing program that requires the computer to modify its execution by logical decision during the processing run.  Analog computers are capable of simulating mathematical models and comprise at least analog, control, and programming elements." .

<X025JE1YTUCnIQsk66o_Zg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Nondepository Credit Intermediation Industry" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5222> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBX1KA0BJR7y27zZSvaLBVE> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments, both public (government-sponsored enterprises) and private, primarily engaged in extending credit or lending funds raised by credit market borrowing, such as issuing commercial paper or other debt instruments or by borrowing from other financial intermediaries. Within this group, industries are defined on the basis of the type of credit being extended." .

<XEF_h5cpQLug_oZ_tAHONg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Outpatient Care Centers" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=6214> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDnbxazqAWfPyFjrjdnj3Ha> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments with medical staff primarily engaged in providing a range of outpatient services, such as family planning, diagnosis and treatment of mental health disorders and alcohol and other substance abuse, and other general or specialized outpatient care." .

<XPEa2vKjQXiJIPOqJ3ROww> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other Transportation Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33699> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <MJm76-gySNWmV_BiuW4MTw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing motorcycles, bicycles, metal tricycles, complete military armored vehicles, tanks, self-propelled weapons, vehicles pulled by draft animals, and other transportation equipment (except motor vehicles, boats, ships, railroad rolling stock, and aerospace products), including parts thereof." .

<XmPn9qdqRNCrNlvwItWVMw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Paperboard Container Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32221> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <_tQlht4ETRKrwll0G13vfw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in converting paperboard into containers without manufacturing paperboard.  These establishments use corrugating, cutting, and shaping machinery to form paperboard into containers.  Products made by these establishments include boxes, corrugated sheets, pads, pallets, paper dishes, and fiber drums and reels." .

<XqSGdTUbRMWNiSGU6BLkPQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Insurance and Employee Benefit Funds" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5251> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R82Yb8u8L6F9E8vrZFOnfw1> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises legal entities (i.e., funds, plans, and/or programs) organized to provide insurance and employee benefits exclusively for the sponsor, firm, or its employees or members." .

<XyZ6m8jkTemBuzuW-cAHCA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Sand, Gravel, Clay, and Ceramic and Refractory Minerals Mining and Quarrying" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=21232> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <Pfnjjx26SsKDkbLVMoJtXQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises (1) establishments primarily engaged in developing the mine site and/or mining, quarrying, dredging for sand and gravel, or mining clay (e.g., china clay, paper clay and slip clay) or ceramic and refractory minerals and (2) preparation plants primarily engaged in beneficiating (e.g., washing, screening, and grinding) sand and gravel, clay, and ceramic and refractory minerals." .

<YFbAUnqXTmaP4s08d8dFfQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other Wood Product Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3219> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R6BuVjQc5Xltba4bK4jk3h> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing wood products (except establishments operating sawmills and wood preservation facilities; and establishments manufacturing veneer, plywood, or engineered wood products)." .

<Yz4kpOqlRVKhZEaDlcjMvg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Electric Lighting Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33513> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <SBgsO7eMRzaFJfg7Wxeswg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing electric lighting fixtures (except vehicular), nonelectric lighting equipment, lamp shades (except glass and plastics), electric light bulbs, tubes, and parts (except glass blanks for electric light bulbs and light emitting diodes (LEDs)), and lighting fixture components (except current-carrying wiring devices)." .

<ZPOZN-AIQOG6rXrpt2o7mA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "All Other Schools and Instruction" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=61169> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC407073436a677F31eA6530> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in offering instruction (except academic schools, colleges, and universities; business, computer, and management instruction; technical and trade instruction; and fine arts, sports, recreation, and language instruction)." ;
    skos:example "Academic tutoring services",
        "Automobile driving schools",
        "Exam preparation services",
        "Public speaking training",
        "Speed reading instruction" .

<_6TfTE4iQG-6fDQIcaNNZA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Ventilation, Heating, Air-Conditioning, and Commercial Refrigeration Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33341> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <pYqKSNl3SpiivnNV4NG0GQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing ventilating, heating, air-conditioning, and commercial and industrial refrigeration and freezer equipment." ;
    skos:example "Air-conditioner filters manufacturing",
        "Air-conditioning and warm air heating combination units manufacturing",
        "Attic fans manufacturing",
        "Dust and fume collecting equipment manufacturing",
        "Gas fireplaces manufacturing",
        "Heating boilers manufacturing",
        "Industrial and commercial-type fans manufacturing",
        "Refrigerated counter and display cases manufacturing",
        "Refrigerated drinking fountains manufacturing",
        "Space heaters (except portable electric) manufacturing" .

<c2zJcA5sQkixccD2L4lXBw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Hair, Nail, and Skin Care Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=81211> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <eh8Ay3ANTdWnlpqxVysRLw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) providing hair care services; (2) providing nail care services; and (3) providing facials or applying makeup (except permanent makeup)." ;
    skos:example "Barber shops",
        "Beauty salons",
        "Cosmetology salons",
        "Hair stylist shops",
        "Nail salons" .

<cW-wZtcFTXuDlNYs96bTZA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Plastics Packaging Materials and Unlaminated Film and Sheet Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32611> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <P2ahRVjlQwyn4knwwoIQvw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) converting plastics resins into unsupported plastics film and sheet and/or (2) forming, coating, or laminating plastics film and sheet into plastics bags." .

<dCKeqxT_Qg6M98Gt2x7-Vw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Sugar and Confectionery Product Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3113> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCaeZbTg74NX3xyNzskpVH8> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises (1) establishments that process agricultural inputs, such as sugarcane, beet, and cacao, to give rise to a new product (sugar or chocolate) and (2) establishments that begin with sugar and chocolate and process these further." .

<eEc9gaX2SrSj9DHz9azu4A> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Communications Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3342> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9L2shTy2cnDMS1sImF2PBy> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing wire telephone and data communications equipment, radio and television broadcast and wireless communications equipment, and all other communications equipment." .

<f5KVOtZmSlibxAGrEymRkQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Starch and Vegetable Fats and Oils Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=31122> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <7h_ZAiafR1OGmih72Z50XA> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) wet milling corn and vegetables; (2) crushing oilseeds and tree nuts; (3) refining and/or blending vegetable oils; (4) manufacturing shortening and margarine; and (5) blending purchased animal fats with vegetable fats." .

<fOPbREAsSIarGeJiYAaoiw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "All Other Wood Product Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32199> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <YFbAUnqXTmaP4s08d8dFfQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing wood products (except establishments operating sawmills and wood preservation facilities; and establishments manufacturing veneer, plywood, engineered wood products, millwork, wood containers, or pallets)." ;
    skos:example "Mobile homes manufacturing",
        "Panels, prefabricated wood building, manufacturing",
        "Prefabricated wood buildings manufacturing",
        "Sections, prefabricated wood building, manufacturing",
        "Wood dowels manufacturing",
        "Wood handles (e.g., broom, handtool, mop) manufacturing" .

<feRSrU7jSMuNLYyfCK3qcg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fishing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=11411> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <IxQ2IeyQTk-NBAIa2h95Cg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in the commercial catching or taking of finfish, shellfish, or miscellaneous marine products from a natural habitat, such as the catching of bluefish, eels, salmon, tuna, clams, crabs, lobsters, mussels, oysters, shrimp, frogs, sea urchins, and turtles." .

<gYrwkWHETsSEhTvtP8Bb2Q> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Special Food Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=7223> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8RJIpODageO9V5kZNQgKns> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing food services at one or more of the following locations: (1) the customer's location; (2) a location designated by the customer; or (3) from motorized vehicles or nonmotorized carts." .

<gc05XgiIRYmVHrg3IjevCw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Soft Drink and Ice Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=31211> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <OJe1W2MTTxy1KIsdTSzAOg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) manufacturing soft drinks; (2) manufacturing ice; and (3) purifying and bottling water." .

<hs26gUWmSpan-dGyuzrHag> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Ornamental and Architectural Metal Products Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33232> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <WBLLpndJRPGdl5m0HLirjg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing one or more of the following: (1) metal framed windows (i.e., typically using purchased glass) and metal doors; (2) sheet metal work; and (3) ornamental and architectural metal products." .

<k29SeRbeSnSCZ2dV8f6XVQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Waste Collection" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=56211> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <eVrt8dcxTNK-CdPgDPqZUg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) collecting and/or hauling hazardous waste, nonhazardous waste, and/or recyclable materials within a local area and/or (2) operating hazardous or nonhazardous waste transfer stations.  Hazardous waste collection establishments may be responsible for the identification, treatment, packaging, and labeling of waste for the purposes of transport." .

<kyN-KUDNTweyrC4jbi9QXw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "All Other Chemical Product and Preparation Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32599> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <MvzJUq74RQeeoXsJ48CgdA> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing chemical products (except basic chemicals, resins, and synthetic rubber; cellulosic and noncellulosic fibers and filaments; pesticides, fertilizers, and other agricultural chemicals; pharmaceuticals and medicines; paints, coatings, and adhesives; soaps, cleaning compounds, and toilet preparations; printing inks; and explosives)." ;
    skos:example "Activated carbon and charcoal manufacturing",
        "Antifreeze preparations manufacturing",
        "Custom compounding (i.e., blending and mixing) of purchased plastics resins",
        "Electronic cigarette vapor liquids, including closed refills, manufacturing",
        "Industrial salt manufacturing",
        "Matches and matchbook manufacturing",
        "Photographic chemicals manufacturing",
        "Pyrotechnics (e.g., flares, flashlight bombs, signals) manufacturing",
        "Sugar substitutes (i.e., synthetic sweeteners blended with other ingredients) made from purchased synthetic sweeteners",
        "Swimming pool chemical preparations manufacturing",
        "Writing inks manufacturing" .

<l1UD9NnVSA6I_uyWF5g59g> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other Support Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5619> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7Ti8xGiWI5NzMSs5upZUo6> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing day-to-day business and other organizational support services (except office administrative services; facilities support services; employment services; business support services; travel arrangement and reservation services; security and investigation services; and services to buildings and dwellings)." .

<m_xYZAywQL6jYjPb7-meCw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "All Other Crop Farming" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=11199> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <JrfA4DJKRASmHMIr5oboeg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) growing crops (except oilseeds and/or grains; vegetables and/or melons; fruits and/or tree nuts; greenhouse, nursery, and/or floriculture products; tobacco; cotton; sugarcane; or hay) or (2) growing a combination of crops (except a combination of oilseed(s) and grain(s); and a combination of fruit(s) and tree nut(s)) with no one crop or family of crops accounting for one-half of the establishment's agricultural production (i.e., value of crops for market)." ;
    skos:example "Agave farming",
        "General combination crop farming (except oilseed and grain; vegetables and melons; fruit and nut combinations)",
        "Grass seed farming",
        "Hay seed farming",
        "Maple sap gathering",
        "Peanut farming",
        "Spice farming",
        "Sugar beet farming",
        "Tea farming" .

<n2Xua3toTk-SP2X5h4LEPg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other Specialty Food Retailers" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=44529> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <jmusMEBeQCyl2udlUWSwdQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in retailing specialty foods (except fruits and vegetables, meat, fish, and seafood) not for immediate consumption and not made on the premises." ;
    skos:example "Baked goods (not made on premises) retailers",
        "Coffee and tea (i.e., packaged) retailers",
        "Confectionery (i.e., packaged) retailers",
        "Dairy product retailers",
        "Gourmet food retailers",
        "Nut (i.e., packaged) retailers" .

<ncrsM5qARGa3n9b4i4EFXg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Printing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32311> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <F9VFVZcqSxO7sutJ7Fjfyg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in printing on apparel and textile products, paper, metal, glass, plastics, and other materials, except fabric (grey goods).  The printing processes employed include, but are not limited to, lithographic, gravure, screen, flexographic, digital, and letterpress.  Establishments in this industry do not manufacture the stock that they print, but may perform postprinting activities, such as folding, cutting, or laminating the materials they print, and mailing." .

<neEU9-WeRpKClWn2ui4HvQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Millwork" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32191> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <YFbAUnqXTmaP4s08d8dFfQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing hardwood and softwood cut stock and dimension stock (i.e., shapes); wood windows and wood doors; and other millwork including wood flooring.  Dimension stock or cut stock is defined as lumber and worked wood products cut or shaped to specialized sizes.  These establishments generally use woodworking machinery, such as jointers, planers, lathes, and routers to shape wood." .

<o-fq_eggQHqmcPpdATmBUQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Drycleaning and Laundry Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=8123> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RB16JIJsCApBxJjhBXmpJHi> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in operating coin- or card-operated or similar self-service laundries and drycleaners; providing drycleaning and laundry services (except coin- or card-operated); and supplying, on a rental or contract basis, laundered items (e.g., uniforms, gowns, shop towels, etc.). Included in this industry group are establishments primarily engaged in supplying and servicing coin- or card-operated laundry and drycleaning equipment in places of business operated by others, such as apartments and dormitories." .

<oJnwpIpOTpS95nvUdSwAKA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Nonferrous Metal Foundries" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33152> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <L02SICBhTbeJzkgJHdb6nQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in pouring and/or introducing molten nonferrous metal, under high pressure, into metal molds or dies to manufacture castings.  Establishments in this industry purchase nonferrous metals made in other establishments." .

<oS3ZjajvSPWy2t8a-D2yAQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Flour Milling and Malt Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=31121> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <7h_ZAiafR1OGmih72Z50XA> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) milling flour or meal from grains or vegetables; (2) preparing flour mixes or doughs from flour milled in the same establishment; (3) milling, cleaning, and polishing rice; and (4) manufacturing malt from barley, rye, or other grains." .

<opUdJ5BOT32XYfxIls7XJQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Agriculture, Construction, and Mining Machinery Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3331> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R1mCdY0rwFYwF5UCzk28Qu> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing one or more of the following: (1) farm machinery and equipment, power mowing equipment, and other powered home lawn and garden equipment; (2) construction machinery, surface mining machinery, and logging equipment; and (3) oil and gas field and underground mining machinery and equipment." .

<owkEwWucQWG00_HQ02MjwA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Travel Arrangement and Reservation Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5615> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7Ti8xGiWI5NzMSs5upZUo6> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in one of the following: (1) travel agency services; (2) arranging and assembling tours; or (3) other travel arrangement and reservation services." .

<r4ZF6RhKRrWbu1A85GMsdA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other Investment Pools and Funds" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5259> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R82Yb8u8L6F9E8vrZFOnfw1> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises legal entities (i.e., investment pools and/or funds) organized to pool securities or other assets (except insurance and employee benefit funds) on behalf of shareholders, unitholders, or beneficiaries." .

<uCrd5XMFTU6oZ5lpri8frg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Security Systems Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=56162> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <QR-ok53ZQo6CuJMSBqvR8w> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments engaged in (1) selling security systems, such as burglar and fire alarms and locking devices, along with installation, repair, or monitoring services or (2) remote monitoring of electronic security alarm systems." .

<vYX7JSuNRDSzce-lpVwBhg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Soap and Cleaning Compound Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32561> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <K6baW0MvRiqcZdVvcH4MMw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing and packaging soaps and other cleaning compounds, surface active agents, and textile and leather finishing agents used to reduce tension or speed the drying process." .

<vYl5tm7YTduEPX3h-92rmQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Building Equipment Contractors" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=2382> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <pghJQ5LtTs2mdrNX0Qlf2Q> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in installing or servicing equipment that forms part of a building mechanical system (e.g., electricity, water, heating, and cooling). The work performed may include new work, additions, alterations, maintenance, and repairs. Contractors installing specialized building equipment, such as elevators, escalators, service station equipment, and central vacuum cleaning systems, are also included." .

<vfgqAHTKQsidCGObF6URqw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Rubber Product Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3262> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <qTC5T9b0ROGfouRf0ZJ1ZQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in processing natural, synthetic, or reclaimed rubber materials into intermediate or final products using processes, such as vulcanizing, cementing, molding, extruding, and lathe-cutting." .

<xHYpQehTSCuxJCSwbZ2iAQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Depository Credit Intermediation Industry" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5221> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBX1KA0BJR7y27zZSvaLBVE> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in accepting deposits (or share deposits) and in lending funds from these deposits. Within this group, industries are defined on the basis of differences in the types of deposit liabilities assumed and in the nature of the credit extended." .

<xLHw6gf6RjugSp9uLEXVdw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Remediation and Other Waste Management Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=5629> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8QNoHPGUoFXi3PeVUbJ7tD> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in remediation and other waste management services (except waste collection, waste treatment and disposal, and waste management consulting services)." .

<xaeK0Z3TSbKSBwNNkf8FqQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Nonscheduled Air Transportation" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=48121> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <QXngifLoRLCXP4BXYiyLkg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in (1) providing air transportation of passengers and/or cargo with no regular routes and regular schedules or (2) providing specialty flying services with no regular routes and regular schedules using general purpose aircraft.  These establishments have more flexibility with respect to choice of airports, hours of operation, load factors, and similar operational characteristics." ;
    skos:example "Air taxi services",
        "Aircraft charter services",
        "Nonscheduled air freight transportation services",
        "Nonscheduled air passenger transportation services" .

<yhsp_9s9QNm9UB4VUccNug> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other Business Support Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=56149> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <nTlbbVGtQ6qs5CqcwYnhcg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing business support services (except secretarial and other document preparation services; telephone answering or telemarketing services; private mail services or document copying services conducted as separate activities or in conjunction with other office support services; monetary debt collection services; and credit reporting services)." ;
    skos:example "Address bar coding services",
        "Bar code imprinting services",
        "Charitable fundraising campaign organization services on a contract or fee basis",
        "Court reporting services",
        "Mail presorting services",
        "Real-time (i.e., simultaneous) closed captioning of live television performances, meetings, conferences",
        "Repossession services" .

<2aiCfNVQQ26656V64RKYqg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Health and Personal Care Retailers" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=4561> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8lpuELvxz47gLtnJQsIzqx> ;
    skos:definition "NULL" .

<3ZTyLmpASpO3CDM8aVnHNw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fertilizer and Compost Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32531> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <baQ10v5XQ7eQyuVBmctesg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) manufacturing nitrogenous or phosphatic fertilizer materials; (2) manufacturing fertilizers from sewage or animal waste; (3) manufacturing nitrogenous or phosphatic materials and mixing with other ingredients into fertilizers; (4) mixing ingredients made elsewhere into fertilizers; and (5) manufacturing compost." .

<4iufljqCQa60MT3qIwSssA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Electrical Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33531> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <AsDGUP8kTO2Y6Vb94LiQdQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing power, distribution, and specialty transformers; electric motors, generators, and motor generator sets; switchgear and switchboard apparatus; relays; and industrial controls." .

<6X6xJ7TuSFmlAW6Yr-JH6w> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Other Outpatient Care Centers" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=62149> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <XEF_h5cpQLug_oZ_tAHONg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments with medical staff primarily engaged in providing general or specialized outpatient care (except family planning centers and outpatient mental health and substance abuse centers).  Centers or clinics of health practitioners with different degrees from more than one industry practicing within the same establishment (e.g., Doctor of Medicine and Doctor of Dental Medicine) are included in this industry." ;
    skos:example "Dialysis centers and clinics",
        "Freestanding ambulatory surgical centers and clinics",
        "Freestanding emergency medical centers and clinics",
        "Health maintenance organization (HMO) medical centers and clinics",
        "Outpatient biofeedback centers and clinics",
        "Outpatient community health centers and clinics",
        "Outpatient sleep disorder centers and clinics" .

<9_7YhBWwQ6unHGEKzv8nzw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Urban Transit Systems" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=48511> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <aJZF5F0hSQugkx6lQ5ELFQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in operating local and suburban passenger transit systems over regular routes and on regular schedules within a metropolitan area and its adjacent nonurban areas.  Such transportation systems involve the use of one or more modes of transport including light rail, commuter rail, subways, and streetcars, as well as buses and other motor vehicles." .

<A8toAtKhS3uW2J9y19lCXQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Deep Sea, Coastal, and Great Lakes Water Transportation" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=48311> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <MqWEcgH5RMG9ckiQOcktnw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing deep sea, coastal, Great Lakes, and St. Lawrence Seaway water transportation.  Marine transportation establishments using the facilities of the St. Lawrence Seaway Authority Commission are considered to be using the Great Lakes Water Transportation System." .

<AkoKQRJPSBauQVqI83j4iQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Restaurants and Other Eating Places" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=72251> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <nzFajrT1SNaxRo_Jui_hCQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one of the following: (1) providing food services to patrons who order and are served while seated (i.e., waiter/waitress service) and pay after eating; (2) providing food services to patrons who generally order or select items (e.g., at a counter, in a buffet line) and pay before eating; or (3) preparing and/or serving a specialty snack (e.g., ice cream, frozen yogurt, cookies) and/or nonalcoholic beverages (e.g., coffee, juices, sodas) for consumption on or near the premises." .

<B-J7lSkrQZCQo5uqOadw1Q> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Performing Arts Companies" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=7111> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC1Ba5YP8y1uxOkQF7LsVU8> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in producing live presentations involving the performances of actors and actresses, singers, dancers, musical groups and artists, and other performing artists." .

<BNKceNQSQpyE9Op2bYzVaA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Engine, Turbine, and Power Transmission Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33361> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <_3UQGpx1TwiBehojbDEo6w> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing turbines, power transmission equipment, and internal combustion engines (except automotive gasoline and aircraft)." ;
    skos:example "Clutches and brakes (except electromagnetic industrial controls, motor vehicle) manufacturing",
        "Diesel and semidiesel engines manufacturing",
        "Electric outboard motors manufacturing",
        "Internal combustion engines for hybrid drive systems (except automotive) manufacturing",
        "Plain bearings (except internal combustion engine) manufacturing",
        "Plain bushings (except internal combustion engine) manufacturing",
        "Power transmission pulleys manufacturing",
        "Speed changers (i.e., power transmission equipment) manufacturing",
        "Speed reducers (i.e., power transmission equipment) manufacturing",
        "Turbine generator set units manufacturing",
        "Universal joints (except aircraft, motor vehicle) manufacturing" .

<ChFABsGGQTiJBadgarzkbA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Fabric Mills" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3132> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC162PeqaXFH2TskW9BwkAX> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in one of the following: (1) weaving broadwoven fabrics and felts (except tire fabrics and rugs); (2) weaving or braiding narrow fabrics; (3) making fabric-covered elastic yarn and thread; (4) manufacturing Schiffli machine embroideries; (5) manufacturing nonwoven fabrics and felts; (6) knitting weft (i.e., circular) and warp (i.e., flat) fabric; (7) knitting and finishing weft and warp fabric; (8) manufacturing lace; or (9) manufacturing, dyeing, and finishing lace and lace goods." .

<D77ATOEvSPqaboc361FuwQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Technical and Trade Schools" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=61151> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RA124f9A291d9D934b2DA572> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in offering vocational and technical training in a variety of technical subjects and trades.  The training often leads to job-specific certification.  Instruction may be provided in diverse settings, such as the establishment's or client's training facilities, educational institutions, the workplace, or the home, and through diverse means, such as correspondence, television, the Internet, or other electronic and distance-learning methods.  The training provided by these establishments may include the use of simulators and simulation methods." ;
    skos:example "Apprenticeship training programs",
        "Aviation and flight training schools",
        "Computer repair training",
        "Cosmetology schools",
        "Electronic equipment repair training",
        "Graphic arts schools",
        "Modeling schools",
        "Nursing schools (except academic)",
        "Real estate schools",
        "Truck driving schools " .

<GIfl98GaRgykVzvaLJhF6A> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Building Material and Supplies Dealers" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=4441> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RC9gxTda2u80ExW6y0El4YK> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in retailing new building materials and supplies." .

<HNVzadjSQGur0qgpX0Smbw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Material Handling Equipment Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33392> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <S0aqiIi5Q4WHMwEpiXDtkA> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing material handling equipment, such as elevators and moving stairs; conveyors and conveying equipment; overhead traveling cranes, hoists, and monorail systems; and industrial trucks, tractors, trailers, and stacker machinery." .

<HURLh5PmTK2m1hc66Dx_7Q> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Administration of Human Resource Programs" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=9231> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RN4GuH3ZCW5jNVC1pl3kSs> ;
    skos:definition "NULL" .

<J5TrhNp2TP-pHSl3EP7OwA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Metal Valve Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33291> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <DbtxgpjETQe4-NpFNxv5dQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing one or more of the following metal valves: (1) industrial valves; (2) fluid power valves and hose fittings; (3) plumbing fixture fittings and trim; and (4) other metal valves and pipe fittings." .

<JhRFfbpGQvibW3Os07qUcQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "All Other Nonmetallic Mineral Product Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=32799> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <FQRPl0mWQw6wcgApCjO-iA> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing nonmetallic mineral products (except pottery and plumbing fixtures; clay building materials and refractories; glass and glass products; cement; ready-mix concrete; concrete products; lime; gypsum products; and abrasive products)." .

<K0JtPnqXSjuQA7mApIY4vQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Lumber and Other Construction Materials Merchant Wholesalers" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=4233> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R4pYCvaJ8nADRG8NCwgCoa> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in the merchant wholesale distribution of lumber, plywood, millwork, and wood panels; brick, stone, and related construction materials; roofing, siding, and insulation materials; and other construction materials, including manufactured homes (i.e., mobile homes) and/or prefabricated buildings." .

<K5US-YUOQA-m1BbwsoarAQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Alumina and Aluminum Production and Processing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=33131> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <8A-ufB0iSySWshnUA_SJZw> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in one or more of the following: (1) refining alumina; (2) making (i.e., the primary production) aluminum from alumina; (3) recovering aluminum from scrap or dross; (4) alloying purchased aluminum; and (5) manufacturing aluminum primary forms (e.g., bar, foil, pipe, plate, rod, sheet, tube, wire)." .

<KBAKm1z2QOup3Md1jHUl-w> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Residential Building Construction" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=23611> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <-n1HB-QfSV-Eu80Lh0E1OQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily responsible for the construction or remodeling and renovation of single-family and multifamily residential buildings.  Included in this industry are residential housing general contractors (i.e., new construction, remodeling, or renovating existing residential structures), for-sale builders and remodelers of residential structures, residential project construction management firms, and residential design-build firms." .

<KzS7XOscRhW8YxrQ-Ou0IQ> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Cement and Concrete Product Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3273> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <1fwWe7gBQpieS5cknXqvIg> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in one of the following: (1) manufacturing Portland, natural, masonry, pozzolanic, and other hydraulic cements; (2) acting as batch or mixing plants, manufacturing concrete delivered to a purchaser in a plastic and unhardened state; (3) manufacturing concrete pipe, brick, and block; or (4) manufacturing other concrete products (except block, brick, and pipe)." .

<L6qGJfXTQTGXU-UETwtrbA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Warehousing and Storage" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=4931> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7dUDKpLyGbaSRzXEWi1qQO> ;
    skos:definition "NULL" .

<MV2uwYKyTTWRi_EzfkOugA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Support Activities for Water Transportation" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=4883> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <3pmohkTOTG2ocnvB6GoceQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in one of the following: (1) operating ports, harbors (including docking and pier facilities), or canals; (2) providing stevedoring and other marine cargo handling services (except warehousing); (3) providing navigational services to shipping; or (4) providing other services to water transportation." .

<NmIMYURUTcetuQgVtrZrwA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Accounting, Tax Preparation, Bookkeeping, and Payroll Services" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=54121> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RB6SCzZbAqqmRhIB6DPk2Kn> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises establishments primarily engaged in providing services, such as auditing of accounting records, designing accounting systems, preparing financial statements, developing budgets, preparing tax returns, processing payrolls, bookkeeping, and billing." ;
    skos:example "Accountants' offices",
        "Bookkeeping services",
        "Payroll processing services",
        "Tax return preparation services" .

<OJe1W2MTTxy1KIsdTSzAOg> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Beverage Manufacturing" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=3121> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <8FwY1QS9TE-QSEn2Mk_U4g> ;
    skos:definition "This industry group comprises establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing soft drinks and ice; purifying and bottling water; and manufacturing brewery, winery, and distillery products." .

<OL-7f0qtQPKcHs9SKsi1DA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Stone Mining and Quarrying" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=21231> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <Pfnjjx26SsKDkbLVMoJtXQ> ;
    skos:definition "This industry comprises (1) establishments primarily engaged in developing the mine site, mining or quarrying dimension stone (i.e., rough blocks and/or slabs of stone), or mining and quarrying crushed and broken stone and/or (2) preparation plants primarily engaged in beneficiating stone (e.g., crushing, grinding, washing, screening, pulverizing, and sizing)." .

<R0D401c6E3b7d715c1eAF69c> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "New Mexico State Courts" ;
    dc:identifier "USCTS-STCOUS-NM" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:locatedIn ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R2DCef58F7b4dC994bbE0cc9> ],
        <R1F4dbe4CD17b3B2a7f15b97> ;
    skos:definition "The New Mexico State Courts refer to the judicial system of the state of New Mexico, including the New Mexico Supreme Court, New Mexico Metropolitan Court, New Mexico Court of Appeals, and New Mexico Magistrate Court." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "NM" ;
    skos:prefLabel "New Mexico State Courts" .

<R0TZk2qCI4HPwDl3e9FoOo> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Human Rights" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <MBw0I7V_Tg2qPFUbCDAxJw> ],
        <R9PYNVVb9kMDcRtGNPADrO5> ;
    skos:altLabel "Basic Human Rights"^^xsd:string,
        "Fundamental Human Rights"^^xsd:string,
        "Inherent Human Rights"^^xsd:string,
        "Rights of the Human Person"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Human rights refer to the fundamental rights and freedoms to which all individuals are inherently entitled, regardless of nationality, sex, ethnicity, religion, or other characteristics. These rights are often upheld by international law and treaties, and they include, but are not limited to, the right to life, liberty, and security of person, as well as freedom from torture and discrimination." ;
    skos:example "Human rights ground opposition to torture and arbitrary detention."^^xsd:string,
        "Human rights protect freedom of religion and conscience."^^xsd:string,
        "Human rights require equal protection of the law."^^xsd:string,
        "Human rights support access to education and basic healthcare."^^xsd:string .

<R129fa536Bfec86E58785540> a owl:Class ;
