    dc:identifier "BCS-PLNS" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBsVax4c8Bdvzok8MTZKGD8> ;
    skos:altLabel "Personal and Laundry Services",
        "Branche für persönliche und Wäschereidienstleistungen"@de-de,
        "Personal and Laundry Services Industry"@en-gb,
        "Industria de servicios personales y de lavandería"@es-es,
        "Industria de servicios personales y de lavandería"@es-mx,
        "Industrie des services personnels et de blanchisserie"@fr-fr,
        "תעשיית שירותי אישי וכביסה"@he-il,
        "व्यक्तिगत और धोबी सेवा उद्योग"@hi-in,
        "個人および洗濯サービス産業"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de serviços pessoais e de lavanderia"@pt-br,
        "个人和洗衣服务行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Industries in the Personal and Laundry Services industry group provide personal and laundry services to individuals, households, and businesses. Services performed include: personal care services; death care services; laundry and dry cleaning services; and a wide range of other personal services, such as pet care (except veterinary) services, photofinishing services, temporary parking services, and dating services.,Industries in the Personal and Laundry Services industry group provide personal and laundry services to individuals, households, and businesses. Services performed include: personal care services; death care services; laundry and drycleaning services; and a wide range of other personal services, such as pet care (except veterinary) services, photofinishing services, temporary parking services, and dating services." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "PLNS" .

