    skos:definition "A climate-based market segment refers to a group of consumers or businesses categorized based on the climatic conditions of their geographical location. This segmentation helps businesses tailor their products, services, and marketing strategies to suit the specific needs and preferences of people living in areas with similar climatic characteristics" ;
    skos:prefLabel "Weather-Based Market Segment" .

<RDP0MNg4nhXIoLECmq0OQrq> a owl:Class ;
