        "Farm Birds" ;
    skos:definition "Poultry refers to domesticated birds raised primarily for their meat, eggs, and feathers. This category includes chickens, turkeys, ducks, and geese, and these birds are integral to agriculture, providing a significant source of protein and other products for human consumption." .

<R85Datx36zz4sBBoEYxCByw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Governmental Representative" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RBQGborh1CfXanGZipDL0Qo> ],
        <R7L5eLIzH0CpOUE74uJvSjL> ;
    skos:definition "A governmental representative is an individual elected or appointed to act on behalf of a larger group of citizens within a governmental system. Examples include presidents, prime ministers, legislators, or council members, each holding specific roles and responsibilities within their respective branches of government." .

<R89e7t0wDXgx7mBu9rn271g> a owl:Class ;
