        "Antitrust - Réclamations horizontales"@fr-fr,
        "אנטיטרוסט - טענות אופקיות"@he-il,
        "एंटीट्रस्ट - समतल दावे"@hi-in,
        "独占禁止法 - 横断的な請求"@ja-jp,
        "Antitruste - Reivindicações horizontais"@pt-br,
        "反垄断 - 水平索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Antitrust - Horizontal Claims refer to legal claims made against companies that engage in anti-competitive behavior with their direct competitors, such as price-fixing or market allocation." .

<R8sIRvD8VHcXHmMNAc5QUlC> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Leguminous Vegetables" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <Rub2xErcJ0t8GToQfoaVG1> ;
    skos:definition "Leguminous vegetables, also known as legumes or pulses, are a category of vegetables from the legume family (Fabaceae), known for their pod-bearing growth habit and nutrient-rich seeds. They are consumed as a protein source in diets worldwide and are valued for their high protein, fiber, vitamin, and mineral content, as well as their role in improving soil fertility through nitrogen fixation." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Legumes" .

<R8sd4v04cEXnzbttN2gUEpV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Vertebrate Animal" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R79xLpY9gRRitoFR3T667If> ;
    skos:altLabel "Vertebrate" ;
    skos:definition "A Vertebrate Animal is a member of the subphylum Vertebrata within the phylum Chordata, characterized by having a backbone or spinal column. Vertebrates include a diverse group of animals such as mammals, birds, reptiles, amphibians, and fish, all of which possess a well-defined internal skeleton and complex organ systems." .

