        "公用事业行业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "This group comprises establishments engaged in the provision of the following utility services: electric power, natural gas, steam supply, and water supply. Within this sector, the specific activities associated with the utility services provided vary by utility: electric power includes generation, transmission, and distribution; natural gas includes distribution; steam supply includes provision and/or distribution; water supply includes treatment and distribution." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "UTL" .

<RBTvzt8uobb19tFbNSYQkFA> a owl:Class ;
