        "Intrusión"@es-es,
        "Intrusión"@es-mx,
        "Violation de propriété"@fr-fr,
        "הפרת גבולות"@he-il,
        "अतिक्रमण"@hi-in,
        "不法侵入"@ja-jp,
        "Invasão de propriedade"@pt-br,
        "非法侵入"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The act of unlawfully entering or interfering with someone else's property, whether it be real property or personal property, resulting in potential liability for the trespasser." .

<RCx52UAWgVQUnCDTQXlxMgU> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Automobile Insurance Policy" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9uTFHGFCMBjtYw5MOmpotJ> ;
    skos:definition "An automobile insurance policy is a contract between a policyholder and an insurance company that provides financial protection against losses arising from accidents, theft, or other events affecting a motor vehicle. The policy specifies the types of coverage included, such as liability, collision, and comprehensive, and requires the payment of premiums to maintain this coverage." .

<RCxI8cqNSzWB8ZAuv6RBHmV> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Proceeding Status" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RDFhtJuTWcY7UZGV9F5yOoA> ],
        <Rx69EnEj3H3TpcgTfUSoYx> ;
    skos:definition "\"Proceeding Status\" refers to the current stage or status of a legal or regulatory process, whether it's a court proceeding or a regulatory proceeding. It signifies whether the proceeding is open, closed, consolidated, inactive, or has had filing fees waived." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Court Case Status" .

<RD3Y189V579xUOPZVOl4bdH> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Acts of the Penitent" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R9jhu7lDqKrv2ybkSS5mgxV> ],
        <RDIlcywwSJazWLKcbP7QyIE> ;
    skos:altLabel "Acts of Penance"^^xsd:string,
        "Acts of the Penitent Person"^^xsd:string,
        "Penitential Acts"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Acts of the Penitent are the interior and exterior actions by which a person disposes himself or herself to receive forgiveness in the Sacrament of Penance. They constitute the sacramental matter through which the penitent cooperates with God’s grace."^^xsd:string .

<RDAtMRi4dBGNW1PytkqmH4t> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Diabetes" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCJElSi1iqsNDc4FSWySKZO> ;
    skos:altLabel "Diabetes Mellitus",
        "Glucose Metabolism Disorder",
        "Hyperglycemia Disorder" ;
    skos:definition "Diabetes is a chronic health condition characterized by high levels of glucose in the blood due to the body's inability to produce or effectively use insulin. It requires ongoing management through lifestyle changes, medication, and regular monitoring to prevent complications." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Diabetes Mellitus" .

<RDETD6YVYGhLGZbM1fBnsfj> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Incapacity" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R8ASw8Dgh6TE62ku8oMci5u> ],
        <RCzs34uEQI9f4cuWp3bQO0P> ;
    skos:altLabel "Lack of Capacity",
        "Lack of Capacity to Sue",
        "Lack of Capacity to be Sued",
        "Inkrafttreten"@de-de,
        "Incapacity"@en-gb,
        "Incapacidad"@es-es,
        "Incapacidad"@es-mx,
        "Incapacité"@fr-fr,
        "חוסר יכולת"@he-il,
        "अक्षमता"@hi-in,
        "無能力"@ja-jp,
        "Incapacidade"@pt-br,
        "无能力"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Incapacity encompasses various conditions that hinder an individual's ability to perform tasks, make decisions, or engage in activities due to physical limitations, cognitive impairments, or emotional challenges. These incapacities may have legal implications in different contexts, such as determining a person's competence, granting accommodations under disability laws, or assessing decision-making abilities in family or mental health-related cases." .

<RDFhtJuTWcY7UZGV9F5yOoA> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Legal Dispute Events"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7O9EXc5CO83M0CzT8VzNFT>,
        <R7kjCtMcpEem6IjJRJ3OWju> ;
    skos:altLabel "Streitigkeiten Ereignisse"@de-de,
        "Événements de litige"@fr-fr,
        "紛争イベント"@ja-jp,
        "Eventos de disputa"@pt-br,
        "争议事件"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Legal Dispute Events refer to the various stages and actions that occur during a legal disagreement between parties, including but not limited to negotiations, mediations, and arbitrations."^^xsd:string .

<RDIuHPBKs3x9tZ0vRBJ76AI> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Procedural Claims" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R8jYAnNATrfoBxAtIKpf72X> ;
    skos:altLabel "Verfahrensansprüche"@de-de,
        "Procedural Claims"@en-gb,
        "Reclamaciones Procesales"@es-es,
        "Reclamaciones Procesales"@es-mx,
        "Revendications procédurales"@fr-fr,
        "תביעות תהליכיות"@he-il,
        "प्रक्रियात्मक दावे"@hi-in,
        "手続き上の請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicações processuais"@pt-br,
        "程序性要求"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Procedural Claims are legal claims that relate to the process of a lawsuit, such as jurisdiction, venue, or intervention, rather than the substantive issues of the case." .

<RDJM7d52FqDzFaBbtRdhECs> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Limitations" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RCzs34uEQI9f4cuWp3bQO0P> ;
    skos:altLabel "Einschränkungen"@de-de,
        "Limitations"@en-gb,
        "Limitaciones"@es-es,
        "Limitaciones"@es-mx,
        "Limitations"@fr-fr,
        "הגבלות"@he-il,
        "सीमाएं"@hi-in,
        "制限"@ja-jp,
        "Limitações"@pt-br,
        "限制"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The concept of Limitations refers to the legal time constraints that restrict the period within which a party can bring a claim or defense in a civil litigation matter, including statutes of repose, frauds, and limitations, equitable tolling, and laches." .

<RDJkQMNK5utxd5sRAmWPnUw> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Devotional Practice" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBypJHdXoQQwqYlG95KCDCQ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Act of Devotion"^^xsd:string,
        "Devotion"^^xsd:string,
        "Pious Practice"^^xsd:string,
        "Popular Devotion"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "A Devotional Practice is a non-sacramental act of prayer or piety that expresses and nurtures the faith of the faithful. It complements the liturgy by fostering personal and communal devotion without possessing the public, normative character of liturgical worship."^^xsd:string .

<RDKGeTDagCQ714D5C4sASPP> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Anxiety and Obsessive-Compulsive Disorders" ;
    dc:source <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/12.00-MentalDisorders-Adult.htm#12_00B1>,
        <https://www.ssa.gov/disability/professionals/bluebook/12.00-MentalDisorders-Adult.htm#12_06> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RN3TubQIlusDFnPgrNAk8D> ;
    skos:definition "Anxiety and Obsessive-Compulsive Disorders are characterized by excessive anxiety, worry, apprehension, and fear, or by avoidance of feelings, thoughts, activities, objects, places, or people.  Symptoms and signs may include restlessness, difficulty concentrating, hyper-vigilance, muscle tension, sleep disturbance, fatigue, panic attacks, obsessions and compulsions, constant thoughts and fears about safety, and frequent physical complaints." .

<RDKm1RXP9FfvhLzWjynAfpS> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Remedies in Property Law" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RDbz1PVc6y57oOb9jAIl0eN> ;
    skos:definition "Remedies in Property Law are legal actions or procedures used to enforce property rights and resolve disputes over property ownership or possession. Each remedy (e.g., foreclosure, seizure, attachment) serves to protect the interests of the property holder or creditor and is governed by specific laws and regulations." .

<RDNsW4JqaHcQ9KPtpXLzCPc> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Requirements for Public Benefits" ;
    rdfs:comment "From LIST: Legal Issues Taxonomy — https://taxonomy.legal/" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R79ZRcChNA1jEORJLsPWYSv> ;
    skos:definition "Requirements for public benefits refer to the conditions or activities that an individual or family must fulfill to qualify for or continue receiving financial assistance or services from a government program. These can include mandates for job searches, participation in educational or vocational training programs, or completion of specific plans aimed at improving self-sufficiency. Failure to meet these requirements may result in reduction, suspension, or termination of benefits." .

<RDOQpX5t5sVf55UPK2CfZTy> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Human Trafficking" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7MbuFEaL6NyU9tM2AXk7lk> ;
    skos:definition "A \"Human Trafficking Claim\" pertains to the allegation or assertion that individuals have been recruited, transported, harbored, or received, often through force, coercion, or deception, for the purpose of exploitation. Such claims challenge violations of human rights and can encompass various forms of exploitation including, but not limited to, forced labor, sexual exploitation, and organ trafficking." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Exploitation" .

<RDQC6BrYjcS3V0gZcYzqc8O> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Normative Concepts (e.g., Ethics, Morals, Laws)"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:altLabel "Norm-Governing Concepts"^^xsd:string,
        "Normative Categories"^^xsd:string,
        "Normative Classifications"^^xsd:string,
        "Prescriptive Concepts"^^xsd:string ;
    skos:definition "Normative Concepts are concepts that express binding or guiding “ought” claims that shape belief, worship, conduct, or governance. They include doctrines, moral norms, and  rules that obligate assent, obedience, or disciplined conformity according to their authority and scope."^^xsd:string .

<RDR8hWYIaoudg2qZmCbzto6> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Breach of Employment Contract" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <R85VD0QLNj5oGW4LrvZ8p86> ],
        <RC2fjcpsEbrVvVymvt4oASx>,
        <RCty0MaQzrLC9KnzjM7nMER> ;
    skos:altLabel "Verstoß gegen den Arbeitsvertrag"@de-de,
        "Breach of Employment Contract"@en-gb,
        "Incumplimiento de contrato laboral"@es-es,
        "Incumplimiento de contrato de trabajo"@es-mx,
        "Violation du contrat de travail"@fr-fr,
        "הפרת חוזה עסקה עובדת"@he-il,
        "रोजगार अनुबंध का उल्लंघन"@hi-in,
        "雇用契約違反"@ja-jp,
        "Violação do contrato de trabalho"@pt-br,
        "违反雇佣合同"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Breach of Employment Contract is a violation of the terms and conditions agreed upon by an employer and employee, resulting in legal claims and potential damages." .

<RDdZDW8VIPVbM8gI4n7Ippf> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Article 2 Claim" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R7MGQ9xUx0PxGLp5yxprdpZ> ;
    skos:altLabel "Article II Claim",
        "Anspruch nach Artikel 2"@de-de,
        "Article 2 Claim"@en-gb,
        "Reclamación del artículo 2"@es-es,
        "Reclamación del artículo 2"@es-mx,
        "Demande en vertu de l'article 2"@fr-fr,
        "תביעת סעיף 2"@he-il,
        "अनुच्छेद 2 दावा"@hi-in,
        "第2条請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicação do Artigo 2"@pt-br,
        "第2条索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "An Article II claim refers to a legal assertion grounded in the provisions of Article II of the U.S. Constitution, which defines the powers and responsibilities of the Executive Branch, primarily the President. A claim could arise when there's a dispute over the interpretation or application of these powers, including issues related to executive orders, presidential authority, or the conduct of foreign affairs." .

<RDeWjTZogrlt1XvduSP1R8s> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Spousal Support" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
            owl:onProperty rdfs:seeAlso ;
            owl:someValuesFrom <RCUXzL8Z4Ddh2CK6TBhofjU> ],
        <RB2CEA5hNfHnNl8DMKIfK5F>,
        <RBOczjtsHXQh2ojzTubbrxI> ;
    skos:altLabel "Ehegattenunterhalt"@de-de,
        "Spousal Maintenance"@en-gb,
        "Manutención conyugal"@es-es,
        "Pensión alimenticia para el cónyuge"@es-mx,
        "Pension alimentaire pour conjoint"@fr-fr,
        "תמיכה בניידות בני זוג"@he-il,
        "पति या पत्नी का सहारा"@hi-in,
        "配偶扶養費"@ja-jp,
        "Pensão alimentícia para cônjuge"@pt-br,
        "配偶赡养费"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Spousal support refers to the financial assistance provided by one spouse to the other after separation or divorce, typically to maintain the standard of living established during the marriage." ;
    skos:prefLabel "Alimony" .

<RDgZFYp1iCuW1Tod7uoMWjE> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Non-Hearsay Out-of-Court Statement Objective" ;
    dc:source "Fed. R. Evid. 801(a)" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <R9yi9EljTLvrh7N74L460ye> ;
    skos:definition "A Non-Hearsay Out-of-Court Statement Objective refers to a purpose for admitting an out-of-court statement into evidence that does not rely on the truth of the content of the statement itself. This includes statements not offered for the truth of the matter asserted, nonassertive conduct, non-propositions, verbal acts, and \"statements\" made by a declarant that is not a person, such as a machine or device." .

<RDnLOdTNWmEc4EhZ0SZXDm7> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Judge" ;
    dc:identifier "JUDG" ;
    rdfs:subClassOf [ a owl:Restriction ;
