        "比较过失责任"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A legal theory that allows for the apportionment of damages between parties based on their respective degrees of fault or negligence in causing harm or injury." .

<RuKmOKRLQQDzqibBjh1OVm> a owl:Class ;
