        "पशु दावे"@hi-in,
        "動物の請求"@ja-jp,
        "Reivindicações animais"@pt-br,
        "动物索赔"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Animal Claims refer to legal claims related to harm caused by or to animals, including liability for injury to pets, cruelty to animals, animal attacks, trespassing livestock causing harm, dangerous domesticated animals, injury caused by wild animals, and negligent handling of animals." .

<R8qItBwG2pRMFhUq1HQEMnb> a owl:Class ;
