        "Reclamação de compensação de trabalhadores"@pt-br,
        "工人赔偿申请"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "A Workers' Compensation Claim is a legal claim made by an employee seeking benefits for injuries or illnesses that occurred in the course of their employment." .

