        "撤销"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "Rescission is the act of canceling or voiding a contract, typically due to factors such as duress, unconscionability, or fraud, and is a type of equitable relief available in contract and quasi-contract claims." .

<RDgLz1KvQn0YL8W61rW55T4> a owl:Class ;
