    rdfs:subClassOf <R70EVLsDqbyH67OcMFU5d1p> ;
    skos:altLabel "Edible Fruit Plants",
        "Fruit-Bearing Plants" ;
    skos:definition "Fruit crops are plants cultivated primarily for their edible fruits, which are consumed fresh, processed, or used in various food products. These crops contribute significantly to human nutrition, providing essential vitamins, minerals, and dietary fiber." .

