    skos:definition "Slip-and-Fall Negligence refers to a legal claim made by an individual who has suffered a personal injury due to the negligence of a property owner or occupier in maintaining safe conditions on their premises, specifically related to slipping or falling." .

<R731bb1FD96e6725c1113315> a owl:Class ;
