        "判決の執行"@ja-jp,
        "Execução da sentença"@pt-br,
        "执行判决"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The enforcement of judgment refers to the legal process of ensuring that a court's decision is carried out, often through methods such as seizing assets or placing liens on property." .

<R9tZFXPrXQJWHbqSgtCQxJF> a owl:Class ;
