        "公共行政産業"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de Administração Pública"@pt-br,
        "公共行政产业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition "The Public Administration industry group consists of establishments of federal, state, and local government agencies that administer, oversee, and manage public programs and have executive, legislative, or judicial authority over other institutions within a given area. These agencies also set policy, create laws, adjudicate civil and criminal legal cases, provide for public safety and for national defense." ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "PUB" .

<RC5bITZZ0taJOXwcwS314VU> a owl:Class ;
