<RCaeZbTg74NX3xyNzskpVH8> a owl:Class ;
    rdfs:label "Food Manufacturing Industry" ;
    dc:identifier "MFG-FDBV" ;
    rdfs:isDefinedBy <https://www.naics.com/six-digit-naics/?code=311> ;
    rdfs:subClassOf <RBOjgvcq6Z33XxMhTxWiiDS> ;
    skos:altLabel "Food and Beverage Manufacturing",
        "Lebensmittel- und Getränkeherstellungsindustrie"@de-de,
        "Food and Beverage Manufacturing Industry"@en-gb,
        "Industria de fabricación de alimentos y bebidas"@es-es,
        "Industria de fabricación de alimentos y bebidas"@es-mx,
        "Industrie de la fabrication d'aliments et de boissons"@fr-fr,
        "תעשיית ייצור מזון ומשקאות"@he-il,
        "खाद्य और पेय विनिर्माण उद्योग"@hi-in,
        "食品飲料製造業"@ja-jp,
        "Indústria de fabricação de alimentos e bebidas"@pt-br,
        "食品和饮料制造业"@zh-cn ;
    skos:definition """Industries in the Food Manufacturing subsector transform livestock and agricultural products into products for intermediate or final consumption.  The industry groups are distinguished by the raw materials (generally of animal or vegetable origin) processed into food products.

The food products manufactured in these establishments are typically sold to wholesalers or retailers for distribution to consumers, but establishments primarily engaged in retailing bakery and candy products made on the premises not for immediate consumption are included.

Establishments primarily engaged in manufacturing beverages are classified in Subsector 312, Beverage and Tobacco Product Manufacturing.""" ;
    skos:hiddenLabel "FDBV" .

